          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "for me to go on about this is like welcome from me. So as an intro, I would say, yeah, hi guys.",
          "timestamp_start": 62.120000000000005,
          "timestamp_end": 69.86,
          "duration_seconds": 7.739999999999995
        },
        {
          "id": "f51237cd-3350-43f0-8f05-2adf37cd0e59",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 11,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Thanks for watching. My name is Aditya. You can, I'm sure Taran will put all my Twitter and other",
          "timestamp_start": 69.86,
          "timestamp_end": 76.44,
          "duration_seconds": 6.579999999999998
        },
        {
