          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and control engineering. And I am a contractor for various companies that try to hold workshops and",
          "timestamp_start": 98.92,
          "timestamp_end": 106.03999999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 7.11999999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "b6e658bb-3d3e-4033-b931-770455120ecb",
