      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "86fb0e92-c726-498d-a447-25baca1a704c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 23,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Why don't we start with something much before college, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 135.79999999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 140.27999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 4.47999999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "d6818b64-3f44-4028-a1f3-668f05d5b7e6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 24,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like what were you like as a kid?",
          "timestamp_start": 140.27999999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 142.38,
          "duration_seconds": 2.1000000000000227
        },
        {
          "id": "d43cd682-e416-452b-aa6f-5abcdb54c8ba",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 25,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What were you into in middle school, high school?",
          "timestamp_start": 142.64,
          "timestamp_end": 145.17999999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 2.539999999999992
        },
        {
          "id": "25cba7cc-b246-4729-89e3-00ee8fcc5a2f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 26,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 146.67999999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 146.89999999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 0.21999999999999886
        },
        {
          "id": "5f3b50bd-2a95-4e51-841f-0e393ffd59e9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 27,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I mean, the story is like insane because a lot of people don't believe this.",
          "timestamp_start": 146.89999999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 151.42,
          "duration_seconds": 4.52000000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "4fee1643-18bc-47f0-8d42-a2db474885ec",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 28,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like people have known me at least in the last few years, have a certain image of me.",
          "timestamp_start": 151.88,
          "timestamp_end": 156.23999999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 4.359999999999985
        },
        {
          "id": "747e43d0-042d-4b3f-ba97-e37e7c6a90c3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 29,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But as you might have imagined, like I've changed a lot over the years and I was actually",
          "timestamp_start": 156.76,
          "timestamp_end": 161.5,
          "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "969da0be-81a8-43b0-aacb-7179b1c5b301",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 30,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "very good at studies when i was a kid i was like there's one memory i have of in 10th grade going",
          "timestamp_start": 161.5,
          "timestamp_end": 168.22,
          "duration_seconds": 6.719999999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "3a0a9892-c7b2-4686-835d-e45553ce01ae",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 31,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to the temple and praying to god and people who know me as a very scientific guy and very",
          "timestamp_start": 168.22,
          "timestamp_end": 173.74,
          "duration_seconds": 5.52000000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "d06a9761-7f5d-4c92-b8a5-89c51d01cdf8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 32,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "rationalist already the image is breaking right and i was just hoping to pass the 10th exams you",
          "timestamp_start": 173.74,
          "timestamp_end": 179.58,
          "duration_seconds": 5.840000000000003
        },
        {
          "id": "fe4abaad-c668-40e8-96c4-563f9bd8b1ae",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 33,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "know i didn't even want to get a good score i was like please let me not fail can you imagine that",
          "timestamp_start": 179.58,
          "timestamp_end": 185.1,
          "duration_seconds": 5.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "0cd2f458-f1d3-4fc4-bbe9-611a9831527d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 34,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "was how my childhood was because i was really bad at languages i wasn't good at memorizing",
          "timestamp_start": 185.1,
          "timestamp_end": 190.94,
          "duration_seconds": 5.840000000000003
        },
        {
          "id": "c30b750d-d571-4173-87dc-94b2694cb870",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 35,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the grammar of sanskrit and hindi uh i used to read a lot of books though i was a",
          "timestamp_start": 190.94,
          "timestamp_end": 198.7,
          "duration_seconds": 7.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "27f2dd9e-365d-40c0-a63c-b0d0e8abf70a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 36,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "avid reader of fiction so my uncle gave i used to sit indoors and read for example i don't know",
          "timestamp_start": 198.7,
          "timestamp_end": 206.38,
          "duration_seconds": 7.680000000000007
        },
        {
          "id": "599793d7-22f2-4918-b094-745a8eaa1c89",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 37,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "if you know about this book called war and peace by leotard style yeah so it's a big ass book right",
          "timestamp_start": 206.38,
          "timestamp_end": 211.74,
          "duration_seconds": 5.360000000000014
        },
        {
          "id": "6d8b550e-5646-447f-9c07-81296104135f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 38,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and i finished the whole book like in a few weeks and i was in fifth grade sixth grade and i was so",
          "timestamp_start": 211.74,
          "timestamp_end": 216.78,
          "duration_seconds": 5.039999999999992
        },
        {
          "id": "32215f68-cdcc-440f-ad40-4db0f702bcc1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 39,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "young back then. I used to read all the classics, Count of Monte Cristo, The Three Musketeers.",
          "timestamp_start": 216.78,
          "timestamp_end": 223.18,
          "duration_seconds": 6.400000000000006
        },
        {
          "id": "20ae9aa4-d54d-4354-a63b-65a448e34ff4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 40,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I loved all these kind of books. I read everything. I finished almost the entire",
          "timestamp_start": 224.14000000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 228.14,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9999999999999716
        },
        {
          "id": "f2921a6e-519b-4608-9e88-5520c9b7ea35",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 41,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "children's library. So my childhood was pretty interesting. So if you go back in",
          "timestamp_start": 228.14,
          "timestamp_end": 233.26,
          "duration_seconds": 5.1200000000000045
        },
        {
          "id": "90363649-4732-4e15-b738-4eee993adc59",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 42,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "fourth grade or fifth grade, I was in a boarding school in Ooty. I was staying by myself there. So",
          "timestamp_start": 235.66,
          "timestamp_end": 241.26,
          "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999994
        },
        {
          "id": "1b2b0d46-3afb-43bd-b989-44c09614df4f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 43,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "we learned how to be independent. They taught us a lot of cool stuff like sculpturing, horse riding,",
          "timestamp_start": 241.26,
          "timestamp_end": 246.62,
          "duration_seconds": 5.360000000000014
        },
        {
          "id": "a8976b6e-6e33-472d-a19f-92d32488984a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 44,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and things like that.",
          "timestamp_start": 246.78,
          "timestamp_end": 248.06,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2800000000000011
        },
        {
          "id": "be290fcd-9f67-4e2f-9772-d6c7a8908ed0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 45,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, it's called St. Lawrence.",
          "timestamp_start": 250.78,
          "timestamp_end": 252.08,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3000000000000114
        },
        {
          "id": "3faeabea-44ad-4448-ae6a-d7674b5fb222",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 46,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's in Lovedale.",
          "timestamp_start": 252.26,
          "timestamp_end": 252.78,
          "duration_seconds": 0.5200000000000102
        },
        {
          "id": "6de9cecc-1654-4dba-91f2-8ec673d3c788",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 47,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I had an experience of studying in a",
          "timestamp_start": 253.04,
          "timestamp_end": 254.86,
          "duration_seconds": 1.8200000000000216
        },
        {
          "id": "b2bf7ed9-b54d-4119-8959-72e2cbae5b0d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 48,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "quite posh, you know,",
          "timestamp_start": 254.86,
          "timestamp_end": 256.64,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
        },
        {
          "id": "c3a71e29-b6b9-446c-9240-c896473b47e7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 49,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "they make you wear blazers",
          "timestamp_start": 256.72,
          "timestamp_end": 258.5,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
        },
        {
          "id": "1f9e15fa-7120-4fc0-b279-cc48590e5069",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 50,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and this.",
          "timestamp_start": 258.5,
          "timestamp_end": 259.84,
          "duration_seconds": 1.339999999999975
        },
        {
          "id": "0466ffa7-74c2-49fd-a651-94b1a0897268",
