          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "there.",
          "timestamp_start": 262.9,
          "timestamp_end": 263.2,
          "duration_seconds": 0.30000000000001137
        },
        {
          "id": "8bd3066c-1fc3-435a-abdf-5d7f17eb5f7b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 53,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I think 4th and 5th was like that.",
          "timestamp_start": 264.5,
          "timestamp_end": 266.26,
          "duration_seconds": 1.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "dab040bf-b02d-4ee0-bd4c-b5b30e5fc960",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 54,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Then my mom",
          "timestamp_start": 267.88,
          "timestamp_end": 268.78,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8999999999999773
        },
        {
          "id": "d2de4486-1242-4aa2-b110-10d7ea2e3770",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 55,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "was like, what is this?",
          "timestamp_start": 268.78,
          "timestamp_end": 269.84,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0600000000000023
        },
        {
          "id": "22e2658c-ae7f-4b5d-9298-0f315f5add0b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 56,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, sorry, what did you ask?",
          "timestamp_start": 270.48,
          "timestamp_end": 271.5,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0199999999999818
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "Why don't we start with something much before college, right?",
