      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "d52629b1-665f-4293-b719-1665541b98f4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 57,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I said, what about later, like after 4th?",
          "timestamp_start": 271.98,
          "timestamp_end": 273.98,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "a4517def-0673-41da-8447-711ec7579d13",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 58,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, then my mom was like,",
          "timestamp_start": 274.88,
          "timestamp_end": 276.4,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "46c79c71-1098-4d34-a0d1-144e135df21b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 59,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "what is this my mom and dad was like having an argument about how my dad wanted to give me the",
          "timestamp_start": 276.4,
          "timestamp_end": 280.79999999999995,
          "duration_seconds": 4.399999999999977
        },
        {
          "id": "87f059f7-6bf0-49be-89d7-08cd6b3fdf46",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 60,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "best education possible right like he wanted to give me he asked me he didn't even put me in",
          "timestamp_start": 280.79999999999995,
          "timestamp_end": 284.88,
          "duration_seconds": 4.080000000000041
        },
        {
          "id": "b9ecf8f1-8076-4de8-98aa-1e830383f6b6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 61,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "boarding school he took both me and my sister and showed me the college and school and asked if i",
          "timestamp_start": 284.88,
          "timestamp_end": 289.76,
          "duration_seconds": 4.8799999999999955
        },
        {
          "id": "bd8c050b-7c6b-43f5-9fd8-fe475ab4b670",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 62,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "wanted to study there and i said yes she said no and it was my choice at that age to think about",
          "timestamp_start": 289.76,
          "timestamp_end": 296,
          "duration_seconds": 6.240000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "dbc568af-48ba-4da3-8dba-f875b0e9d57d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 63,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the big campus we have like cross country running we have karate class we learned logo programming",
          "timestamp_start": 296,
          "timestamp_end": 302.96,
          "duration_seconds": 6.9599999999999795
        },
        {
          "id": "6b3fee81-6e12-41b7-9880-b262836039b3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 64,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "we had a lot of interesting opportunities there my english became so good because i was introduced",
          "timestamp_start": 302.96,
          "timestamp_end": 308.4,
          "duration_seconds": 5.439999999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "952cdd63-b392-48be-a300-95b9ec1ec726",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 65,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to english at a very young age but we had to speak english to other people unlike a state's",
          "timestamp_start": 308.4,
          "timestamp_end": 313.35999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 4.9599999999999795
        },
        {
          "id": "d542da48-0542-455f-b741-e2e52c91b590",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 66,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "medium school but after like fifth grade my mom was like anyway he will leave us after",
          "timestamp_start": 313.35999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 318.08,
          "duration_seconds": 4.720000000000027
        },
        {
          "id": "72d84f65-a043-4b3a-9737-64ee0f1ae5de",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 67,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "12th or whatever so i want to spend time with my son so he took she took me back to palakkad so i",
          "timestamp_start": 319.03999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 326.64,
          "duration_seconds": 7.600000000000023
        },
        {
          "id": "9e01d3a3-3a95-4e61-bf4a-c0b316bf892a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 68,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I spent my, since seventh onwards, I was in Lions School in Palakkad till my 10th.",
          "timestamp_start": 326.64,
          "timestamp_end": 334.64,
          "duration_seconds": 8
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "I said, what about later, like after 4th?",
