          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "it's usually uh like that right yeah i i read a lot of sci-fi i mean for sure you know asimov and",
