        ]
      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "b2926435-344a-4e27-9009-9856a8425bca",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 168,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Nice. So when did you like switch into... what got you interested into AI, right? AI safety.",
          "timestamp_start": 700.6,
          "timestamp_end": 708.52,
          "duration_seconds": 7.919999999999959
        },
        {
          "id": "250008bb-ed05-4f6d-b6a5-b8ac34548c08",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 169,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What led... what was the path that you took that you think led to you working in AI and AI safety?",
          "timestamp_start": 708.52,
          "timestamp_end": 716.2,
          "duration_seconds": 7.680000000000064
        },
        {
          "id": "15ad3ed8-af49-4f4e-ab8f-819defdaf83c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 170,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think it started with, uh, in around second, third year of my undergrad.",
          "timestamp_start": 718.76,
          "timestamp_end": 724.52,
          "duration_seconds": 5.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "50c8a62a-ae7c-401a-bee2-23385b9fe530",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 171,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I went to undergrad in NIT Trichy and even then I was quite like studying Laplace",
          "timestamp_start": 724.52,
          "timestamp_end": 730.46,
          "duration_seconds": 5.940000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "19ef9bb1-5cbc-4c45-98a8-77420b99acf2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 172,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "transformations for a year, learning linear algebra, being fascinated with mathematics",
          "timestamp_start": 730.46,
          "timestamp_end": 735,
          "duration_seconds": 4.539999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "11d4947d-6cca-4a75-81c7-7d62c66bd249",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 173,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and physics.",
          "timestamp_start": 735,
          "timestamp_end": 736,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "07aee225-a036-42b3-96e7-27ffc904bb70",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 174,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And, uh, even my high school also, I was in Maharishi international residential school",
          "timestamp_start": 736,
          "timestamp_end": 741.06,
          "duration_seconds": 5.059999999999945
        },
        {
          "id": "c1db93cf-cee3-4ddb-9754-4047d9c83329",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 175,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in Sri Parambathur.",
          "timestamp_start": 741.06,
          "timestamp_end": 742.06,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "3b34441c-0a5e-4851-b7cc-1debf4fb7008",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 176,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It was mostly Feynman and physics stuff, but the shift towards AI, so I was mostly physics",
          "timestamp_start": 742.06,
          "timestamp_end": 746.86,
          "duration_seconds": 4.800000000000068
        },
        {
          "id": "8b0e66ff-347f-42f1-b137-3e98947c6cb7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 177,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "oriented kind of person.",
          "timestamp_start": 746.86,
          "timestamp_end": 747.86,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "0a473889-cadc-4b87-800e-8a762f955049",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 178,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like i like i like the quantum mechanics and black holes and that kind of cosmology what is the shape",
          "timestamp_start": 747.86,
          "timestamp_end": 755.94,
          "duration_seconds": 8.080000000000041
        },
        {
          "id": "dd300ca8-a218-48b6-b6a9-434ed53eb811",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 179,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "what is the shape of the universe is the flat or curvature universe will the universe go with a big",
          "timestamp_start": 755.94,
          "timestamp_end": 762.1,
          "duration_seconds": 6.159999999999968
        },
        {
          "id": "768b7ed6-da88-4808-9f3b-0ff7bc41712f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 180,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "bang or a big crunch how will the end look like i think my questions that fascinated me mostly was",
          "timestamp_start": 762.1,
          "timestamp_end": 767.78,
          "duration_seconds": 5.67999999999995
        },
        {
          "id": "32a0f47e-529b-4225-bd84-83af6995b363",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 181,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "those questions right and then it was around when i went to so in in undergraduate of my college i",
          "timestamp_start": 767.78,
          "timestamp_end": 776.1800000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 8.400000000000091
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "Nice. So when did you like switch into... what got you interested into AI, right? AI safety.",
