      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "2a2c46bb-d8c8-40bc-a8f7-44eec1a8182e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 258,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And, and this is even more insidious because we all have this real belief that, oh, I can do whatever I like.",
          "timestamp_start": 1018.32,
          "timestamp_end": 1025.2,
          "duration_seconds": 6.8799999999999955
        },
        {
          "id": "ab6a2b09-84fa-4158-8d47-846c0391f4da",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 259,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like I have free will.",
          "timestamp_start": 1025.24,
          "timestamp_end": 1026.06,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8199999999999363
        },
        {
          "id": "6e31694b-ec2f-4c2d-9740-e15f827ab977",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 260,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right.",
          "timestamp_start": 1026.06,
          "timestamp_end": 1026.3,
          "duration_seconds": 0.2400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "fe249670-dcd4-4080-a583-ce200684bcbb",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 261,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And we have buttons that we can push.",
          "timestamp_start": 1026.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1028.3400000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 2.040000000000191
        },
        {
          "id": "f57b12f4-14a7-48d5-b684-8b2fbfec295b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 262,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "If a person who's very charismatic tells you the right words and knows your weaknesses and makes you feel fear or they can make you vote a certain way or they can make you buy something.",
          "timestamp_start": 1028.3600000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1037.52,
          "duration_seconds": 9.159999999999854
        },
        {
          "id": "59a6a28b-66bb-469a-9dec-b68490bd5c2d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 263,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "so good sales people exist good politicians exist there have been ideologies and cults that have",
          "timestamp_start": 1037.52,
          "timestamp_end": 1042.48,
          "duration_seconds": 4.960000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "47fc1ae7-746c-45ed-9aff-a2c9624689f4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 264,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "been formed in the past and i was seeing this trend towards uh data being given freely and",
          "timestamp_start": 1042.48,
          "timestamp_end": 1050,
          "duration_seconds": 7.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "af33f2c2-de82-4d4f-848f-08340a24206b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 265,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "people not realizing how valuable their own data was so i got into data science and interested in",
          "timestamp_start": 1050,
          "timestamp_end": 1055.68,
          "duration_seconds": 5.680000000000064
        },
        {
          "id": "61bf04a3-a1d0-4368-8385-3100cdf9efc8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 266,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that from the perspective of that so around colleges when i started thinking about the",
          "timestamp_start": 1055.68,
          "timestamp_end": 1059.12,
          "duration_seconds": 3.439999999999827
        },
        {
          "id": "e4494677-fffd-4ebe-b6db-59b9e9d2427e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 267,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "question of free will i was thinking about what does it mean is the world deterministic is the",
          "timestamp_start": 1059.12,
          "timestamp_end": 1063.76,
          "duration_seconds": 4.6400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "999199a0-89e2-4bf7-b68a-c2bec57e55dd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 268,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the world chaotic? Is it quantum randomness? How does mechanistically, how is free will really",
          "timestamp_start": 1063.76,
          "timestamp_end": 1069.16,
          "duration_seconds": 5.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "7c6be6ea-e730-49ba-ac48-6113640ddbdd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 269,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "implemented in the brain? Right. And what are the consequences of these beliefs? So I think that is",
          "timestamp_start": 1069.16,
          "timestamp_end": 1074.9,
          "duration_seconds": 5.740000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "891bbe40-62e6-40c8-bf2b-5ee8efaf780e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 270,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "kind of where I was really concerned about the trend where software eating the world kind of",
          "timestamp_start": 1074.9,
          "timestamp_end": 1079.8,
          "duration_seconds": 4.899999999999864
        },
        {
          "id": "8184f416-bb69-4119-bc43-9a0d8404b5ea",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 271,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "thing is happening where we have a lot more interfaces between us and the world. It's like,",
          "timestamp_start": 1079.8,
          "timestamp_end": 1084.72,
          "duration_seconds": 4.920000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "71657220-d132-42e6-9987-58d25cece132",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 272,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I'm talking to you through an application. I'm deciding my sleep schedule based on my watch,",
          "timestamp_start": 1084.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1090.1,
          "duration_seconds": 5.379999999999882
        },
        {
          "id": "58d65b97-6ff1-4fb1-aeaa-5b28ca7e4e1d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 273,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "which is tracking my what do you call sleep and my exercise and when i was running yesterday it",
          "timestamp_start": 1090.1,
          "timestamp_end": 1095.2199999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 5.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "4cb8c80e-2097-43c0-9351-1797e13aa050",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 274,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "used to like keep beeping telling me i'm not running fast enough and i felt like a like a",
          "timestamp_start": 1095.2199999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 1099.3799999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 4.160000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "4252f0d4-d0eb-4c19-92f8-8637e698567d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 275,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "what do you call that like a chain animal you know like the robot is literally like run faster run",
          "timestamp_start": 1099.3799999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1104.74,
          "duration_seconds": 5.360000000000127
        },
        {
          "id": "e197020a-7c05-47bb-9767-0844f5ba3591",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 276,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
