      "id": "demo-m12",
      "node_name": "Stanford widened the intellectual circle",
      "summary": "Aditya recalls meeting technically trained people who also engaged with psychology, politics, and philosophy. He contrasts this with the narrower education and insulation from politics he associates with privileged Indian engineering circles.",
      "semantic_level": 1,
      "level": 1,
