      "node_name": "What could Indian universities borrow?",
      "summary": "The interviewer asks for concrete institutional improvements. Aditya proposes interdisciplinary contact, stronger industry relationships, internships, and feedback between theory and practical projects.",
      "semantic_level": 1,
