      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "72f041c9-b993-42cb-8971-1d298c637e43",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 304,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So that's going to be my next question, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1224.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1226.8600000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 2.1400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "bb1a42c7-6fe9-4ec8-8960-d92a562635d8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 305,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Since you had exposure in the U.S. and in one of the top universities in the world,",
          "timestamp_start": 1226.92,
          "timestamp_end": 1231.74,
          "duration_seconds": 4.819999999999936
        },
        {
          "id": "5b679e52-2ee9-4ab8-bc8d-e3011ade61c8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 306,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "what do you think that you can kind of implement from U.S. universities in India, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1232.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1239.52,
          "duration_seconds": 6.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "a4464cb0-c507-456d-9047-43775f4c712b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 307,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like what kind of differences did you see besides like the holistic education?",
          "timestamp_start": 1239.52,
          "timestamp_end": 1244.82,
          "duration_seconds": 5.2999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "334c8cdd-c27e-4b6f-8a08-ed1f0511849b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 308,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like do you find any specific improvements that can be implemented in like colleges in India, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1246.38,
          "timestamp_end": 1254.44,
          "duration_seconds": 8.059999999999945
        },
        {
          "id": "ce8ae722-9b6a-4c4f-9d4f-4e0bf93db551",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 309,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "which can be either realistic or something grand.",
          "timestamp_start": 1254.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1257.04,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3199999999999363
        },
        {
          "id": "87a4660b-4c5a-4730-b8e8-787143e499bd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 310,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I really love the idea of universities in the sense of not colleges but like having this",
          "timestamp_start": 1258.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1265.04,
          "duration_seconds": 6.319999999999936
        },
        {
          "id": "56156e00-2080-40ce-afca-254ea5f54c88",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 311,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "cross-pollination of like an IISC also is a university in the sense that we have",
          "timestamp_start": 1265.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1269.04,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "60b36864-61a6-455a-a844-d991e9672909",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 312,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "humanities departments, we have biologists, we have fundamental science students and we have",
          "timestamp_start": 1269.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1273.3600000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 4.320000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "81b474c2-bd2b-4e1e-b757-0ed5beb0d9f6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 313,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "engineers. So IIT or IITs I think suffer from not having the same... I don't know if there's a thing",
          "timestamp_start": 1273.3600000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1281.1200000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 7.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "f65e2823-4fd3-49cc-ada5-de8fe0895b08",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 314,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "called the college town is a phenomenon where oxford and boston and cambridge all these neighboring",
          "timestamp_start": 1281.12,
          "timestamp_end": 1287.76,
          "duration_seconds": 6.6400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "4e1b3fbe-e967-46ff-9b0d-4fed8a7d3349",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 315,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "towns get like a nice synergy effect where it allows for entrepreneurs and startup culture to",
          "timestamp_start": 1287.76,
          "timestamp_end": 1293.52,
          "duration_seconds": 5.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "79f26613-6859-4e56-b551-6ca50e8fff34",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 316,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "develop where because of these big universities providing the talent and the young talented people",
          "timestamp_start": 1293.52,
          "timestamp_end": 1299.12,
          "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "d36dd494-5ded-4cd8-a331-36052d8c664b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 317,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "from all over the country coming in i think that's really something that's missing right now where",
          "timestamp_start": 1299.12,
          "timestamp_end": 1303.9199999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "9094ad32-d00d-4a02-a920-a7cb80acb4e3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 318,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "even in bangalore we have a walled off campus in iac where the pollination between the industry",
          "timestamp_start": 1303.92,
          "timestamp_end": 1311.68,
          "duration_seconds": 7.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "17f5f03c-7e76-4ebf-8496-c3843469d352",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 319,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and the startup culture and the institute is not robust enough for that more like what do you call",
          "timestamp_start": 1311.68,
          "timestamp_end": 1318.72,
          "duration_seconds": 7.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "67e05cdd-2c38-4fd9-befe-c47d6ad45904",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 320,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "i would say thought iterative loops where you think of ideas you implement them in reality",
          "timestamp_start": 1319.92,
          "timestamp_end": 1325.3600000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 5.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "63d1facd-72ef-4415-a588-2a3c3cc3a1e6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 321,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "get the feedback again bring it back to theory yeah pick a small problem fix it try to work on it",
          "timestamp_start": 1325.3600000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1330.96,
          "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "c532e7de-2898-48e9-b218-9306b4cd0512",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 322,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "right so i definitely think that is something that's really useful like internship culture",
          "timestamp_start": 1330.96,
          "timestamp_end": 1336.08,
          "duration_seconds": 5.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "c558ac8a-2fe5-4376-85de-f131fd80f8c6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 323,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like in germany and all that they have that where you work in companies as intern yeah i think",
          "timestamp_start": 1336.08,
          "timestamp_end": 1341.8400000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 5.760000000000218
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "So that's going to be my next question, right?",
