      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "7f0f9735-421a-49ef-9ffd-a79e7f2ba6f7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 344,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think before we get to that,",
          "timestamp_start": 1424.4599999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 1426.06,
          "duration_seconds": 1.6000000000001364
        },
        {
          "id": "7bd28aa5-455d-4ad0-b496-e19457bb586f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 345,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think maybe we can talk about what AI can do now.",
          "timestamp_start": 1426.1599999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1431.24,
          "duration_seconds": 5.080000000000155
        },
        {
          "id": "85b6d652-ad4e-41b0-8118-851ae87af629",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 346,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What is AI safety and what are you worried about?",
          "timestamp_start": 1431.36,
          "timestamp_end": 1434.76,
          "duration_seconds": 3.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "691c3a29-a8ae-43b5-a86d-797c5404fc09",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 347,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What's the world worried about in terms of AI safety?",
          "timestamp_start": 1434.8799999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1437.1799999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 2.2999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "0249c423-6c33-4436-b87a-ab5234036138",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 348,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "so i think what we have seen real improvements in would be the deep learning having actually",
          "timestamp_start": 1437.18,
          "timestamp_end": 1449.1200000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 11.940000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "3d2bd73e-c46b-4c1c-9ca4-226b71893bdc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 349,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "worked like until recently we did not have the raw computational power to brute force this",
          "timestamp_start": 1449.1200000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1453.54,
          "duration_seconds": 4.419999999999845
        },
        {
          "id": "aa47eaa5-03af-489b-a6dc-949dcfe29daa",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 350,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "because the numbers are quite clear right like our wet brains work on 25 watts of power and",
          "timestamp_start": 1453.54,
          "timestamp_end": 1462.88,
          "duration_seconds": 9.340000000000146
        },
        {
          "id": "6260a56b-b9cd-4640-a4a9-620e2fb1d37d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 351,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and we can eat like a cheeseburger and do this kind of computation and speak like this.",
          "timestamp_start": 1462.88,
          "timestamp_end": 1467.64,
          "duration_seconds": 4.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "41fc8ff8-6fd5-4cf8-ab57-e58c807d893f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 352,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We have not reached anywhere near this level of energy efficiency.",
          "timestamp_start": 1467.64,
          "timestamp_end": 1473.66,
          "duration_seconds": 6.019999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "1597c07a-1729-4e57-8fb5-3e0f9ec7198a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 353,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But whatever we are doing using our multi-level perceptron or like transform architecture,",
          "timestamp_start": 1473.66,
          "timestamp_end": 1480.7800000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 7.120000000000118
        },
        {
          "id": "d93e52fb-2e9a-4949-973e-ccfad8687644",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 354,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "it's clearly not energy efficient.",
          "timestamp_start": 1480.7800000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1483.24,
          "duration_seconds": 2.459999999999809
        },
        {
          "id": "1e102776-e197-43e2-a40b-1395d0263297",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 355,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But till now, most of these AI systems we had of playing Go and playing chess and even",
          "timestamp_start": 1483.24,
          "timestamp_end": 1489.0200000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 5.7800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "aa25d42e-6d73-4314-823e-b8d8bf5b3486",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 356,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "doing activities like protein folding which are very difficult problems we achieved super",
          "timestamp_start": 1489.02,
          "timestamp_end": 1493.82,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "78acb547-1ccc-4228-b120-7dab0f19ffbe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 357,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "intelligence in narrow domains we were able to solve specific problems with specific data sets",
          "timestamp_start": 1493.82,
          "timestamp_end": 1499.58,
          "duration_seconds": 5.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "3f3daae9-899c-4c87-910b-c0d807241339",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 358,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and they were it's like if you take a chess playing engine and ask you to drive a car or",
          "timestamp_start": 1500.22,
          "timestamp_end": 1505.34,
          "duration_seconds": 5.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "8a032ae3-1c4f-444c-b1b1-a994f401867b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 359,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "anything it'll not even it'll do it's not even wrong i think Feynman said the famous thing not",
          "timestamp_start": 1505.34,
          "timestamp_end": 1509.98,
          "duration_seconds": 4.6400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "65bf1c36-ed9c-4d04-9b10-89863860289a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 360,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "even wrong you're it doesn't even have the idea of mapping the problem from the new novel space to",
          "timestamp_start": 1509.98,
          "timestamp_end": 1516.3799999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 6.399999999999864
        },
        {
          "id": "dc80c17f-a868-49ad-ba3e-f51095c419f2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 361,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to their original space.",
          "timestamp_start": 1516.38,
          "timestamp_end": 1517.94,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "6d074dbd-064d-44bf-b6d5-cdbd4ba124ab",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 362,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What human beings can do is meta learning.",
          "timestamp_start": 1517.94,
          "timestamp_end": 1520.0600000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 2.1200000000001182
        },
        {
          "id": "b946999e-b29c-43ca-b398-16bc2eca960a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 363,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They're able to map across domains.",
          "timestamp_start": 1520.0600000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1522.38,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3199999999999363
        },
        {
          "id": "ec19aca7-2e6e-4fc8-a3e5-e2142d67fc41",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 364,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We have cross domain learning.",
          "timestamp_start": 1522.38,
          "timestamp_end": 1524.3000000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "dd669d3a-22c2-4512-a23a-ce03e798f057",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 365,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I can take you and teach you to use, play the piano",
          "timestamp_start": 1524.3000000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1528.2600000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "ef9fadec-5a83-4469-974d-363edd3632b4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 366,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or go underwater or develop tools to go to space.",
          "timestamp_start": 1528.2600000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1532.3200000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 4.059999999999945
        },
        {
          "id": "d805b897-430a-4746-818d-dfa92acbcf3c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 367,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So that's the general intelligence",
          "timestamp_start": 1532.3200000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1533.5,
          "duration_seconds": 1.1799999999998363
        },
        {
          "id": "5c7217da-86dc-4b34-bc3d-e60d1f3cf8e3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 368,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that we're kind of building.",
          "timestamp_start": 1533.5,
          "timestamp_end": 1534.8600000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3600000000001273
        },
        {
          "id": "39f3c828-5702-4637-a0f1-c95628191f6f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 369,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And companies like OpenAI, DeepMind, and Anthropical,",
          "timestamp_start": 1534.8600000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1538.8600000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "fc46ac85-f53a-4c07-b00d-40f9c9c95bba",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 370,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "a lot of them are on the path towards achieving this AGI,",
          "timestamp_start": 1538.8600000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1541.8200000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "f50d27f4-a946-45fa-8a48-3411796c5436",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 371,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Artificial General Intelligence.",
          "timestamp_start": 1541.8200000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 1543.72,
          "duration_seconds": 1.8999999999998636
        },
        {
          "id": "32a55681-37c5-46d7-b27f-d0392a74d0e6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 372,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think we have made some significant progress there",
          "timestamp_start": 1543.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1545.68,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "16693aab-c2ef-468e-a7fa-a4b9bc2a5d44",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 373,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "because of the latest, I think, GPT-4 or Claude Sonnet 3.5.",
          "timestamp_start": 1545.68,
          "timestamp_end": 1552.04,
          "duration_seconds": 6.3599999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "b981c7b0-a04f-4ead-bd4e-1e179d0131bf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 374,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They are not really trained for a specific problem,",
          "timestamp_start": 1552.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1554.2,
          "duration_seconds": 2.160000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "b554d37a-386e-410c-8ce9-fb74e0c08732",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 375,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "but they seem to have abilities that span writing poems,",
          "timestamp_start": 1554.2,
          "timestamp_end": 1557.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "3d8b5fc0-a6aa-4666-941f-eb8d87634a48",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 376,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "writing code, doing a lot of cross-domain,",
          "timestamp_start": 1557.5,
