      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "bf31f8c4-8518-47a7-8cfa-b2d05fb2e2b1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 419,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We're trying to- Billions of parameters.",
          "timestamp_start": 1684.76,
          "timestamp_end": 1688.76,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "bece80cd-a6f8-42b3-a15b-5f99039db26c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 420,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "of parameters and there are theorems mathematically that show that these are universal function",
          "timestamp_start": 1688.76,
          "timestamp_end": 1693,
          "duration_seconds": 4.240000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "bc14c4b6-22e3-424f-bc5e-73578c755881",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 421,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "approximators that you can approximate any function so how you train this is that you",
          "timestamp_start": 1693,
          "timestamp_end": 1697.8,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "0727ca32-eb0f-4306-9fc1-0be7681d00d1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 422,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "take this architecture which is known as a transform architecture with attention heads",
          "timestamp_start": 1697.8,
          "timestamp_end": 1702.04,
          "duration_seconds": 4.240000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "8b7ba227-77fb-44ef-b61c-9b8d7aa2fcf5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 423,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and i can go into depth if you want but the basic idea here is just at a high level right",
          "timestamp_start": 1702.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1707.96,
          "duration_seconds": 5.920000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "b270ea60-beb2-4ddd-8a91-44468a351c5c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 424,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "it's a black box the idea is what you're doing here is you're showing it",
          "timestamp_start": 1710.28,
          "timestamp_end": 1713.32,
          "duration_seconds": 3.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "13a39396-7eb0-4d15-a65a-2899a5d04b9c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 425,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "every single document in the internet, like every single high quality text that's been",
          "timestamp_start": 1713.32,
          "timestamp_end": 1720.72,
          "duration_seconds": 7.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "8ac1beb1-dc82-4360-ad45-fe2df092f1dd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 426,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "written online and you're trying to make it predict the next token or the next word.",
          "timestamp_start": 1720.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1725.58,
          "duration_seconds": 4.8599999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "7a52237f-c4af-47ac-9812-7bdeae424f74",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 427,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So it keeps going and it keeps trying to predict what could the next word be.",
          "timestamp_start": 1725.58,
          "timestamp_end": 1729.82,
          "duration_seconds": 4.240000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "88055a1a-4572-44a7-b10c-5430c520eb15",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 428,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So this requires some awareness of context, because if you're reading an article about",
          "timestamp_start": 1729.82,
          "timestamp_end": 1734.56,
          "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "492cad56-62bd-477d-bcda-ae19c47d58ae",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 429,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "us on Wikipedia, it will be written in a certain style.",
          "timestamp_start": 1734.56,
          "timestamp_end": 1738.54,
          "duration_seconds": 3.980000000000018
        },
        {
          "id": "73de3722-efd8-426d-aa2b-03c7e6df6862",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 430,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It has to understand both the content, the style, the context in order to, with a high",
          "timestamp_start": 1738.54,
          "timestamp_end": 1744.96,
          "duration_seconds": 6.420000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "75d21e92-d7c5-48f2-968e-8256c2184bda",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 431,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "accuracy predict what the next word will be.",
          "timestamp_start": 1744.96,
          "timestamp_end": 1748.48,
          "duration_seconds": 3.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "9462755a-43c3-4830-88d0-dd106d2a6205",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 432,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So initially it will be very bad.",
          "timestamp_start": 1748.48,
          "timestamp_end": 1750.04,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "abe83854-c579-408b-9ea2-e70d4a9bb84b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 433,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It will be very horrible at doing this, but you show it enough, enough, enough content.",
          "timestamp_start": 1750.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1753.92,
          "duration_seconds": 3.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "0cc9935d-77da-4c9b-b82b-bced9074ea38",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 434,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It turns out to converge to something that decent.",
          "timestamp_start": 1753.92,
          "timestamp_end": 1756.72,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "0ee97b8f-78db-4b65-b624-3822ae4aa04a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 435,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's quite good, but it's still not useful.",
          "timestamp_start": 1756.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1759.6399999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9199999999998454
        },
        {
          "id": "14beda01-b961-44c3-a642-992788229711",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 436,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 1759.6399999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1760.6399999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "7b36ef07-b78f-488a-be9b-d15dbc64baee",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 437,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So you're saying all, all, all they do is train these models, adjust these parameters.",
          "timestamp_start": 1760.6399999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1768.3,
          "duration_seconds": 7.660000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "e8878f20-1b87-492e-94e6-1e427c6a86fe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 438,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to given the context to predict the next one.",
          "timestamp_start": 1768.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1772.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "c938488a-bb31-4e2f-89e5-cc1aae4c1714",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 439,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, you have like billions of knobs.",
          "timestamp_start": 1772.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1776.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "8478be82-033e-4f99-8bb8-838a2f068564",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 440,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "The algorithm will keep tweaking these knobs slowly, slowly, slowly,",
          "timestamp_start": 1776.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1780.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "9471a3de-cc9e-4cba-b3b0-ee1af1d48160",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 441,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "trying to make this black box better and better, and doing this one task,",
          "timestamp_start": 1780.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1784.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "c6a1e249-7580-400d-bd5a-634b24bfa8ed",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 442,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "which is predicting the next word.",
          "timestamp_start": 1784.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1786.3,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "We're trying to- Billions of parameters.",
