      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "50e918d6-0733-4b4f-8a13-4d397c4e5fc3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 443,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right. So just because, I mean, just",
          "timestamp_start": 1786.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1790.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "15286cd8-d046-4753-bcb6-bce85ff733ab",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 444,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "it being a next word predictor itself is so useful",
          "timestamp_start": 1790.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1794.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "42851014-0fd9-493a-ae4e-af43edfab7b1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 445,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that we have things like chat GPT, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1794.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1797.3,
          "duration_seconds": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "95ea253b-bb60-448b-a2b4-75a7c19d18f1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 446,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Do you have any, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1797.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1800.06,
          "duration_seconds": 2.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "7323f7a3-6d2e-46e2-8dca-8201c035b812",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 447,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I mean, it's such a simple concept.",
          "timestamp_start": 1800.34,
          "timestamp_end": 1802.6399999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.2999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "83baa75b-1d35-4545-986b-48967e3a9eee",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 448,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But all of that...",
          "timestamp_start": 1803.28,
          "timestamp_end": 1804.5,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2200000000000273
        },
        {
          "id": "a9782d57-e738-4a10-a660-c0ed38b04ab7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 449,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, a lot of people didn't think that.",
          "timestamp_start": 1804.5,
          "timestamp_end": 1805.8,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2999999999999545
        },
        {
          "id": "bccd31ee-0df2-4876-8e79-c79ee39cfa15",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 450,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, like people laughed at OpenAI.",
          "timestamp_start": 1805.9199999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 1807.3,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3800000000001091
        },
        {
          "id": "d9c6aa96-8d19-49a6-919c-f8da576848f0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 451,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So when OpenAI initially invested a lot of money trying to do this,",
          "timestamp_start": 1807.3999999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1811.02,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6200000000001182
        },
        {
          "id": "9fe45331-ff75-4a05-a799-b46a55dd3ecc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 452,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "there are people who said that this is a fool's chase",
          "timestamp_start": 1811.48,
          "timestamp_end": 1814.08,
          "duration_seconds": 2.599999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "eacca5e9-9953-467b-bee4-8f009b8d8734",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 453,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "because people have thought that in order to reverse engineer",
          "timestamp_start": 1814.08,
          "timestamp_end": 1816.8999999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.8199999999999363
        },
        {
          "id": "fdd298b1-eb8c-4f49-9b14-9f85b914e21c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 454,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "whatever humans can do or to get close to general intelligence,",
          "timestamp_start": 1816.8999999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 1819.6399999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.740000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "70a02d80-f177-4835-814b-634ee5dbeaa0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 455,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "you need to make modular parts,",
          "timestamp_start": 1819.76,
          "timestamp_end": 1822.12,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3599999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "bdd2fe48-32d7-4b1e-a6ea-06e3a5bf6906",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 456,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like how Google Brain was doing.",
          "timestamp_start": 1822.22,
          "timestamp_end": 1824,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
        },
        {
          "id": "b18009ef-7be8-407b-9823-1729fbea7ab2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 457,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I don't know. There have been different efforts for this.",
          "timestamp_start": 1824,
          "timestamp_end": 1826.96,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "d38bb5bd-9490-466d-a4a3-522d6e0bb9b8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 458,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So what we've gotten with ChartGPT was a surprise.",
          "timestamp_start": 1826.96,
          "timestamp_end": 1831.66,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7000000000000455
        },
        {
          "id": "bcaa4ec7-be11-4aaf-860f-56faefcf3669",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 459,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's definitely something that I think a lot of people need to like take a step back to really examine their models.",
          "timestamp_start": 1831.66,
          "timestamp_end": 1836.34,
          "duration_seconds": 4.679999999999836
        },
        {
          "id": "2c84f1c7-5ac7-411c-87d5-b9309a4c242f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 460,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Because if your model didn't predict it will work, something's wrong with your model.",
          "timestamp_start": 1836.34,
          "timestamp_end": 1840,
          "duration_seconds": 3.660000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "a38e9e17-f2a3-4d59-813d-ac7b1be72ea0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 461,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like we have to now update our model to be less surprised in the future.",
          "timestamp_start": 1840,
          "timestamp_end": 1843.64,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "ef7e2ced-05bf-4359-9061-41c1f8a369b7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 462,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You can't like post ad hoc change the goalpost.",
          "timestamp_start": 1843.64,
          "timestamp_end": 1846.84,
          "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "0af0595a-dfa2-43c2-91d2-645ffb21971b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 463,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Because I think the Turing test was considered to be one of the barriers.",
          "timestamp_start": 1846.84,
          "timestamp_end": 1850.74,
          "duration_seconds": 3.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "8a54b263-111f-4488-ada2-29da4303f6f5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 464,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So people are like, if an AI can talk like a human being and like convince someone that",
          "timestamp_start": 1850.74,
          "timestamp_end": 1855.48,
          "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "b5022c4c-6ef2-4ffc-95c2-405dc930fa47",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 465,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in a blind test that it is confusing to say who's the human, who's the AI, that's like",
          "timestamp_start": 1855.48,
          "timestamp_end": 1859.74,
          "duration_seconds": 4.259999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "46925d76-9a34-4977-a470-4b853ccbca53",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 466,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "a big breakthrough.",
          "timestamp_start": 1859.74,
          "timestamp_end": 1860.72,
          "duration_seconds": 0.9800000000000182
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "Right. So just because, I mean, just",
      "provenance_utterance_ids": [
        "50e918d6-0733-4b4f-8a13-4d397c4e5fc3",
