      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "c99ea7cd-284c-4929-9654-e285b0fff6da",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 467,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I think that's definitely like a lot of confusions even now fundamentally don't understand",
          "timestamp_start": 1861.1,
          "timestamp_end": 1867.76,
          "duration_seconds": 6.660000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "d2b6146f-6b82-4b51-95c2-257972247f50",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 468,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "why this works and why doesn't this overfit.",
          "timestamp_start": 1868.04,
          "timestamp_end": 1870.56,
          "duration_seconds": 2.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "ab77626d-c4f2-4743-98c1-8c2239ec560f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 469,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like if you think of the example of the different parameters, if you have only like a few data",
          "timestamp_start": 1870.6200000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 1874.24,
          "duration_seconds": 3.619999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "38c8789c-21ea-4c63-8b99-f16adb6a24b9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 470,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "points and use a hundred parameters, it'll usually end up overfitting the data that it",
          "timestamp_start": 1874.24,
          "timestamp_end": 1879.86,
          "duration_seconds": 5.619999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "a06ab378-21dd-4d97-b4b3-5b5a43a99755",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 471,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It won't generalize very well.",
          "timestamp_start": 1879.86,
          "timestamp_end": 1881,
          "duration_seconds": 1.1400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "6435bbf8-613d-414a-b503-bae219683df0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 472,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What will end up happening is it will memorize all the data points because the",
          "timestamp_start": 1881.3,
          "timestamp_end": 1885.06,
          "duration_seconds": 3.759999999999991
        },
        {
          "id": "a0eef1e9-2795-41b0-aafa-f90aff1b6983",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 473,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "space of possible Wikipedia articles is so large that if you show them billions",
          "timestamp_start": 1885.06,
          "timestamp_end": 1889.58,
          "duration_seconds": 4.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "ec8773c8-c4b0-45df-8dea-fe83373b7158",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 474,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "of millions of Wikipedia articles, it can't write a okay Wikipedia article.",
          "timestamp_start": 1889.58,
          "timestamp_end": 1894.26,
          "duration_seconds": 4.680000000000064
        },
        {
          "id": "23927731-1f86-4064-abe9-086c205acd08",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 475,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It'll just, might as well just spit out the articles it already has seen.",
          "timestamp_start": 1894.5,
          "timestamp_end": 1897.62,
          "duration_seconds": 3.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "e86393c4-4284-4101-a956-02308f91f6bd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 476,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So this question of why does like brute force work?",
          "timestamp_start": 1898.28,
          "timestamp_end": 1902.4199999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 4.139999999999873
        },
        {
          "id": "77aefc0a-3f97-4fe1-b72c-c9a779086186",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 477,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "How does this sort of like extremely large models not memorize?",
          "timestamp_start": 1902.4799999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 1908.24,
          "duration_seconds": 5.760000000000218
        },
        {
          "id": "c358d431-e1c6-4e2f-9652-65a2eab6b86b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 478,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and how does it generalize so well,",
          "timestamp_start": 1908.24,
          "timestamp_end": 1909.52,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2799999999999727
        },
        {
          "id": "e629b87b-e165-4000-99f9-9c5bc3b04a59",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 479,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "is a question I think we still haven't adequately answered.",
          "timestamp_start": 1909.52,
          "timestamp_end": 1912.08,
          "duration_seconds": 2.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "8d7e8305-6817-4bf5-8e72-c0e113af0ec7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 480,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Most of us are still doing a lot of empirical work",
          "timestamp_start": 1914.08,
          "timestamp_end": 1916.32,
          "duration_seconds": 2.240000000000009
        },
        {
          "id": "84861a7a-dfab-48ff-b215-1ac80b5766fa",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 481,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and on machine learning rather than theoretical work.",
          "timestamp_start": 1916.32,
          "timestamp_end": 1919.28,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "de35b887-9e2a-408f-8dd9-3d5d3c1e572e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 482,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right, right, right.",
          "timestamp_start": 1920.72,
          "timestamp_end": 1921.56,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8399999999999181
        },
        {
          "id": "39bc3933-436e-4ab4-9b49-e893372a2f90",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 483,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think-",
          "timestamp_start": 1923.38,
          "timestamp_end": 1924.26,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8799999999998818
        },
        {
          "id": "dabbb376-c684-4383-9365-1118a0a09352",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 484,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "What AI is doing?",
          "timestamp_start": 1924.26,
          "timestamp_end": 1925.64,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3800000000001091
        },
        {
          "id": "20682a67-fbd0-4a42-b86d-530fba97682e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 485,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I know that as well, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 1925.64,
          "timestamp_end": 1926.84,
          "duration_seconds": 1.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "9e7cf744-92f3-4290-b4f3-3e3cddea1004",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 486,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like we have these black boxes,",
          "timestamp_start": 1926.84,
          "timestamp_end": 1929,
          "duration_seconds": 2.160000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "8a5ed814-49f1-4e70-ac5a-65f7e80e086c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 487,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "we don't know how these work in terms of",
          "timestamp_start": 1929,
          "timestamp_end": 1931.68,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6800000000000637
        },
        {
          "id": "aa845a06-1eeb-40c1-af6a-2bbfebfdc2e2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 488,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "why a certain thing was generated.",
          "timestamp_start": 1933.78,
          "timestamp_end": 1936.66,
          "duration_seconds": 2.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "83f22fba-9111-4514-8ea1-25e03ef9e668",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 489,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Why did this word get generated after this context?",
          "timestamp_start": 1936.66,
          "timestamp_end": 1940.16,
          "duration_seconds": 3.5
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "So I think that's definitely like a lot of confusions even now fundamentally don't understand",
