          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "of finding regions in the model that kind of corresponds",
          "timestamp_start": 2008.9399999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 2012.36,
          "duration_seconds": 3.4200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "3d0765c8-1f4e-43e2-bf91-fc003ea59222",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 513,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to different behavior.",
          "timestamp_start": 2012.36,
          "timestamp_end": 2014.7399999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3799999999998818
        },
        {
          "id": "0d8ab5f4-50c8-4662-8cb3-d99a2568e2db",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 514,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Unless I read it correctly.",
          "timestamp_start": 2014.7399999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 2017.8799999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 3.1400000000001
        },
        {
          "id": "6938b9c1-dda3-4e39-b7ad-6cf0fca41ed6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 515,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "No, no, no.",
          "timestamp_start": 2017.88,
          "timestamp_end": 2018.44,
          "duration_seconds": 0.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "49596463-acde-4fbb-a01d-020965bfc744",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 516,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So Anthropic is doing great work on interpretability.",
          "timestamp_start": 2018.5800000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 2022.98,
          "duration_seconds": 4.399999999999864
        },
        {
          "id": "0c8a39e7-9e9a-42cc-8c58-0a9bb8516ffc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 517,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So that's why whenever I am like buying API tokens and everything,",
          "timestamp_start": 2023.16,
          "timestamp_end": 2028.16,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "edd3c7f9-6313-4b76-80df-f73adc28dd63",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 518,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I usually spend it on Anthropic because I think they are one of the companies",
          "timestamp_start": 2028.6000000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 2032.96,
          "duration_seconds": 4.3599999999999
        },
        {
          "id": "5a15f868-7fe0-44d7-930d-3067f61a134c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 519,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that is doing good AI safety work.",
          "timestamp_start": 2032.96,
          "timestamp_end": 2035.0400000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0800000000001546
        },
        {
          "id": "21c3106d-d341-401a-9879-1be6665e85c4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 520,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And they are really like exciting breakthroughs have happened.",
          "timestamp_start": 2035.6000000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 2039.5200000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "bb89d0e1-2ebf-408a-ac44-80cf9896a249",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 521,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They have, if you look at Anthropic's page,",
          "timestamp_start": 2040.4,
          "timestamp_end": 2043.24,
          "duration_seconds": 2.839999999999918
        },
        {
          "id": "19b8c491-e397-4143-a213-75a4d4a07d01",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 522,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think they recently published a new paper.",
          "timestamp_start": 2043.3400000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 2044.8200000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "16315722-b5a1-4348-9bee-84749f1b8907",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 523,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Let me just check if I can pull it up.",
          "timestamp_start": 2044.94,
          "timestamp_end": 2046.22,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2799999999999727
        },
        {
          "id": "ce2c50dd-e6ce-44df-9beb-229480422600",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 524,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I haven't fully finished reading their latest paper, but if people in the audience are interested",
          "timestamp_start": 2046.22,
          "timestamp_end": 2053.88,
          "duration_seconds": 7.660000000000082
        },
        {
          "id": "c450d702-29bb-4a51-aa2c-36835f36300d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 525,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in what they have done in interpretability, I think Chris Ola is the one who I would say",
          "timestamp_start": 2053.88,
          "timestamp_end": 2062.32,
          "duration_seconds": 8.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "00d4d99b-de51-4bbe-b1f0-ed2e051d2bf6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 526,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "you should definitely read out.",
          "timestamp_start": 2062.32,
          "timestamp_end": 2063.42,
          "duration_seconds": 1.099999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "fcdbfddf-84c7-452d-885b-f98f0443face",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 527,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, they have the featured paper that was released in May, which is still their top",
          "timestamp_start": 2063.82,
          "timestamp_end": 2068.2200000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 4.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "06bf1fd4-44e6-4254-8664-ea77a8159035",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 528,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "paper.",
          "timestamp_start": 2068.2200000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2068.58,
          "duration_seconds": 0.3599999999996726
        },
        {
          "id": "738900f1-805a-4f91-927f-86fbc9c4c28e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 529,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So yeah, their Golden Gate Bridge feature, and it's super cool how they've managed to,",
          "timestamp_start": 2069.32,
          "timestamp_end": 2074.58,
          "duration_seconds": 5.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "89201f6e-1680-480f-8e2b-cef2ee93d01b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 530,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "at scale, try to figure out what are the different parts of this model and how to amplify it.",
          "timestamp_start": 2074.58,
          "timestamp_end": 2082.46,
          "duration_seconds": 7.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "48c5e282-d1aa-4a5b-bea8-bbd5d7941a36",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 531,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So we have made some progress in interpretability.",
          "timestamp_start": 2082.46,
          "timestamp_end": 2084.92,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "e67c9fd4-8257-47cc-b60b-440bff4e37bf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 532,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, I thought that blog post that I read was super fascinating.",
          "timestamp_start": 2086.5,
          "timestamp_end": 2091.44,
          "duration_seconds": 4.940000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "688de396-48aa-436f-8878-4668ab092714",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 533,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's almost like a human brain, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2092.2799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2094.7,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "fcbd465b-98d2-4fc0-85b9-fe81a5161029",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 534,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Different areas are kind of different parameters that are associated with different kind of functions.",
          "timestamp_start": 2095.1,
          "timestamp_end": 2100.2799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 5.179999999999836
        },
        {
          "id": "358512e8-3e57-4234-8a1b-1941d90f7312",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 535,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's amazing that it kind of worked out that way.",
          "timestamp_start": 2101.42,
          "timestamp_end": 2103.7799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3599999999996726
        },
        {
          "id": "5fcc7cc6-b270-46f2-9326-6af1d0a65fef",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 536,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, because it's all bottom up, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2104.58,
          "timestamp_end": 2107.08,
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        },
        {
          "id": "5ab0eabc-690e-4d78-a846-5a05de474494",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 537,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We are not engineering this.",
          "timestamp_start": 2107.08,
          "timestamp_end": 2108.74,
          "duration_seconds": 1.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "1fcd0601-3623-4022-a767-fc13f6b5c490",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 538,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's like this is emergent.",
          "timestamp_start": 2108.74,
          "timestamp_end": 2110.56,
          "duration_seconds": 1.8200000000001637
        },
        {
          "id": "8f40e294-414f-433c-8f86-89345abe6494",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 539,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's emergent phenomena where it turns out that this is how the black box ends up configurizing",
          "timestamp_start": 2110.56,
          "timestamp_end": 2116.64,
          "duration_seconds": 6.079999999999927
        },
        {
          "id": "c590a2ca-5aa3-48c9-9ae1-0ed935de7705",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 540,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "itself in order to solve these problems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2116.64,
          "timestamp_end": 2119.2999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "5ef75685-4868-4f94-8017-624ec5506968",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 541,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right.",
          "timestamp_start": 2119.2999999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2120.52,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2200000000002547
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "So I think just to digress a little bit,",
