      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "219f02f0-1368-4d38-94d8-9986ea8516f5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 542,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And one more, I mean, again, another digression, I think there was some other paper where they",
          "timestamp_start": 2120.52,
          "timestamp_end": 2126,
          "duration_seconds": 5.480000000000018
        },
        {
          "id": "4a1c29b7-45bb-491c-9217-33305b987d1c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 543,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "use different models, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2126,
          "timestamp_end": 2128.42,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "763b2f3e-66a4-4a26-a314-7878188ab2e5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 544,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They compare the vectors of whatever the representation, the embeddings for different kind of words, I think.",
          "timestamp_start": 2128.42,
          "timestamp_end": 2135.34,
          "duration_seconds": 6.920000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "2336996e-74c9-4a67-8c69-54cb69ab70cc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 545,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And like how your word to vector addition and subaction works.",
          "timestamp_start": 2135.94,
          "timestamp_end": 2140.44,
          "duration_seconds": 4.5
        },
        {
          "id": "631ec00f-e9e4-4d0e-9caa-4457a65a6972",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 546,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "King minus man plus queen plus woman equals queen.",
          "timestamp_start": 2140.88,
          "timestamp_end": 2145.32,
          "duration_seconds": 4.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "e0f648b9-5cc7-4de9-8932-da590c38c1c9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 547,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They looked at those vectors and it turned out to be very similar in different models.",
          "timestamp_start": 2145.94,
          "timestamp_end": 2152.44,
          "duration_seconds": 6.5
        },
        {
          "id": "c110a0f4-005e-411b-ba66-2ecc80ac95e2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 548,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Those kind of difference vectors, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2152.44,
          "timestamp_end": 2155.4,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "4fd6319c-1e2b-4fbd-89be-882be2071025",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 549,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "um what you can basically in the embedding space you can find that the you can actually do calculus",
          "timestamp_start": 2155.4,
          "timestamp_end": 2163.98,
          "duration_seconds": 8.579999999999927
        },
        {
          "id": "e536b393-578c-4647-b276-458a7ca14dc1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 550,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "on meanings in some sense you can add what do you call subtract a ruler from a man and get queen out",
          "timestamp_start": 2163.98,
          "timestamp_end": 2173,
          "duration_seconds": 9.019999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "f83d8d6b-8d65-4b1d-be4e-2f1dbb17428a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 551,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or add queen and king and get concepts out so it looks like concepts are decomposable and",
          "timestamp_start": 2173,
          "timestamp_end": 2179.1800000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 6.180000000000291
        },
        {
          "id": "2b3c2b58-da02-4830-997d-f3cec5a24d92",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 552,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "composable in this manner and i think the particular thing you talked about was done on a",
          "timestamp_start": 2179.1800000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2183.9,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "d7d8962c-a532-48de-8fb0-8e75cd46af61",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 553,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "very small model.",
          "timestamp_start": 2183.9,
          "timestamp_end": 2185.94,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "a7a53ff8-e071-46ca-b925-2e90ef2783bc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 554,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "That's one of the criticisms that people say,",
          "timestamp_start": 2185.94,
          "timestamp_end": 2187.8,
          "duration_seconds": 1.8600000000001273
        },
        {
          "id": "c5b69bfa-d1eb-4d6c-8f67-d2db95eeeaa9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 555,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "where a lot of these results are often",
          "timestamp_start": 2187.8,
          "timestamp_end": 2190.58,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7799999999997453
        },
        {
          "id": "6a06d590-70e0-4d1a-83cf-1193eb5417c9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 556,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "shown in smaller models, and they haven't managed to scale it",
          "timestamp_start": 2190.58,
          "timestamp_end": 2194.58,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "85cd5293-18bf-424e-9c0f-a92fa46d307f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 557,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "up to practical systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2194.58,
          "timestamp_end": 2196.6600000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.080000000000382
        },
        {
          "id": "0fb62b2b-9670-42ed-a639-5736058e8831",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 558,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's like all the systems that are actually used in business",
          "timestamp_start": 2196.6600000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2201.12,
          "duration_seconds": 4.459999999999582
        },
        {
          "id": "3086a11f-9205-4dae-987f-3ad5d7908b4a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 559,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "cases are extremely large.",
          "timestamp_start": 2201.12,
          "timestamp_end": 2203.1,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "117a5796-cd9b-45b0-911f-5b6f9d40b033",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 560,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And there's an alignment tax where",
          "timestamp_start": 2203.1,
          "timestamp_end": 2205.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "bcdb9fe7-4514-49b8-80a5-982f12b9908c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 561,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "if this interpretability is applied to these models,",
          "timestamp_start": 2205.7000000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2208.9,
