      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "292aa3f9-bb51-498f-9033-d0f7bc070c7c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 587,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But I think alignment means something like when we are automating tasks, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2290.12,
          "timestamp_end": 2297.24,
          "duration_seconds": 7.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "93f292db-6224-4061-ba28-a683d848c40e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 588,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like when you start using AI systems for tasks,",
          "timestamp_start": 2297.24,
          "timestamp_end": 2300.8999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "96fd398a-6c9c-4c4b-bfd2-9e0fc599b9d9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 589,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "you are giving up your agency,",
          "timestamp_start": 2300.8999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2302.4599999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "ac2ebfe6-9033-4147-9904-0179c2cf04bc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 590,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "your ability to control the future.",
          "timestamp_start": 2302.4599999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2305.3599999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "49757e74-bdd5-47c0-8719-fe2e031778fe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 591,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So one possible way this might look like is",
          "timestamp_start": 2305.3599999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2308.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 3.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "4377939a-c24c-44c5-8a1d-36efb5b359e4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 592,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "you have automated systems that decide who gets loans,",
          "timestamp_start": 2308.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2312.08,
          "duration_seconds": 3.200000000000273
        },
        {
          "id": "9cbd7e21-988a-42d4-a864-18ed26ffa2d0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 593,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "how voting happens or how policy decisions are made,",
          "timestamp_start": 2312.08,
          "timestamp_end": 2315.3399999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "d6b02d22-7618-470e-981f-abc5dcb8c56c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 594,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "how education made, how all the pictures and books",
          "timestamp_start": 2315.3399999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2319.14,
          "duration_seconds": 3.800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "3d7b9b81-b9ce-4b7b-b24b-b2ed60963235",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 595,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and even the content in books written by AI systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2319.14,
          "timestamp_end": 2321.3999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 2.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "9f7979ca-cc9b-4a29-8edd-036bef8c1169",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 596,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2321.3999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2322.4599999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "bf93544d-f7c8-4038-b649-08e5a527bfe4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 597,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So slowly, slowly, slowly, it'll be harder and harder",
          "timestamp_start": 2322.4599999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2324.7799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3200000000001637
        },
        {
          "id": "81a5dcde-8295-4db8-a314-2e91bc6025c1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 598,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to affect each of us will lose control over what world we live in.",
          "timestamp_start": 2324.78,
          "timestamp_end": 2331.5600000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 6.7800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "956bc5e2-f30e-4a4b-a0cf-5603a1ffe8f3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 599,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And it's like we get so dependent on electricity",
          "timestamp_start": 2331.5600000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 2333.6600000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.099999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "60f3ec18-1a15-4db4-8240-f69ab174be80",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 600,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that we can't switch it off.",
          "timestamp_start": 2333.6600000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2334.92,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "150592d9-a54e-43a0-b3fd-3e70904bd6e1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 601,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So we can reach a point where the human values are things",
          "timestamp_start": 2334.92,
          "timestamp_end": 2338.5400000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6200000000003456
        },
        {
          "id": "c230639a-0e95-4ae2-a41c-9a1e3eca23be",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 602,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that we care about.",
          "timestamp_start": 2338.5400000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 2339.3,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "dc3a35c7-9a7d-4277-a563-956bb181c125",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 603,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like we supposedly care about everyone having food",
          "timestamp_start": 2339.3,
          "timestamp_end": 2345.28,
          "duration_seconds": 5.980000000000018
        },
        {
          "id": "8eb2ae98-8cb4-4e7f-b8e8-31cb768e8107",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 604,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and having health care and having education and things",
          "timestamp_start": 2345.28,
          "timestamp_end": 2347.7200000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4400000000000546
        },
        {
          "id": "29da4659-44e8-47fd-b955-4be4a1b3d311",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 605,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like that.",
          "timestamp_start": 2347.7200000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2348.46,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "64f05174-c08a-48b3-990d-427868a825d5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 606,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But we're already seeing a misalignment",
          "timestamp_start": 2348.46,
          "timestamp_end": 2350.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.2400000000002365
        },
        {
          "id": "9175883d-3358-416b-a265-73a359b22fc3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 607,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "where capitalism is kind of optimizing for more consumption, more production.",
          "timestamp_start": 2350.7,
          "timestamp_end": 2356.9399999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 6.239999999999782
        },
        {
          "id": "4d034a02-edfe-4e07-918f-d2e3bc9da146",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 608,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And so the government and capitalistic forces are looking for a different future where the",
          "timestamp_start": 2356.9399999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2364.22,
          "duration_seconds": 7.2800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "1467239f-20d9-471c-8b73-a990e8ae0bc0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 609,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "egregore or the system's goals are being met. It is living in a world where GDP is growing.",
          "timestamp_start": 2364.7799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2372.22,
          "duration_seconds": 7.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "46883a52-3817-4e80-8aa7-bef7080e9bb1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 610,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "GDP is going up, growth is going up. But human values are not being optimized for.",
          "timestamp_start": 2372.22,
          "timestamp_end": 2376.3799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 4.1599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "b402c4ee-cf15-4387-b20d-37a023c9004d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 611,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "If you look from the point of view of our deepest values of having free time, having the bandwidth to enjoy with our family, to even have families, to have children, to spend time dating someone that we like, we are failing in so many ways.",
          "timestamp_start": 2376.38,
          "timestamp_end": 2391.04,
          "duration_seconds": 14.659999999999854
        },
        {
          "id": "e0e78074-e0c6-465c-85bb-6fd47ade0532",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 612,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So we have already seen ways in which recommendation systems are not optimizing our human values.",
          "timestamp_start": 2391.04,
          "timestamp_end": 2397,
          "duration_seconds": 5.960000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "b080a1c2-8d8c-44c8-9d93-f9e749614064",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 613,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We are spending time addicted to our reels and we are spending time increasing watch time.",
          "timestamp_start": 2397.1,
          "timestamp_end": 2401.92,
          "duration_seconds": 4.820000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "1226d29e-94ab-4b83-b55d-bebeb0e25cf9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 614,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So from the perspective of the economic system, you are increasing shareholder value, you are increasing the revenue, you are increasing watch time.",
          "timestamp_start": 2401.92,
          "timestamp_end": 2409.2200000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 7.300000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "6d43767d-595a-40c2-b151-a786b8f66a9e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 615,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Editors are happy, but human values are suffering.",
          "timestamp_start": 2409.7200000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2412.44,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "786eb971-d7a1-424a-a921-f44e3514d202",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 616,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So the question is now, how do you align these systems?",
          "timestamp_start": 2412.84,
          "timestamp_end": 2416.1,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2599999999997635
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "But I think alignment means something like when we are automating tasks, right?",
      "provenance_utterance_ids": [
        "292aa3f9-bb51-498f-9033-d0f7bc070c7c",
        "93f292db-6224-4061-ba28-a683d848c40e",
