      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "7e61a49e-c0af-423c-9981-12ea34f80f1a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 617,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think it's like in MacBook, if I do this, it becomes like a big firework will happen.",
          "timestamp_start": 2417.66,
          "timestamp_end": 2423.86,
          "duration_seconds": 6.200000000000273
        },
        {
          "id": "55b0ba1c-1668-4f57-bbd6-bb8b73a45b37",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 618,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But yeah, so the word alignment, I would say is about designing AI systems such that human",
          "timestamp_start": 2423.86,
          "timestamp_end": 2432.26,
          "duration_seconds": 8.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "d63b9c66-6f53-465a-b5fe-d09bd640d182",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 619,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "values are embedded inside the algorithm.",
          "timestamp_start": 2432.26,
          "timestamp_end": 2435.46,
          "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "dcd7ceec-73aa-4c15-ab76-a6cee5414d04",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 620,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So this black box should no longer be optimizing for some weird alien values that we don't care",
          "timestamp_start": 2435.46,
          "timestamp_end": 2440.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 5.2400000000002365
        },
        {
          "id": "d95bbacd-2a34-4eab-9a19-44e9aaae8486",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 621,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "about.",
          "timestamp_start": 2440.7000000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2441.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "3f023cb2-8341-40d5-97bf-d86bc6af498c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 622,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It could optimize for human values that we all can converge and agree about.",
          "timestamp_start": 2441.7000000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 2446.7400000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 5.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "f148d382-65df-4835-8083-5d761aa5216c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 623,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "This makes sense.",
          "timestamp_start": 2446.7400000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 2447.7400000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ad5c5777-f4e0-48cd-9fa4-514db7913d77",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 624,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 2447.7400000000002,
          "timestamp_end": 2448.7400000000002,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "4d70a151-630f-45bd-a214-526d73221542",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 625,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And I think what the human values are, that's again a point of contention.",
          "timestamp_start": 2448.74,
          "timestamp_end": 2455.9199999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 7.179999999999836
        },
        {
          "id": "475301a1-ea92-43c0-a04b-fb0b5a3ba51d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 626,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2455.9199999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2456.9199999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "43efbf62-1e25-486e-9d33-60d709f7f806",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 627,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Who decides these values?",
          "timestamp_start": 2456.9199999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2458.9199999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "fd264f4d-5043-4a4b-bdce-a293b9af9d2d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 628,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, a lot of people.",
          "timestamp_start": 2458.9199999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2460.9199999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "1a8621e9-df35-477a-9250-0fc1dd8ec59f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 629,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think AI ethics, a lot of the people who are worried about that would say that right",
          "timestamp_start": 2460.9199999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 2464.7,
          "duration_seconds": 3.7800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "c7f3e144-8cab-46b9-b398-f25bc2bf4265",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 630,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "now, it's a small bubble of Silicon Valley or STEM bros who are in control of designing",
          "timestamp_start": 2464.7,
          "timestamp_end": 2472.14,
          "duration_seconds": 7.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "8c6c851f-d0d0-4bee-bef1-6f3a38601a88",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 631,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "these and creating these systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2472.14,
          "timestamp_end": 2474.2599999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 2.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "5a82d917-26e1-4ad6-9fe9-1c243073625a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 632,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So their values are the ones that are being embedded into these systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2474.2599999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 2478.58,
          "duration_seconds": 4.320000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "12e6e1b3-e070-4e98-abfb-c464bad35ae1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 633,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And we don't even have like a type signature or a way to really condense and reify or explicitly",
          "timestamp_start": 2478.58,
          "timestamp_end": 2488.48,
          "duration_seconds": 9.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "8e2723c5-d710-4657-9c93-5195f17943a7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 634,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "state what these values are.",
          "timestamp_start": 2488.48,
          "timestamp_end": 2491.04,
          "duration_seconds": 2.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "b535b7b6-49ab-4b2b-bbd7-4c9b20ca903f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 635,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "At this point, at least, I'm like, even if we don't all agree on exactly what the values",
          "timestamp_start": 2491.04,
          "timestamp_end": 2495.08,
          "duration_seconds": 4.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "3be236ad-cead-477e-8d34-67037b380934",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 636,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "are, we all agree that some things are not good.",
          "timestamp_start": 2495.08,
          "timestamp_end": 2497.42,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "85958ef7-c5f9-4a68-a0e3-4ca697afb197",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 637,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like we are failing so badly that I would be okay pushing it towards the space of our",
          "timestamp_start": 2497.42,
          "timestamp_end": 2502.92,
          "duration_seconds": 5.5
        },
        {
          "id": "c2022451-4a9c-4023-8536-2cd61e97bf86",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 638,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "values, even if we don't exactly hit the right point.",
          "timestamp_start": 2502.92,
          "timestamp_end": 2505.7799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.8599999999996726
        },
        {
          "id": "251d99cd-b8c8-4e08-ab4b-64097bf28d33",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 639,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We can disagree on the specifics, but we all agree on the broad details that we don't want",
          "timestamp_start": 2505.78,
          "timestamp_end": 2511.0600000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 5.2800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "187f2f13-0be6-449a-8eea-aa2c2da35245",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 640,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "everyone to not have health care.",
          "timestamp_start": 2511.0600000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 2513.9,
          "duration_seconds": 2.8399999999996908
        },
        {
          "id": "096a752f-453e-41b4-99cf-6dbc2299a075",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 641,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like the level to which we can fail, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 2513.9,
          "timestamp_end": 2516,
          "duration_seconds": 2.099999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "51640051-c260-4548-bbdb-adec234f0002",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 642,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Where people don't have the right to appeal or freedom of speech or right to the free",
          "timestamp_start": 2516,
          "timestamp_end": 2522.0400000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 6.040000000000418
        },
        {
          "id": "317bd7ca-6232-40f8-9245-7bf2ca40a9a9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 643,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and fair trial.",
          "timestamp_start": 2522.0400000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 2523.0400000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "fe8b4b50-332c-4c24-ade2-044147c3b7e3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 644,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "There are some core fundamental values that I think almost 99% of us will agree that no",
          "timestamp_start": 2523.0400000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 2528.46,
          "duration_seconds": 5.419999999999618
        },
        {
          "id": "b904d4d0-1711-4fa6-87bd-a482260c85f1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 645,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "one should be tortured for no reason.",
          "timestamp_start": 2528.46,
          "timestamp_end": 2530.02,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "cadd3398-b5ce-4262-85f7-3978b43484de",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 646,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And at this point, we don't have a reliable way to even encode those values in these systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2530.02,
          "timestamp_end": 2535.76,
          "duration_seconds": 5.7400000000002365
        },
        {
          "id": "c8440ed6-b388-404a-bcf7-784dc4717083",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 647,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "systems.",
          "timestamp_start": 2535.76,
          "timestamp_end": 2536.76,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        }
      ],
