          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "these are new concepts",
          "timestamp_start": 2974.52,
          "timestamp_end": 2977.32,
          "duration_seconds": 2.800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "22e19064-fe2c-4012-a858-c75a162e5f37",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 767,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and what the implications of those are.",
          "timestamp_start": 2977.32,
          "timestamp_end": 2980.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 3.3200000000001637
        },
        {
          "id": "16453120-8b6e-42e0-94c0-d151df2c093b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 768,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right, right, right.",
          "timestamp_start": 2980.64,
          "timestamp_end": 2983.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "cb156326-c7ea-43d4-9435-732ae6a6e507",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 769,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Makes sense.",
          "timestamp_start": 2983.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2984.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "e093b842-f1fe-419d-8df9-91eea40d3ddd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 770,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So the way that I would explain it is something like, yeah, so usually it makes a lot more",
          "timestamp_start": 2984.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 2993.14,
          "duration_seconds": 8.260000000000218
        },
        {
          "id": "9939f0d7-d33a-4542-b7bb-d27dba2f1042",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 771,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "sense for people who have a little bit more background into this whole debate between,",
          "timestamp_start": 2993.14,
          "timestamp_end": 2997.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 4.739999999999782
        },
        {
          "id": "be6e84c2-9e92-4293-be9a-015e74b18bd4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 772,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "if you already know what AGI is or ASI is, you might know that there's a group of people",
          "timestamp_start": 2997.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3005.22,
          "duration_seconds": 7.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "eab827d0-f7d5-41bf-8e6d-e263e90b7618",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 773,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "who think that the current approaches are doomed because they're autoregressive models.",
          "timestamp_start": 3005.22,
          "timestamp_end": 3011.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 6.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "720af262-6bec-43df-9ac0-da59a2c05425",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 774,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like Yanli Kun is what I call that camp of people who think that a scale won't get you",
          "timestamp_start": 3011.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3017.22,
          "duration_seconds": 5.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "4dc2ed8f-b8b7-43dd-86a8-00c95f6a8995",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 775,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "anywhere.",
          "timestamp_start": 3017.22,
          "timestamp_end": 3018.22,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "62ec6553-9d7e-4bdb-bdb7-8f6166baa2fc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 776,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We need to go for symbolic AI or something, a different approach to solve for general",
          "timestamp_start": 3018.22,
          "timestamp_end": 3024.1,
          "duration_seconds": 5.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "9a7cfe1f-60ff-4675-8324-29ff4c7a8ae5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 777,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "intelligence.",
          "timestamp_start": 3024.1,
          "timestamp_end": 3025.1,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "040f31f1-1fff-43b9-964b-4095136921e6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 778,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And it's kind of far away, maybe a few more decades for sure, at least.",
          "timestamp_start": 3025.1,
          "timestamp_end": 3028.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 3.7799999999997453
        },
        {
          "id": "c60f03e9-66ed-4f00-9932-a8025fd93e0f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 779,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I think I would call this camp as something like business as usual or, you know, mundanity,",
          "timestamp_start": 3028.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3035.2,
          "duration_seconds": 6.320000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "3e058674-9f8d-4848-99b1-02c3eca1fb8a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 780,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the world is going to remain the same.",
          "timestamp_start": 3035.2,
          "timestamp_end": 3036.96,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7600000000002183
        },
        {
          "id": "53b52ee2-65fe-4f1a-aaa6-8658e76f6312",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 781,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They're not really taking intelligence seriously, I would say, in some sense of",
          "timestamp_start": 3037.96,
          "timestamp_end": 3041.04,
          "duration_seconds": 3.0799999999999272
        },
        {
          "id": "e96034cf-1f4c-49aa-a8a5-4c8be7b5fa08",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 782,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "not really realizing what does it mean to have something even as smart as",
          "timestamp_start": 3041.3399999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3045.72,
          "duration_seconds": 4.380000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "6a4d5955-e5f3-40ab-a267-56577d8af9a4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 783,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "ChatGPT or Sonnet 3.5 with the right prompt programming.",
          "timestamp_start": 3045.72,
          "timestamp_end": 3049.22,
          "duration_seconds": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "51fc8207-d12b-4ef1-bef0-c31302b5dea0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 784,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Even that they think they are stochastic parrots or not really smart.",
          "timestamp_start": 3049.8799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3053.08,
          "duration_seconds": 3.200000000000273
        },
        {
          "id": "0c6f792c-8934-4520-999e-0c00fae08a74",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 785,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "There's some level of human specialness.",
          "timestamp_start": 3053.3999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3055.7999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "4cb0217d-08a0-4fbb-9b27-e1fd43f6be2b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 786,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We are somehow special in some sense going on there, where they don't want to admit",
          "timestamp_start": 3055.7999999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3060.3999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 4.599999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "14fd2772-ffb3-495a-a612-662521959f5b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 787,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that we might just be biochemical machines.",
          "timestamp_start": 3060.3999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3063.14,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7400000000002365
        },
        {
          "id": "0f48c588-d5d6-427c-93ae-514e7896dafe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 788,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "That's like one group.",
          "timestamp_start": 3063.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3064.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 1.1799999999998363
        },
        {
          "id": "d3b5312c-602f-4abf-8201-ca0e509dfc69",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 789,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And the other group I would say is the folks who are maybe both AI safety",
          "timestamp_start": 3065.2,
          "timestamp_end": 3070.66,
          "duration_seconds": 5.460000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "37790990-3c16-47f6-af91-0880cd61fb51",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 790,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "folks and the EAC folks who are like extremely like thinking about the",
          "timestamp_start": 3070.66,
          "timestamp_end": 3075.06,
          "duration_seconds": 4.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "1f0a9136-7965-49a6-b653-5ed937fbde9b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 791,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "final end game.",
          "timestamp_start": 3075.06,
          "timestamp_end": 3075.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 0.819999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "948c48d2-f96f-42a9-aa58-d72c321cd790",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 792,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They're like, Oh, this is going to become super smart very quickly.",
          "timestamp_start": 3076.24,
          "timestamp_end": 3079.7999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 3.5599999999999454
        },
        {
          "id": "043ea8ce-e14c-4d62-b0ae-81bca3bd77ba",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 793,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Recursive self-improvement, a sharp left turn.",
          "timestamp_start": 3080.06,
          "timestamp_end": 3082.7799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "50b3d066-424a-4072-abd9-e1d43384dbdf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 794,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like these things are going to quickly start outpacing us.",
          "timestamp_start": 3082.7799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3087.04,
          "duration_seconds": 4.260000000000218
        },
        {
          "id": "17d9eecd-dfc7-47d7-bdca-13961f2b5c46",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 795,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And there's no scope for communication, collaboration.",
          "timestamp_start": 3087.3199999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3091.6,
          "duration_seconds": 4.2800000000002
        },
        {
          "id": "ffeaedb3-81d5-4a42-a9a2-e1a22592a4cc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 796,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We have to stop development right now.",
          "timestamp_start": 3091.6,
          "timestamp_end": 3093.22,
          "duration_seconds": 1.6199999999998909
        },
        {
          "id": "517e9fb3-b786-415a-81bf-1439699258e4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 797,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or we have to like solve alignment, whichever, whatever they mean by that.",
          "timestamp_start": 3093.22,
          "timestamp_end": 3097.6,
          "duration_seconds": 4.380000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "3949887a-07de-483a-9b65-bf5f850b7fda",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 798,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Or we are like doomed or they're like, this is going to be utopia.",
          "timestamp_start": 3097.6,
          "timestamp_end": 3100.3599999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "e6b1ad07-ccdd-49f5-aff9-77a0ebb4880b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 799,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They're going to be living in a post Cassidy world.",
          "timestamp_start": 3100.3599999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3103.06,
          "duration_seconds": 2.700000000000273
        },
        {
