      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "be8b507e-e68d-47f6-80f8-09d0c1aa72fa",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 822,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Now in that world, we won't have ASI.",
          "timestamp_start": 3196.04,
          "timestamp_end": 3198.42,
          "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "7e5b018b-238b-41f2-a530-cca5e2b85ee3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 823,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We will have a general intelligence, but it will be available for cheap because what Sam",
          "timestamp_start": 3198.42,
          "timestamp_end": 3203.18,
          "duration_seconds": 4.7599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "30797a56-182d-4a16-9fef-9096954249f0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 824,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Altman is doing with his investments in nuclear power and building more data centers and batteries",
          "timestamp_start": 3203.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3208.98,
          "duration_seconds": 5.800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "07323ec1-921d-47d9-9e04-9b4641f682e1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 825,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and things like the competition for making inference cheaper with more specialized grok",
          "timestamp_start": 3208.98,
          "timestamp_end": 3216.08,
          "duration_seconds": 7.099999999999909
        },
        {
          "id": "cb0f4c15-56de-4e1d-82ae-d7c48510b1cf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 826,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "circuits and hardware and everything means that we're going to live in a world where",
          "timestamp_start": 3216.08,
          "timestamp_end": 3220.3399999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 4.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "0459a860-499f-4c36-9f98-3a261d030e4c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 827,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the marginal value of intelligence is really small.",
          "timestamp_start": 3220.3399999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3222.98,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6400000000003274
        },
        {
          "id": "1375004c-551b-4c17-b098-9178aa419cb0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 828,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "The marginal value of energy is very small.",
          "timestamp_start": 3222.98,
          "timestamp_end": 3225.68,
          "duration_seconds": 2.699999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "44517a3b-08bb-49cd-afee-c810e854b12d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 829,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So the question of life theory is kind of like trying to talk about that world.",
          "timestamp_start": 3225.68,
          "timestamp_end": 3232.9199999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 7.239999999999782
        },
        {
          "id": "79dadd78-e12f-425e-849c-ed197e1ec13b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 830,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "How can you, how, how weird will this world be?",
          "timestamp_start": 3232.92,
          "timestamp_end": 3235.6,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6799999999998363
        },
        {
          "id": "5a59e594-51fe-4963-839e-e2562185eb2f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 831,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Because the world will not be dystopian or utopian, or it won't look.",
          "timestamp_start": 3235.62,
          "timestamp_end": 3240.12,
          "duration_seconds": 4.5
        },
        {
          "id": "d156d299-a34f-43af-9e8e-9dcdd6404c12",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 832,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's like trying to explain today's world to someone a hundred years ago, a thousand",
          "timestamp_start": 3240.64,
          "timestamp_end": 3243.6800000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 3.0400000000004184
        },
        {
          "id": "f64986fc-87d2-4740-bd77-a7d6d9dee3bf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 833,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "years ago, might be very hard to map things in our current world to concepts in their",
          "timestamp_start": 3243.6800000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3248.1,
          "duration_seconds": 4.419999999999618
        },
        {
          "id": "f4d92b3b-d10c-46e1-a7a4-ba8a4dacc8b1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 834,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "world. Does it make sense?",
          "timestamp_start": 3248.1,
          "timestamp_end": 3250.48,
          "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "a34c5f4e-bca9-46b3-88ad-6089897902d2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 835,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So, so life theory is kind of like building tools and, uh, and the, the metaphysics",
          "timestamp_start": 3250.48,
          "timestamp_end": 3258.28,
          "duration_seconds": 7.800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "0aeaa59c-cecd-4a06-9930-7c67398f61fb",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 836,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and theory for a world where moderate intelligence is available at scale.",
          "timestamp_start": 3258.28,
          "timestamp_end": 3262.6,
          "duration_seconds": 4.319999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "a263dd42-0d2f-407e-aece-a47274fcae12",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 837,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think that's the kind of like a basic idea of life theory.",
          "timestamp_start": 3262.92,
          "timestamp_end": 3266.04,
          "duration_seconds": 3.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "9a2064a3-3d30-4cb4-b547-d8abc65174ff",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 838,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right.",
          "timestamp_start": 3266.76,
          "timestamp_end": 3267.3,
          "duration_seconds": 0.5399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "1b209a92-2555-4fce-a011-c03347f86175",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 839,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You're saying near human intelligence, intelligent agents,",
          "timestamp_start": 3267.3,
          "timestamp_end": 3272.3,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "8a4b76b6-52bc-42aa-b1d7-4d42aa88d6f6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 840,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "if they're available at scale, like how the internet is available",
          "timestamp_start": 3272.8,
          "timestamp_end": 3276.76,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "a20506d8-cfd4-41c1-af29-1fd5b9447e76",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 841,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or video teleconferencing is available,",
          "timestamp_start": 3276.76,
          "timestamp_end": 3279.96,
          "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "066aad2d-92f8-4a09-948f-d66d5102ab5c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 842,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "what does that world kind of look like?",
          "timestamp_start": 3281,
          "timestamp_end": 3282.54,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "c58195da-cacb-4139-8b3c-46ca772bf3a5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 843,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And what are the implications of that?",
          "timestamp_start": 3282.54,
          "timestamp_end": 3284.12,
          "duration_seconds": 1.5799999999999272
        },
        {
          "id": "b199d109-445d-4879-a199-c40ca0539d1f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 844,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right?",
          "timestamp_start": 3284.12,
          "timestamp_end": 3284.84,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7200000000002547
        },
        {
          "id": "3c802e55-0988-43ce-90c6-c00de3c5cd20",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 845,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, exactly.",
          "timestamp_start": 3284.84,
          "timestamp_end": 3285.58,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "07b5d55e-5d4a-454d-b0a9-63d9c90f98b5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 846,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And you're saying this will be very cheap.",
          "timestamp_start": 3286.42,
          "timestamp_end": 3288.12,
          "duration_seconds": 1.699999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "5a33abfb-5e13-4fd6-a6cb-f646080c44c1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 847,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like already we keep seeing the prices of LLM models",
          "timestamp_start": 3288.12,
          "timestamp_end": 3292.6800000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 4.5600000000004
        },
        {
          "id": "5bb8108a-14c1-4caf-a7ec-4586726ebc25",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 848,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "going down every month.",
          "timestamp_start": 3292.68,
          "timestamp_end": 3293.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 1.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "d1c707d6-5fbb-48cd-a819-a021609e5f54",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 849,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And I don't think it'll be too far or too much of a stretch to say these intelligent",
          "timestamp_start": 3294.62,
          "timestamp_end": 3302.18,
          "duration_seconds": 7.559999999999945
        },
        {
          "id": "3d8f078a-81d2-4346-8db2-e3bb6967df3d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 850,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "systems will be available for really cheap in the coming years, in the near future.",
          "timestamp_start": 3302.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3307.8999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 5.7199999999998
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "Now in that world, we won't have ASI.",
