      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "506877cb-c3e7-4193-8f89-d40abca53178",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 880,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So what happens when you move from a low actuation space where communication was difficult.",
          "timestamp_start": 3420.12,
          "timestamp_end": 3429.3599999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 9.239999999999782
        },
        {
          "id": "7ed18ede-8a36-4524-a4fa-4ecd94613362",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 881,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We had communicating with someone who used to take writing a letter, you know, actually",
          "timestamp_start": 3429.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3433.02,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "6266f4db-5e80-4227-b32c-e418bd6f6a16",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 882,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "writing a long letter and sending it by snail mail.",
          "timestamp_start": 3433.02,
          "timestamp_end": 3435.6,
          "duration_seconds": 2.5799999999999272
        },
        {
          "id": "1f14ab8d-f677-4f2d-ad38-b7e4f5d35583",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 883,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Now we can text anyone we want, call anyone we want.",
          "timestamp_start": 3435.6,
          "timestamp_end": 3438.44,
          "duration_seconds": 2.8400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "ad02e522-755d-4134-95d4-5e2ef3890e48",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 884,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So we're already seeing slowly a lot of these barriers are breaking down where we are literally",
          "timestamp_start": 3438.44,
          "timestamp_end": 3443.9,
          "duration_seconds": 5.460000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "fe5275dc-9a22-4432-88b0-7f535998145a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 885,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "entering a domain of freedom, where we have the ability to do so much.",
          "timestamp_start": 3443.9,
          "timestamp_end": 3447.82,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "59ad3f93-e04b-454d-a23e-b695e74e2041",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 886,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And this freedom is consuming us because we can eat anything we want.",
          "timestamp_start": 3447.82,
          "timestamp_end": 3452.06,
          "duration_seconds": 4.239999999999782
        },
        {
          "id": "f541f266-71d7-4369-b3ec-8e3938693a36",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 887,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We can call anyone we want.",
          "timestamp_start": 3452.06,
          "timestamp_end": 3453.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 1.580000000000382
        },
        {
          "id": "54c5f0be-1db2-4c68-95a7-bee3567c933f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 888,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We can write anything you want.",
          "timestamp_start": 3453.6400000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3454.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "a5a034c2-ae19-4753-8ee8-a2257bcc3626",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 889,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So now what actually controls our choices?",
          "timestamp_start": 3454.6400000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3457.84,
          "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "2a1eea0d-7593-4cbc-9949-d9a28072c8fb",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 890,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "How do you decide what to do?",
          "timestamp_start": 3457.84,
          "timestamp_end": 3459.3,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "9745112b-b10a-4e69-a673-76096551ecd8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 891,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "This is actually a very deep question and that's what I mean by high explanation.",
          "timestamp_start": 3459.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3466.36,
          "duration_seconds": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "373c689a-5b5c-4865-82b3-830d44b57525",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 892,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, that's going to happen with intelligence.",
          "timestamp_start": 3466.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3469.36,
          "duration_seconds": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "7f280a02-0161-49a5-9456-6638a7e81277",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 893,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Exactly.",
          "timestamp_start": 3469.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3470.36,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "d2c489b6-84ec-446e-b261-2327a0b35655",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 894,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Because right now intelligence is expensive.",
          "timestamp_start": 3470.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3472.36,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "8afb0ad8-f0d4-4965-ab9e-328aba14a3c8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 895,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like I need to hire you to be my assistant.",
          "timestamp_start": 3472.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3474.36,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "b2469fd9-0295-411f-9602-de33ed17bf4f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 896,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "All these things I needed for, I need to spend my attention.",
          "timestamp_start": 3474.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3477.36,
          "duration_seconds": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "2a63deb5-f07c-4df4-98ed-f4197b018998",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 897,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like my attention, I have to actually, they are so used to thinking of intelligence as",
          "timestamp_start": 3477.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3482.36,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "8a75abcf-be4c-4c4f-a723-cb0a9659044d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 898,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "a commodity that is scarce.",
          "timestamp_start": 3482.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3484.36,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "74f865c3-05e5-442a-a92e-282f72703937",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 899,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We are not even thinking about what reality looks like.",
          "timestamp_start": 3484.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3487.36,
          "duration_seconds": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "be1847c5-dc54-4eda-a568-aba93284ec6e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 900,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "having the imagination to really dream of a world exactly so i was very thrilled to hear sahil's",
          "timestamp_start": 3487.36,
          "timestamp_end": 3497.92,
          "duration_seconds": 10.559999999999945
        },
        {
          "id": "548065ae-c746-44d8-b962-ca9e1d55cb7c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 901,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "ideas because i was like this sounds crazy it sounds very interesting and i think in the near",
          "timestamp_start": 3497.92,
          "timestamp_end": 3504.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 6.720000000000255
        },
        {
          "id": "e52a1ea2-6c3b-4587-b738-992b0f0b278a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 902,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "future that's the thing yeah you don't have to wait decades for this this is not even asi agi",
          "timestamp_start": 3504.6400000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3510.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "d3973299-ab2b-4470-b9af-855be4d037d6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 903,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or anything this is like i'm talking about like chat gpt if you use it the right way uh with the",
          "timestamp_start": 3510.6400000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3515.84,
          "duration_seconds": 5.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "edd9b228-3a58-452b-8cf8-bc296017e80b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 904,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the right prompt programming and if it's cheap enough, it can make small, small things happen.",
          "timestamp_start": 3515.84,
          "timestamp_end": 3520,
          "duration_seconds": 4.1599999999998545
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "So what happens when you move from a low actuation space where communication was difficult.",
