      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "2d16db2a-21cf-4e5b-a397-776347a2a53f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 905,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So, right. So you spoke about things that can be areas where synthetic data can be generated,",
          "timestamp_start": 3520,
          "timestamp_end": 3532.32,
          "duration_seconds": 12.320000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "d64ef36a-0154-495b-8ac4-f256eb6a4b16",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 906,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "will be disruptable, right? We will achieve some level of maybe intelligence to human intelligence",
          "timestamp_start": 3532.32,
          "timestamp_end": 3541.04,
          "duration_seconds": 8.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "c17f2ea1-18a7-4658-bb7b-dbd2b0789622",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 907,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to maybe greater intelligence on those kind of domains and at scale.",
          "timestamp_start": 3541.04,
          "timestamp_end": 3547.38,
          "duration_seconds": 6.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "28626a06-d93c-4d84-be7d-ec229bcc0ce6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 908,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So are you saying things like writing, doing science, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 3547.38,
          "timestamp_end": 3552.56,
          "duration_seconds": 5.179999999999836
        },
        {
          "id": "fa3ed52c-8bd5-49a6-b8f7-f5b8fff3ce68",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 909,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Which is something a lot of people are interested in.",
          "timestamp_start": 3552.56,
          "timestamp_end": 3555.2799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "d44a58d6-658f-4672-bf38-e48e5c9b6cf6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 910,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Is like, can an intelligence system, which is like an AGI system,",
          "timestamp_start": 3555.2799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3559.88,
          "duration_seconds": 4.600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "6132846c-aa7e-4a7a-92a9-2338c9c87127",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 911,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in the near future, automate science?",
          "timestamp_start": 3559.88,
          "timestamp_end": 3564.04,
          "duration_seconds": 4.1599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "976e27dd-3b5c-4605-8d2f-8dd97b238232",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 912,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right, right.",
          "timestamp_start": 3564.04,
          "timestamp_end": 3564.94,
          "duration_seconds": 0.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "b5cce2e0-8f60-4dd6-8525-20c2e4077f06",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 913,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I think there are two different things here.",
          "timestamp_start": 3564.94,
          "timestamp_end": 3567.46,
          "duration_seconds": 2.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "dd55a63e-5f9f-4d49-8300-4f4038b254ff",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 914,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "May I talked about simulating synthetic data?",
          "timestamp_start": 3567.46,
          "timestamp_end": 3570.38,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "14beeaa0-be40-4901-ae37-92acb62d91c1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 915,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I'm talking about super intelligence.",
          "timestamp_start": 3570.38,
          "timestamp_end": 3572.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3200000000001637
        },
        {
          "id": "fd6dd5c9-c449-46bf-a96a-8ece8558a10d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 916,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I'm talking about, you know, in areas like chess,",
          "timestamp_start": 3572.7000000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3575.62,
          "duration_seconds": 2.919999999999618
        },
        {
          "id": "dd63bedd-47b5-4c1d-bd99-80b3115e3485",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 917,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or there is no human being or no collection of human beings",
          "timestamp_start": 3575.62,
          "timestamp_end": 3579.1400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 3.5200000000004366
        },
        {
          "id": "ee8482b7-0f2d-4e14-9fea-6b9ad933b251",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 918,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that can even come close to the best AI system",
          "timestamp_start": 3579.1400000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3581.88,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "4541e1c0-56f0-44a6-9e75-cbac6662d66a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 919,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in playing chess, same way with protein folding.",
          "timestamp_start": 3581.88,
          "timestamp_end": 3585.78,
          "duration_seconds": 3.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "99aca6f1-ad1a-4fac-b9ca-84ba11ab4fc5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 920,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So we have certain domains where the AI is so far beyond us",
          "timestamp_start": 3585.78,
          "timestamp_end": 3589.96,
          "duration_seconds": 4.179999999999836
        },
        {
          "id": "04951897-3605-4bc4-92be-92c2dfc98d16",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 921,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that there's no comparison anymore.",
          "timestamp_start": 3589.96,
          "timestamp_end": 3592.2200000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.2600000000002183
        },
        {
          "id": "e6ddb09c-f4cd-4d43-ad7e-038131aea05d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 922,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And I'm talking about that level is what I'm talking about",
          "timestamp_start": 3592.2200000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3595.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 3.480000000000018
        },
        {
          "id": "977025b8-e57c-42ba-942f-5e9c3180f0bc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 923,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in the area of mathematical theorem proving",
          "timestamp_start": 3595.7000000000003,
          "timestamp_end": 3598.6400000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9400000000000546
        },
        {
          "id": "422862de-39f3-4026-8837-9f50be4615a6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 924,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and in the area of coding, where I think are the next few areas to be disrupted on that level.",
          "timestamp_start": 3598.64,
          "timestamp_end": 3603.92,
          "duration_seconds": 5.2800000000002
        }
      ],
