      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "d4935e00-d756-4ac6-a8a4-3c0d500682e1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 925,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But that doesn't, is not necessary for the live theory aspect.",
          "timestamp_start": 3604.4,
          "timestamp_end": 3609.56,
          "duration_seconds": 5.1599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "1b91b2f1-d80e-47d0-92b5-654c32906416",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 926,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Even with the current systems are slightly more improvement happening with less hallucinations and more lower cost.",
          "timestamp_start": 3609.8399999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3618.14,
          "duration_seconds": 8.300000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "e680a637-17f3-4e3f-9349-4439aa213d53",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 927,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We can see disruption happening just by virtue of the scale of it.",
          "timestamp_start": 3618.8399999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3623.54,
          "duration_seconds": 4.700000000000273
        },
        {
          "id": "1d692f24-7f5e-4cbc-99c6-6ea61f048175",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 928,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like, so that being able to write a creative writing or changing the style of things, be",
          "timestamp_start": 3623.54,
          "timestamp_end": 3632.08,
          "duration_seconds": 8.539999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "d7cdb2fc-11bf-4899-9289-36acf9448827",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 929,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "able to scrub what is private from the right now, as I'm talking to you, you have author",
          "timestamp_start": 3632.08,
          "timestamp_end": 3640,
          "duration_seconds": 7.920000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "7b5855ce-c66d-48ff-a0a5-c94bc3d6ec57",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 930,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "AI taking notes on our conversation.",
          "timestamp_start": 3640,
          "timestamp_end": 3642.04,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "c283789a-4952-43bc-9ec0-fdd300e2d83f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 931,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It would be really be useful if we could beat it, not as a silent spectator, but as an active",
          "timestamp_start": 3642.66,
          "timestamp_end": 3647.92,
          "duration_seconds": 5.260000000000218
        },
        {
          "id": "5fe3a5d8-8e16-4e2f-8f4c-571ab60c1401",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 932,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "participant in the conversation.",
          "timestamp_start": 3647.92,
          "timestamp_end": 3649.18,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "c8a0d7ec-1150-459b-a63c-4e247c0161bc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 933,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Think about what is possible right now with, uh, with this, no special distinction between",
          "timestamp_start": 3649.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3656.16,
          "duration_seconds": 6.980000000000018
        },
        {
          "id": "1b2011c5-ed31-40c4-97fd-66472e9a7b85",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 934,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the communication I'm having with you, but I can kind of intermix commands where I can",
          "timestamp_start": 3656.16,
          "timestamp_end": 3661.12,
          "duration_seconds": 4.960000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "04c1b7a3-8821-4100-84d6-817a1b9f8f39",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 935,
