        {
          "id": "9d85b927-9974-4ede-88a7-26a395a46d99",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 950,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I'm highly confused.",
          "timestamp_start": 3705.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3706.18,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "d852f7ce-a591-432e-a140-a31f6e3079fa",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 951,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "uncertain. I don't think we are there yet. I don't think you, I don't think we're reaching a point",
          "timestamp_start": 3706.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3711.3799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 5.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "8559a1f3-7529-470b-8123-ed01f99c7d77",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 952,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "where we can just tell the AI, prove Riemann hypothesis, or if you give it an open-ended",
          "timestamp_start": 3711.3799999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3717.62,
          "duration_seconds": 6.2400000000002365
        },
        {
          "id": "5aec86b8-a730-46e4-9574-18a909d1a454",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 953,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "problem, right, where you just tell it to solve some open problem in physics or material science",
          "timestamp_start": 3717.62,
          "timestamp_end": 3723.06,
          "duration_seconds": 5.440000000000055
        },
        {
          "id": "3690de72-06b1-491d-b188-8da364c54e7d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 954,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "or anything, I don't think we're going to be hitting a point where it will just go and do it",
          "timestamp_start": 3723.06,
          "timestamp_end": 3726.74,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6799999999998363
        },
        {
          "id": "c6f6259c-ae32-42e5-a520-1d08e6bcb9b9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 955,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and come back. That requires like long horizon window planning, grounding problem to be solved,",
          "timestamp_start": 3726.74,
          "timestamp_end": 3733.06,
          "duration_seconds": 6.320000000000164
        },
        {
          "id": "9a255e22-02d7-4d55-89fc-f3fdae198704",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 956,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "embodiment, then like simulation of experiments that can't be done right now, completely in",
          "timestamp_start": 3733.06,
          "timestamp_end": 3740.2599999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 7.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "e1b042ef-519c-494a-8ee8-3b2905c9b3b7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 957,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the virtual environment.",
          "timestamp_start": 3740.2599999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 3741.14,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8800000000001091
        },
        {
          "id": "b0f7acba-d576-47b0-a85a-a3208ff97304",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 958,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think we're a bit far away from that.",
          "timestamp_start": 3742.18,
          "timestamp_end": 3743.54,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3600000000001273
        },
        {
          "id": "7c614df6-c81c-4d69-a673-15e32290b028",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 959,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And I think automation will look less like you do it and come back with the answer and more like",
          "timestamp_start": 3744.98,
          "timestamp_end": 3751.38,
          "duration_seconds": 6.400000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "53020678-d677-471b-8239-e202fd9c7f64",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 960,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "humans and AI collaborating deeply.",
          "timestamp_start": 3751.38,
          "timestamp_end": 3753.38,
          "duration_seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "c0006b9a-052b-41cf-b5ac-4c443e7b585a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 961,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like there will be like constant to and fro where, you know, it will ask us what we're interested in.",
          "timestamp_start": 3753.94,
          "timestamp_end": 3758.9,
          "duration_seconds": 4.960000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "6ccd4597-dd3c-413d-9806-4cc8820dc98c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 962,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like humans will be providing the source of meaning.",
          "timestamp_start": 3758.9,
          "timestamp_end": 3761.2999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "3552de8f-1128-4ad9-aca1-182886aea6cf",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 963,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like we know what we care about we know what is interesting and we'll be providing that to the",
          "timestamp_start": 3761.3,
          "timestamp_end": 3765.3,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "a9319754-5262-4207-bb68-5a64f605cb13",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 964,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "systems so what we are good at uh is the salience aspect or the relevance aspect of finding what is",
          "timestamp_start": 3765.3,
          "timestamp_end": 3772.1000000000004,
          "duration_seconds": 6.800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "8c3e06e0-8ee9-4c58-b5bb-eedeb2e3c13a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 965,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "relevant while the ai is a good for search so it can do both uh babble and prune babble would be",
          "timestamp_start": 3772.1000000000004,
          "timestamp_end": 3778.82,
          "duration_seconds": 6.7199999999998
        },
        {
          "id": "b549af45-ba7f-4443-9ff0-cfc56665d1d0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 966,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like you can create many many possible hypothesis and it can kind of also provide like fast checking",
          "timestamp_start": 3778.82,
          "timestamp_end": 3785.7000000000003,
          "duration_seconds": 6.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "3590180a-56f5-483e-a46f-6a3a42c4ad87",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 967,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "of these things and filtering them out as not viable candidates.",
          "timestamp_start": 3785.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3789.7,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "e649ce1b-9a71-4377-84e5-52c3da03abc5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 968,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So it'll look, it'll have some, in the short term, some bottlenecks I feel.",
          "timestamp_start": 3789.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3796.7,
          "duration_seconds": 7
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "The other thing is doing science and research is a whole other topic where I think, yeah,",
