        },
        {
          "id": "9fa2a57f-ec11-43ad-a68b-c95839da288d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 970,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And I was going to ask you something.",
          "timestamp_start": 3799.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3803.7,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "b28f3322-3708-41e1-b8d8-5764e51a78d2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 971,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Can you give a little more, a few more examples like the one you gave on conversations and",
          "timestamp_start": 3803.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3810.7,
          "duration_seconds": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "9b5d5af5-bda3-4ae1-9d9d-292036266dee",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 972,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "with moderately intelligent systems at scale.",
          "timestamp_start": 3810.7,
          "timestamp_end": 3815.04,
          "duration_seconds": 4.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "8cf81a33-e898-44b7-8c58-c372a1f08dea",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 973,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Maybe give us a few more examples on what that world might look like.",
          "timestamp_start": 3816.9399999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3821.06,
          "duration_seconds": 4.120000000000346
        },
        {
          "id": "a2c5c47d-e34a-4a82-9faf-8de4d862e8b7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 974,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 3821.9199999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3822.3999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 0.4800000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "72236d12-1884-4522-9fc9-b3c3bb5b2091",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 975,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So I think if you check out the link I'm putting on LiveTheories post part zero,",
          "timestamp_start": 3822.64,
          "timestamp_end": 3827.98,
          "duration_seconds": 5.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "bd5d6712-955a-46f1-a359-b7d3c2e21611",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 976,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "which Sahil wrote,",
          "timestamp_start": 3828.14,
          "timestamp_end": 3828.8999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7599999999997635
        },
        {
          "id": "d9fb4270-1d0c-4f6f-aa1a-1633856b24d6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 977,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think what it looks like is like understand that generating content is going",
          "timestamp_start": 3829.58,
          "timestamp_end": 3834.1,
          "duration_seconds": 4.519999999999982
        },
        {
          "id": "bffde806-836e-42a2-994a-dce9ca441cd9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 978,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "to become very cheap.",
          "timestamp_start": 3834.1,
          "timestamp_end": 3834.8799999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 0.7799999999997453
        },
        {
          "id": "121a6f0f-8533-474e-8d19-19ba8f20076e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 979,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You've already seen great generation of flat models that are creating great",
          "timestamp_start": 3834.9399999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3838.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.5600000000004
        },
        {
          "id": "3d2b096e-65a7-43e8-be3c-eed29693a5e2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 980,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "pictures.",
          "timestamp_start": 3838.5,
          "timestamp_end": 3839.12,
          "duration_seconds": 0.6199999999998909
        },
        {
          "id": "c5aee800-328f-44ce-a192-1599e549e51e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 981,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We're going to have creating of video coming out soon.",
          "timestamp_start": 3839.12,
          "timestamp_end": 3841.48,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3600000000001273
        },
        {
          "id": "aa13f143-1757-4c8b-b9af-e063393851fb",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 982,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Creating of text is also very much possible.",
          "timestamp_start": 3841.48,
          "timestamp_end": 3844.3599999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 2.8799999999996544
        },
        {
          "id": "51d0ddb5-ddb0-4d97-89c7-50d7bcf471b2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 983,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So understand that we are now moving away from indexing towards generation.",
          "timestamp_start": 3844.3599999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3849.2599999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 4.900000000000091
        },
        {
          "id": "25594b7f-5ec3-4b49-b85c-f3e16d4e432e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 984,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So when I say indexing, what I mean is when I'm consuming a book right now, I can pick",
          "timestamp_start": 3849.2599999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 3857.2999999999997,
          "duration_seconds": 8.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "d3b5c76a-3630-469b-be43-47b70012cfa0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 985,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "from a list of possible fonts, which font I want to read the book in.",
          "timestamp_start": 3857.2999999999997,
          "timestamp_end": 3861.24,
          "duration_seconds": 3.9400000000000546
        },
        {
          "id": "fac64eee-3407-47f3-b05a-c8346845a2f3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 986,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "This is crazy for someone in the past, because when you print a book, you have to also fix",
          "timestamp_start": 3861.24,
          "timestamp_end": 3866.24,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "83f0d68b-621c-4d20-8dbc-fb64534f2df3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 987,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "the typeface and the font and now it's possible to modify aspects of the of the content at",
          "timestamp_start": 3866.24,
          "timestamp_end": 3875.8999999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 9.659999999999854
        },
        {
          "id": "b182376e-3c18-4954-9ad8-66d160635229",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 988,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "just in time just like how you have just in time compilation of code you can do just in",
          "timestamp_start": 3875.8999999999996,
          "timestamp_end": 3879.7599999999998,
          "duration_seconds": 3.8600000000001273
        },
        {
          "id": "0a9ec78e-9d12-475e-8a62-8699a1de86ad",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 989,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "time creation of the post or the book from the original prompt seed so the idea is if",
          "timestamp_start": 3879.7599999999998,
          "timestamp_end": 3891.9399999999996,
          "duration_seconds": 12.179999999999836
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "Right, right, right.",
