      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "2e031afa-eed0-48f7-b684-5a8218e003fd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1069,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "explored those as much i will definitely check it out uh but yeah this is so fascinating right",
          "timestamp_start": 4201.88,
          "timestamp_end": 4208,
          "duration_seconds": 6.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "0ef518f3-0a1f-427c-a4e9-990937a5d4a1",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1070,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like uh the question is again does it increase empathy does it decrease empathy where do you like",
          "timestamp_start": 4208,
          "timestamp_end": 4214.04,
          "duration_seconds": 6.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "66c5b4c8-3d33-4db8-bf94-4ad47d908d7b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1071,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like you're not directly kind of say communicating with the person but there is this kind of",
          "timestamp_start": 4214.04,
          "timestamp_end": 4221.8,
          "duration_seconds": 7.760000000000218
        },
        {
          "id": "9732e51f-38e2-4c0e-95d3-4da3ef3d41e6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1072,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "of thing in between you both, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 4221.8,
          "timestamp_end": 4226,
          "duration_seconds": 4.199999999999818
        },
        {
          "id": "fc29ac0c-d074-40e0-8511-25b426c04628",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1073,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like, yeah, like that.",
          "timestamp_start": 4227.02,
          "timestamp_end": 4229.06,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "dd0c977e-daa5-4bf8-bf12-962451b63474",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1074,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think it looks, there's a lot of scope here for horrible futures.",
          "timestamp_start": 4230.74,
          "timestamp_end": 4234.92,
          "duration_seconds": 4.180000000000291
        },
        {
          "id": "268bc4e2-68b5-44c0-8134-b4e4de18115d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1075,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like the way I see it is if you sit back and let other people do stuff, we are",
          "timestamp_start": 4235.18,
          "timestamp_end": 4240.22,
          "duration_seconds": 5.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "90412298-683c-4b9a-9916-8cf3c4e3716e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1076,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "going to definitely go into a dystopia.",
          "timestamp_start": 4240.22,
          "timestamp_end": 4241.96,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "f16bc068-98f5-461d-b04f-6900511aec28",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1077,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "By default, the trajectory looks like we're living, going to live in a very bad",
          "timestamp_start": 4242.34,
          "timestamp_end": 4245.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.1599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "c8eee5fd-b2a9-4828-93fd-0478fbd16780",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1078,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "world, so there's no way, but to jump in and to actually build stuff and",
          "timestamp_start": 4245.5,
          "timestamp_end": 4251.54,
          "duration_seconds": 6.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "3f9e73d0-d15f-43a6-ab73-2303fbc09d39",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1079,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "be honest about it, communicate it and then there are like good futures out there.",
          "timestamp_start": 4251.8,
          "timestamp_end": 4258.7,
          "duration_seconds": 6.899999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "031a010d-c79e-43cb-bdb0-527498de4f47",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1080,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You have to imagine a positive future and aim for that because just keeping on talking",
          "timestamp_start": 4258.7,
          "timestamp_end": 4263.62,
          "duration_seconds": 4.920000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "4d74b34a-0a32-42ef-9650-c395dab380dc",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1081,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "about negative futures and avoiding it doesn't have...",
          "timestamp_start": 4263.62,
          "timestamp_end": 4266.58,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "0d707bf8-5438-4f65-9f66-4730e82da78d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1082,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Avoiding it means also swirming towards a positive future.",
          "timestamp_start": 4266.58,
          "timestamp_end": 4270.92,
          "duration_seconds": 4.3400000000001455
        },
        {
          "id": "2b54cfaa-2c2e-465b-ab16-41fafa581e77",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1083,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So yeah, I can easily imagine miscommunication, misunderstandings, trusting...",
          "timestamp_start": 4270.92,
          "timestamp_end": 4276.8,
          "duration_seconds": 5.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "287efe39-1810-485f-b8e3-220168cf9510",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1084,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like if I'm in my bubble and you are in your bubble, I have to trust this AI system to",
          "timestamp_start": 4276.8,
          "timestamp_end": 4281.2,
          "duration_seconds": 4.399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "187f28f9-b113-4718-a625-03593ffc9c93",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1085,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "There's no way for me to, I have to, it's like, I am now at the mercy of the system.",
          "timestamp_start": 4281.8,
          "timestamp_end": 4285.46,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "1fb80fd5-39ce-4556-ac79-6a432eb57072",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1086,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like if it's fucking, if I say something and it says something wrong to you, then I have",
          "timestamp_start": 4285.820000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 4290.26,
          "duration_seconds": 4.4399999999996
        },
        {
          "id": "bfa44813-0417-42ea-a0fb-592c55e47020",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1087,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "no way to even fact check it.",
          "timestamp_start": 4290.26,
          "timestamp_end": 4291.400000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 1.1400000000003274
        },
        {
          "id": "e2684c51-a2db-4c26-bfa8-cfd89035055d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1088,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right.",
          "timestamp_start": 4291.400000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 4291.64,
          "duration_seconds": 0.23999999999978172
        },
        {
          "id": "fa866c92-4b7c-47ea-9d74-b0dd5fd82a46",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1089,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Because I don't know what you're saying.",
          "timestamp_start": 4291.64,
