      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "cfe76b6c-6c82-407e-8c2d-86ad4d2e06f7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1090,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And right now we're moving towards that world where yeah, misunderstandings can really happen.",
          "timestamp_start": 4293.5,
          "timestamp_end": 4298.56,
          "duration_seconds": 5.0600000000004
        },
        {
          "id": "b1f12ba7-904d-4e72-9d5f-78f7a22f52d7",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1091,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Cause like, right.",
          "timestamp_start": 4298.56,
          "timestamp_end": 4299.38,
          "duration_seconds": 0.819999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "738234bb-0600-4b3b-a70e-08a3ede12244",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1092,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I, we already see this, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 4299.38,
          "timestamp_end": 4300.7,
          "duration_seconds": 1.319999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "3d0f909f-3b0a-414a-a308-397793a5a2ec",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1093,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like to really talk to someone outside our bubble, we need to really understand all the",
          "timestamp_start": 4300.7,
          "timestamp_end": 4305.18,
          "duration_seconds": 4.480000000000473
        },
        {
          "id": "dd94b393-5dfd-4ae0-b7f1-000c624a3390",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1094,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "context that they have been to.",
          "timestamp_start": 4305.18,
          "timestamp_end": 4306.1,
          "duration_seconds": 0.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "54424f5d-5df8-405e-aea6-3977ac0c60af",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1095,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They've read so many QAnon posts.",
          "timestamp_start": 4306.1,
          "timestamp_end": 4308.2,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0999999999994543
        },
        {
          "id": "9e8edc50-6061-4053-b03b-73546b109773",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1096,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "They've read so much of conspiracy theories.",
          "timestamp_start": 4308.38,
          "timestamp_end": 4310.3,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "eff5c365-8fab-463c-8c07-ea19e1fd7e2f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1097,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "there's no point in talking to them until we are also able to understand what makes them believe",
          "timestamp_start": 4310.3,
          "timestamp_end": 4315.26,
          "duration_seconds": 4.960000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "2fc27c0f-e42d-4ed0-8cf1-cd64ba133ab5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1098,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "that if i just go to them and act like you're wrong you're dumb then i'm not really hearing",
          "timestamp_start": 4315.26,
          "timestamp_end": 4319.78,
          "duration_seconds": 4.519999999999527
        },
        {
          "id": "99e0731b-f813-45e4-aa92-3b3f2b4f1c5b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1099,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "them there's no communication happening and most of us don't have the patience to sit and",
          "timestamp_start": 4319.78,
          "timestamp_end": 4324.08,
          "duration_seconds": 4.300000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "17f5d492-b856-4ff0-8d16-e5799b77c5cd",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1100,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "learn their entire bubble and then talk to them so we're already seeing the effects of such bubble",
          "timestamp_start": 4324.08,
          "timestamp_end": 4329.62,
          "duration_seconds": 5.539999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "8cadb28b-a76f-4271-928a-918b2b52b556",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1101,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and people are giving up on trying to bridge the gap so what i'm talking about is going to get worse",
          "timestamp_start": 4329.62,
          "timestamp_end": 4334.9800000000005,
          "duration_seconds": 5.360000000000582
        },
        {
          "id": "c27c2d12-eb50-4f47-a6bb-5d642edb5baa",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1102,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and worse especially because it becomes easier and cheaper to create deep fakes and create the",
          "timestamp_start": 4334.9800000000005,
          "timestamp_end": 4338.7,
          "duration_seconds": 3.719999999999345
        },
        {
          "id": "4f76f9a0-f331-4367-9302-36ab5d0a7b2c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1103,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "bubbles and create fine tuned, generated content and media for everyone.",
          "timestamp_start": 4338.7,
          "timestamp_end": 4343.42,
          "duration_seconds": 4.720000000000255
        },
        {
          "id": "a707b1c0-5b2f-4db7-a1af-e1783fb8e572",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1104,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So yeah, man, I agree.",
          "timestamp_start": 4343.74,
          "timestamp_end": 4345.0599999999995,
          "duration_seconds": 1.319999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "1c5b13e6-8e7d-44d1-8be9-d112bdc1f129",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1105,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Persuasion and it can be used for completely subverting someone's agency.",
          "timestamp_start": 4345.599999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4349.639999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 4.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "74eea8a7-6590-466e-b4d9-290726c0c3a3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1106,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So this is like completely dangerous territory that we have to be very",
          "timestamp_start": 4350.0599999999995,
          "timestamp_end": 4354.0599999999995,
          "duration_seconds": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "e10a6315-0700-4760-8384-ef6c81565764",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1107,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "careful about, but there's no alternative.",
          "timestamp_start": 4354.0599999999995,
          "timestamp_end": 4356.48,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4200000000000728
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "And right now we're moving towards that world where yeah, misunderstandings can really happen.",
