          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like I'm not going to sit back and let market forces and corporate",
          "timestamp_start": 4356.48,
          "timestamp_end": 4360.36,
          "duration_seconds": 3.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "7db9af9d-0da9-48ab-9f13-7d59a2e60967",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1109,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "interests decide what these tools are going to be.",
          "timestamp_start": 4360.36,
          "timestamp_end": 4363.32,
          "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "5d44a6af-1d67-477a-8477-ff512e2cafa4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1110,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You know, I would have liked to live in a world where I could just sit",
          "timestamp_start": 4363.48,
          "timestamp_end": 4365.44,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9600000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "e203dc8e-facb-4edb-88a6-44cac41da6b4",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1111,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "back, finish my PhD, become a professor, read books.",
          "timestamp_start": 4365.44,
          "timestamp_end": 4368.179999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7399999999997817
        },
        {
          "id": "dd163dc2-f4fe-400e-b992-9f8055dfffb2",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1112,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But I have no choice.",
          "timestamp_start": 4368.7,
          "timestamp_end": 4370.139999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4399999999995998
        },
        {
          "id": "fde44337-dbff-4f1c-aa91-1818ec2bfe44",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1113,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I have to rise up and do something about this.",
          "timestamp_start": 4370.139999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4374.639999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 4.5
        },
        {
          "id": "02c990d1-2f45-4c1a-8b63-46259e5d9f24",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1114,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So it's a, it's a, it's a low probability, but worth trying for empathy can be increased.",
          "timestamp_start": 4374.639999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4379.639999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "dbf36389-70e1-44c4-8595-a7e73d31ab1e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1115,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I say empathy can be increased, but it's hard.",
          "timestamp_start": 4379.639999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4382.26,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6200000000008004
        },
        {
          "id": "22488b58-4e8e-4e34-84f2-9c13b55a1ca6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1116,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 4383.16,
          "timestamp_end": 4383.38,
          "duration_seconds": 0.22000000000025466
        },
        {
          "id": "c59b12c3-3e4e-4114-a5ec-b18a0257652b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1117,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Most by default, it will be reduced by default.",
          "timestamp_start": 4383.38,
          "timestamp_end": 4386.639999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 3.259999999999309
        },
        {
          "id": "53fded9e-1b0f-4b39-a8e3-27a76bcebc6a",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1118,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "People will retreat into their shell, but I don't want to talk to you.",
          "timestamp_start": 4386.82,
          "timestamp_end": 4389.7,
          "duration_seconds": 2.880000000000109
        },
        {
          "id": "d8c4a621-7a87-44fb-a20f-0fa4f5378e01",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1119,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I have my, my, my friends, my AI friends, my AI girlfriend, my AI, uh, Netflix, I have",
          "timestamp_start": 4389.7,
          "timestamp_end": 4395.7,
          "duration_seconds": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "3b87a318-61ee-4bdc-94bc-71afd80e6dff",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1120,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "food.",
          "timestamp_start": 4395.94,
          "timestamp_end": 4396.36,
          "duration_seconds": 0.42000000000007276
        },
        {
