      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "805d5f52-cf7a-4181-8198-85505c340578",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1126,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah, I think the solution here will just look like giving control to the person involved, right?",
          "timestamp_start": 4417.32,
          "timestamp_end": 4421.599999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 4.279999999999745
        },
        {
          "id": "b623e670-8716-4b18-b25f-31bb0caa78f5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1127,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Like let the AI really be controlled, not by, you don't buy the AI on subscription plan",
          "timestamp_start": 4421.6,
          "timestamp_end": 4427.42,
          "duration_seconds": 5.819999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "a37ef542-d9fd-4d13-90b7-a71d60b792c9",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1128,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "from Microsoft.",
          "timestamp_start": 4427.42,
          "timestamp_end": 4428.42,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "5b013189-b42b-4ca5-a393-23aa9867d0fe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1129,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You have to train the AI on your system or like have local open source systems, maybe",
          "timestamp_start": 4428.42,
          "timestamp_end": 4433.84,
          "duration_seconds": 5.420000000000073
        },
        {
          "id": "6af9d9dc-ec65-4d52-8554-062a7e0b2898",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1130,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "running on your computer.",
          "timestamp_start": 4433.84,
          "timestamp_end": 4434.64,
          "duration_seconds": 0.8000000000001819
        },
        {
          "id": "bc1d6378-c454-44be-9ffc-68a60afc0085",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1131,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So a lot of the stuff that EAC people say, which I disagree with on some levels, but",
          "timestamp_start": 4434.64,
          "timestamp_end": 4439.660000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 5.020000000000437
        },
        {
          "id": "f4c0c820-fb9e-4677-9bcb-e296eb727a66",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1132,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I also agree with other levels is that you have some offense defense trade off here where",
          "timestamp_start": 4439.660000000001,
          "timestamp_end": 4445.1,
          "duration_seconds": 5.4399999999996
        },
        {
          "id": "328c96a9-0ff4-4e17-9473-8b8870ff2c89",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1133,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "like the reason we have WhatsApp implementing export or end-to-end encryption is because",
          "timestamp_start": 4445.1,
          "timestamp_end": 4452.04,
          "duration_seconds": 6.9399999999996
        },
        {
          "id": "4b53b3d3-3bdf-4d73-a13d-36a05cdcca4b",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1134,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Telegram and Signal push them to offer us better alternatives. So we need a healthy competition",
          "timestamp_start": 4452.04,
          "timestamp_end": 4458.34,
          "duration_seconds": 6.300000000000182
        },
        {
          "id": "57c02533-0ea5-4c4f-8aa4-328536a7a4d8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1135,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "landscape where monopolies are not able to get away with offering shoddy services.",
          "timestamp_start": 4458.34,
          "timestamp_end": 4463.88,
          "duration_seconds": 5.539999999999964
        }
      ],
