          "sequence_number": 1138,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I don't know, but please let us know what you think about open source AI.",
          "timestamp_start": 4474.86,
          "timestamp_end": 4479.86,
          "duration_seconds": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "c7118c45-64f3-4624-9200-c6ecd63e3759",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1139,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Is it too powerful?",
          "timestamp_start": 4479.86,
          "timestamp_end": 4480.86,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ee2dccdf-a542-487b-925d-074f0d088045",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1140,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "timestamp_start": 4480.86,
          "timestamp_end": 4481.86,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "f4b661f2-ded7-47e9-9a26-a14ac3c28b19",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1141,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think we haven't really talked about the, I don't know how much of the audience knows",
          "timestamp_start": 4481.86,
          "timestamp_end": 4485.179999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 3.319999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "c6609947-f665-43e0-9a40-b0fa467b28df",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1142,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "about the sharp left turn or the idea of recursive self-improvement or AGI and these kind of",
          "timestamp_start": 4485.179999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4491.179999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "eb3c0100-4474-4f34-89e1-a03fffcf7e77",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1143,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "words.",
          "timestamp_start": 4491.179999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4492.179999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "224638aa-9545-4a76-8ef5-fc6576a09b04",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1144,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But the idea is that I think we don't, it is kind of irresponsible to keep building frontier",
