      },
      "source_turns": [
        {
          "id": "e37da37d-57cb-4b65-8ea7-afd9b8e0931c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1146,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Okay, so the way I explain this is like this to my friends.",
          "timestamp_start": 4503.86,
          "timestamp_end": 4508.5,
          "duration_seconds": 4.640000000000327
        },
        {
          "id": "8ae68723-8345-4cb1-82bf-f570356b63c5",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1147,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Imagine you have a million dollars, and you're very convinced that gold is the best investment",
          "timestamp_start": 4508.5,
          "timestamp_end": 4513.96,
          "duration_seconds": 5.460000000000036
        },
        {
          "id": "27f6136a-940b-46a7-aa5e-86a9d5781220",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1148,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "because of volatility that's coming up.",
          "timestamp_start": 4513.96,
          "timestamp_end": 4516.139999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.1799999999993815
        },
        {
          "id": "c809471e-a5ca-4119-a0cd-529d07a34e71",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1149,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And you're very, very sure.",
          "timestamp_start": 4516.139999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4517.62,
          "duration_seconds": 1.480000000000473
        },
        {
          "id": "8d523a39-6d5f-49e0-97b0-5d1e491737d0",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1150,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "You have all the explanations that, hey, this year, if you're smart, you have to invest",
          "timestamp_start": 4517.62,
          "timestamp_end": 4521.74,
          "duration_seconds": 4.119999999999891
        },
        {
          "id": "4714ee42-52eb-410e-a6ea-69b0c9b18a84",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1151,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "in gold.",
          "timestamp_start": 4521.74,
          "timestamp_end": 4523.219999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4799999999995634
        },
        {
          "id": "c746dd80-9c69-4915-baa8-c40825d83b1d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1152,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But even if you're very sure of this, you're not going to put all $1 million of your net",
          "timestamp_start": 4523.219999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4526.9,
          "duration_seconds": 3.680000000000291
        },
        {
          "id": "871fd768-a27f-4532-a52b-7e5f0605c3ea",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1153,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "worth into gold.",
          "timestamp_start": 4526.9,
          "timestamp_end": 4527.9,
          "duration_seconds": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "aeeb8c7e-b599-46cb-92ca-930fa3d94140",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
