          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think your notetaker has left the meeting.",
          "timestamp_start": 4588.84,
          "timestamp_end": 4591.88,
          "duration_seconds": 3.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "369757e2-b0b2-4454-b830-e712d51f7113",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1170,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's like given up on it.",
          "timestamp_start": 4591.88,
          "timestamp_end": 4593.360000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 1.480000000000473
        },
        {
          "id": "d40d916d-57e0-4873-82ac-a5b9c390e4fe",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1171,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "It's like, what are you guys talking about?",
          "timestamp_start": 4596,
          "timestamp_end": 4597.360000000001,
          "duration_seconds": 1.360000000000582
        },
        {
          "id": "67155d25-2d3f-4ed6-8d34-f440d2d5fe4f",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1172,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So yeah, I was trying to explain my model of open source.",
          "timestamp_start": 4601.08,
          "timestamp_end": 4603.72,
          "duration_seconds": 2.6400000000003274
        },
        {
          "id": "93cd5d49-3062-47c3-b3b7-5b26f2f1c420",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1173,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Right?",
          "timestamp_start": 4603.72,
          "timestamp_end": 4604.9400000000005,
          "duration_seconds": 1.2200000000002547
        }
      ],
      "source_excerpt": "I think your notetaker has left the meeting.",
