          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "I think we should probably end it there.",
          "timestamp_start": 4831.54,
          "timestamp_end": 4838.58,
          "duration_seconds": 7.039999999999964
        },
        {
          "id": "14656b54-06f1-4054-97cb-3b508a7db855",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1232,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And then continue this conversation and come back to safety and philosophical implications and things like that.",
          "timestamp_start": 4839.58,
          "timestamp_end": 4846.74,
          "duration_seconds": 7.1599999999998545
        },
        {
          "id": "f42c9f0e-506e-4fe7-9c39-50111b475365",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1233,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "But this was, hopefully this will intrigue people to watch our next discussion as well.",
          "timestamp_start": 4847.12,
          "timestamp_end": 4852.62,
          "duration_seconds": 5.5
        },
        {
          "id": "31136d51-f46e-4ce7-904f-e6ce985d4282",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1234,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "And maybe contact me because you can have this conversation on a one-on-one if you can find time on my schedule.",
          "timestamp_start": 4853.64,
          "timestamp_end": 4859.44,
          "duration_seconds": 5.799999999999272
        },
        {
          "id": "65d704f5-e416-41ea-81cb-3dd8fa43a52e",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1235,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "and then, you know, this could be you and me, viewer.",
          "timestamp_start": 4859.44,
          "timestamp_end": 4863.54,
          "duration_seconds": 4.100000000000364
        },
        {
          "id": "09c1947e-1cb3-4561-96bd-25ab588c6f88",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1236,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "So do slide into my DMs.",
          "timestamp_start": 4864.219999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4866.2,
          "duration_seconds": 1.980000000000473
        },
        {
          "id": "145b8b81-19f8-4ac4-8b05-451a6a18a99c",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1237,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Aditya as well.",
          "timestamp_start": 4866.58,
          "timestamp_end": 4867.62,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0399999999999636
        },
        {
          "id": "e0121a70-b4a9-4845-a5df-99b089eddbf8",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1238,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "If you want to continue this fascinating discussion on AI, AI safety,",
          "timestamp_start": 4868.08,
          "timestamp_end": 4872.66,
          "duration_seconds": 4.579999999999927
        },
        {
          "id": "5bac5787-bd49-4355-8df9-d18de70cf4f6",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1239,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "all the good stuff that we spoke about.",
          "timestamp_start": 4873.679999999999,
          "timestamp_end": 4876.099999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 2.4200000000000728
        },
        {
          "id": "3ffaa5e0-63c6-4789-8bb0-3fdc1c56f5b3",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1240,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "We can talk endlessly about this, I'm sure.",
          "timestamp_start": 4876.5199999999995,
          "timestamp_end": 4878.339999999999,
          "duration_seconds": 1.819999999999709
        },
        {
          "id": "2a446ed8-f742-4b8e-8e01-98cbb4d0170d",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1241,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Which we need to do as it went.",
          "timestamp_start": 4879.46,
          "timestamp_end": 4882.24,
          "duration_seconds": 2.7799999999997453
        },
        {
          "id": "499e9f20-997c-48ee-acad-ef6493177755",
          "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
          "sequence_number": 1242,
          "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
          "speaker_name": null,
          "speaker_source": "model",
          "speaker_confidence": null,
          "speaker_revision": 0,
          "text": "Both of us kind of find the time.",
