      "id": "p07",
      "node_name": "Acting when beliefs are consequential but uncertain",
      "summary": "The conversation treats uncertainty as something that must inform choices, while criticizing failure to act on stated beliefs.",
      "level": 3,
      "semantic_level": 3,
