      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But as you might have imagined, like I've changed a lot over the years and I was actually",
      "timestamp_start": 156.76,
      "timestamp_end": 161.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
    },
    {
