      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, sorry, what did you ask?",
      "timestamp_start": 270.48,
      "timestamp_end": 271.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "d52629b1-665f-4293-b719-1665541b98f4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 57,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I said, what about later, like after 4th?",
      "timestamp_start": 271.98,
      "timestamp_end": 273.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "a4517def-0673-41da-8447-711ec7579d13",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 58,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, then my mom was like,",
      "timestamp_start": 274.88,
      "timestamp_end": 276.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "46c79c71-1098-4d34-a0d1-144e135df21b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 59,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "what is this my mom and dad was like having an argument about how my dad wanted to give me the",
      "timestamp_start": 276.4,
      "timestamp_end": 280.79999999999995,
      "duration_seconds": 4.399999999999977
    },
    {
      "id": "87f059f7-6bf0-49be-89d7-08cd6b3fdf46",
