      "duration_seconds": 6.159999999999968
    },
    {
      "id": "382076ff-18d2-41f2-a8a1-0d27c1d0271e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 165,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "at least in school levels i was quite i was into anime i was into we did play video games so we",
      "timestamp_start": 682.2,
      "timestamp_end": 688.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.559999999999945
    },
    {
      "id": "5857d185-dc9e-43a9-a18f-c4b0183f2e19",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 166,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We didn't have a computer at home. It was interesting.",
      "timestamp_start": 688.76,
      "timestamp_end": 691.3199999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "08fa6b43-b65f-4e25-9a54-b0ad647dd9df",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 167,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I was like no more watching TV. Mostly I played Game Boy, Pokemon games and so my childhood was pretty like normal kids childhood.",
      "timestamp_start": 691.3199999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 699.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.080000000000041
    },
    {
      "id": "b2926435-344a-4e27-9009-9856a8425bca",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 168,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Nice. So when did you like switch into... what got you interested into AI, right? AI safety.",
      "timestamp_start": 700.6,
      "timestamp_end": 708.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.919999999999959
    },
    {
      "id": "250008bb-ed05-4f6d-b6a5-b8ac34548c08",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 169,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What led... what was the path that you took that you think led to you working in AI and AI safety?",
      "timestamp_start": 708.52,
      "timestamp_end": 716.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.680000000000064
    },
    {
      "id": "15ad3ed8-af49-4f4e-ab8f-819defdaf83c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 170,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think it started with, uh, in around second, third year of my undergrad.",
      "timestamp_start": 718.76,
      "timestamp_end": 724.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.759999999999991
    },
    {
      "id": "50c8a62a-ae7c-401a-bee2-23385b9fe530",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 171,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I went to undergrad in NIT Trichy and even then I was quite like studying Laplace",
      "timestamp_start": 724.52,
      "timestamp_end": 730.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.940000000000055
    },
    {
      "id": "19ef9bb1-5cbc-4c45-98a8-77420b99acf2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 172,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "transformations for a year, learning linear algebra, being fascinated with mathematics",
      "timestamp_start": 730.46,
      "timestamp_end": 735,
      "duration_seconds": 4.539999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "11d4947d-6cca-4a75-81c7-7d62c66bd249",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 173,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and physics.",
      "timestamp_start": 735,
      "timestamp_end": 736,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "07aee225-a036-42b3-96e7-27ffc904bb70",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 174,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And, uh, even my high school also, I was in Maharishi international residential school",
      "timestamp_start": 736,
      "timestamp_end": 741.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.059999999999945
    },
    {
      "id": "c1db93cf-cee3-4ddb-9754-4047d9c83329",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
