      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "bang or a big crunch how will the end look like i think my questions that fascinated me mostly was",
      "timestamp_start": 762.1,
      "timestamp_end": 767.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67999999999995
    },
    {
      "id": "32a0f47e-529b-4225-bd84-83af6995b363",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 181,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "those questions right and then it was around when i went to so in in undergraduate of my college i",
      "timestamp_start": 767.78,
      "timestamp_end": 776.1800000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 8.400000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "44c73e84-6961-4050-86be-0bfaf5370403",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 182,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I was studying instrumentation and control engineering and we work with",
      "timestamp_start": 776.18,
      "timestamp_end": 780.7399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 4.559999999999945
    },
    {
      "id": "83d6a737-a05c-4948-af3b-598fd383a8c3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 183,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "transistors and we work with electronics and we didn't have that great",
      "timestamp_start": 780.7399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 784.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.660000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "08558ca1-50b8-4dce-a377-8138f179daac",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 184,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "facilities. I would say, even though we were a national college and we had like",
      "timestamp_start": 784.68,
      "timestamp_end": 788.5999999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 3.919999999999959
    },
    {
      "id": "49577008-4d0f-4a2e-b686-f6cf70ecc153",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 185,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
