      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "good rankings, the equipment available in the labs and students' interest",
      "timestamp_start": 788.78,
      "timestamp_end": 793.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.100000000000023
    },
    {
      "id": "beb95222-92b2-4d1c-bf1b-8c9e70d577e2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 186,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "towards doing the experiments, I wouldn't say was up to par.",
      "timestamp_start": 793.88,
      "timestamp_end": 797.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.419999999999959
    },
    {
      "id": "a7f3aecb-45b4-4401-a358-c61ea6deb012",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 187,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like people, I don't know how it was in your college, but they often decide",
      "timestamp_start": 797.5999999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 801.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.900000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "a0a0cdf8-4161-4a03-9708-a606138ff7af",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 188,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "the theoretical values and they perturb the theoretical values to make the",
      "timestamp_start": 801.5,
      "timestamp_end": 805.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "f6aedef1-eb35-43c7-ac71-9396a1a23a04",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 189,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "experimental values and they do all the lab work in a way to just get marks.",
      "timestamp_start": 805.04,
      "timestamp_end": 809.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "e37cf9ce-a801-48b9-9af7-1d4ed5eaaa47",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 190,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "They don't really care about the actual experiment.",
      "timestamp_start": 809.78,
      "timestamp_end": 811.8199999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "3559a888-5edf-4a34-9011-9ab308e36a07",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 191,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And it was breaking me up because as a scientist, I had the spirit of a curious person.",
      "timestamp_start": 812.68,
      "timestamp_end": 817.9599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 5.279999999999973
    },
    {
      "id": "0265bf04-46ce-4a7b-8acf-f40836ddc6c7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 192,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I was like, I remember writing in the notebook, like experiment is not conductable because",
      "timestamp_start": 818.0799999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 822.1999999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1200000000000045
    },
    {
      "id": "0683c14b-d862-4a95-a47a-ab71e0affa2a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 193,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "the instruments are not repeatable and stuff like that.",
      "timestamp_start": 822.1999999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 824.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7000000000000455
    },
    {
      "id": "626da66f-5ae0-4fa8-9b02-3ea7024872f8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 194,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I refused to go down to the peer pressure.",
      "timestamp_start": 824.98,
      "timestamp_end": 828.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.759999999999991
    },
    {
      "id": "7e048760-5668-4141-90b2-8b9354f0787e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 195,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I used to ask questions in class, ask the questions to professors and ask them to explain things.",
      "timestamp_start": 828.9399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 833.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1200000000000045
    },
    {
      "id": "9ce3eafc-dbdd-40cb-84d3-5a548a2344d9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 196,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And then people used to fight with me.",
      "timestamp_start": 833.8199999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 835.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7000000000000455
    },
    {
      "id": "28d13340-7232-4c37-a157-207cb09cdb6a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 197,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I remember some students asked me, why are you making the class go on longer?",
      "timestamp_start": 835.52,
      "timestamp_end": 838.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "a9e5a0a4-4a5b-4067-8d94-863e95ae06d7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 198,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You know, like, let the teacher end the class.",
      "timestamp_start": 838.8,
      "timestamp_end": 841.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "8a7fa6c6-760a-42cb-91b7-d4db1513ba4d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 199,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I want to leave.",
      "timestamp_start": 841.8,
      "timestamp_end": 842.3599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 0.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "97d1244e-0f86-47b2-86bd-94881c54a4dd",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 200,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "If you want to ask questions, ask them in your own time.",
      "timestamp_start": 842.3599999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 844.4599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1000000000000227
    },
    {
      "id": "211b004b-255e-4a7c-9e9b-25c9a7f244f5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 201,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Don't block the entire class for you.",
      "timestamp_start": 844.76,
      "timestamp_end": 846.3399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5799999999999272
    },
    {
      "id": "7a4831e8-13a9-44ce-9c2b-d81d3797e5f8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 202,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Don't be selfish that way.",
      "timestamp_start": 846.5799999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 847.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "035076f5-fd41-4488-b87a-4d29a60b7cd2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 203,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And I was like, you guys came here to study, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 848.2199999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 850.0999999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8799999999999955
    },
    {
      "id": "3735b8e1-d972-4402-8c4c-53a63123d1bb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 204,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like, this is not even like a private college.",
      "timestamp_start": 850.0999999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 852.2399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1399999999999864
    },
    {
      "id": "f1cc33fe-24ec-49ca-a9cd-2bdf890e2244",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 205,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "This is like a government colleges.",
      "timestamp_start": 852.2399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 853.4599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2200000000000273
    },
    {
      "id": "3be62fc7-7b18-4228-bd46-5c55f250ae30",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 206,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We got J E means you got good rank and came here and really love the subject.",
      "timestamp_start": 853.52,
      "timestamp_end": 857.8599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 4.339999999999918
    },
    {
      "id": "0ae58ddc-8d19-47de-ad61-2b9eefb2aae0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 207,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Don't you want to understand?",
      "timestamp_start": 857.8599999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 858.7399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8799999999999955
    },
    {
      "id": "59455fd7-28bf-49f4-93f0-1ef8afe26848",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 208,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I was very frustrated because I didn't feel supported by a lot of people.",
      "timestamp_start": 859.3399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 862.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.300000000000068
    },
    {
      "id": "33f39398-d2f9-4d85-b8c4-bdc28c7c8f30",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 209,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And people are focused on getting marks, getting a job, getting, getting a resume",
      "timestamp_start": 862.64,
      "timestamp_end": 866.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "7d59d0e3-10e2-4352-a63a-f2d822b2a92c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 210,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "padding with internships and papers.",
      "timestamp_start": 866.64,
      "timestamp_end": 868.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2200000000000273
    },
    {
      "id": "0966065e-ba7d-4c4b-9737-b1ba2cff002a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 211,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Everyone is in a rat race and there's no space for them to really explore the curiosity.",
      "timestamp_start": 869.18,
      "timestamp_end": 873.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.220000000000027
    },
    {
      "id": "f9f7ae91-77fe-4694-b273-41375bde6f7e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 212,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And I couldn't do much also because some of the equipment is hard to buy.",
      "timestamp_start": 874.54,
      "timestamp_end": 878.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.980000000000018
    },
    {
      "id": "e2d1cb71-ef32-4f33-aeba-79d1afb3a964",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 213,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And I had these softwares where I could simulate the RLC circuits and everything.",
      "timestamp_start": 878.52,
      "timestamp_end": 883.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.539999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "117c102a-3058-4ec8-bc0e-4c27d2fceb32",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 214,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I did some stuff there, but quickly I realized that the easiest way to do stuff",
      "timestamp_start": 883.06,
      "timestamp_end": 887.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2000000000000455
    },
    {
      "id": "5dfd1304-8e5f-4f37-8aaa-42eb9615f399",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 215,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and iterate quickly and get empirical data is in the field of computer science,",
      "timestamp_start": 887.26,
      "timestamp_end": 891.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82000000000005
    },
    {
      "id": "55c63af0-08c3-4ebb-9cad-38458c0246f6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 216,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "because you can program.",
      "timestamp_start": 891.08,
      "timestamp_end": 891.9399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8599999999999
    },
    {
      "id": "e5070827-fbc6-49cc-aad0-ca5fb04ec483",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 217,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You can write code, you can see the code running.",
      "timestamp_start": 891.94,
      "timestamp_end": 894.0600000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1200000000000045
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3458e5-3eec-434f-92c2-e6f8b2b207a4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 218,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You don't need to get multimeters and transistors.",
      "timestamp_start": 894.0600000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 898.4000000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 4.340000000000032
    },
    {
      "id": "a6d52224-73e6-462b-b027-210922c2022c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 219,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And so whatever I wanted to do, I could do it as a programmer.",
      "timestamp_start": 898.4000000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 901.5400000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1399999999999864
    },
    {
      "id": "0e1e069d-90c9-4f75-b347-8cd97ca32f70",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 220,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I did app development, I built Android applications,",
      "timestamp_start": 901.5400000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 904.8800000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 3.340000000000032
    },
    {
      "id": "b4c44241-afa3-44fb-af5a-4c0ddcdfc912",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 221,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "joined the college club called Spider.",
      "timestamp_start": 904.8800000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 909.6800000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7999999999999545
    },
    {
      "id": "ca19bf23-ed57-4f5b-aa46-c7b9cc80fa47",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 222,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So that's my kind of shift towards programming.",
      "timestamp_start": 909.6800000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 911.5400000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8600000000000136
    },
    {
      "id": "f8402a02-51d3-41f3-96b1-0db09d2ad5ad",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 223,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It happened in my college because of the fact",
      "timestamp_start": 911.5400000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 913.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8999999999999773
    },
    {
      "id": "1cfc3d53-1069-4328-8108-479afb4ae6fc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 224,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "of software is basically the domain where mathematics is cheap,",
      "timestamp_start": 913.44,
      "timestamp_end": 917.5400000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 4.100000000000023
    },
    {
      "id": "1ee4febe-b248-4fe3-b99c-d3efa64e7ba6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 225,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "is what they say.",
      "timestamp_start": 917.5400000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 919.1800000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6399999999999864
    },
    {
      "id": "aa3fcdb7-0fef-4205-ba2d-98a4e840384c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 226,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like physics is where you have to do experiments",
      "timestamp_start": 919.18,
      "timestamp_end": 921.2199999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "b4d9b912-696e-4158-a4d4-4d5ba9e34a77",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 227,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "are costly in real world.",
      "timestamp_start": 921.2199999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 922.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5600000000000591
    },
    {
      "id": "c1486375-867b-48c8-9bf2-a326cbb26dad",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 228,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But experiments are cheap in the world of computers.",
      "timestamp_start": 922.78,
      "timestamp_end": 926.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "7ca6a765-540e-4634-8665-e1d67aa1d0ef",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 229,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right.",
      "timestamp_start": 926.06,
      "timestamp_end": 928.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "242d987c-b531-4674-bd58-a3aa14161c8a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 230,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So that's the kind of shift towards programming.",
      "timestamp_start": 928.02,
      "timestamp_end": 930.8599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.839999999999918
    },
    {
      "id": "ff814576-56bc-4bc7-96fd-4282c5f4e90d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 231,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah?",
      "timestamp_start": 930.8599999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 931.8599999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "795f6ee6-4f8c-4029-bafa-ca97b4099f18",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 232,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "No, I think that's a great way to define computer science",
      "timestamp_start": 931.8599999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 936.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.660000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "1988edcc-b553-45cb-b86c-4c2bf53c90eb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 233,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "versus physics.",
      "timestamp_start": 936.52,
      "timestamp_end": 938.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "18d641f2-38ba-4c1f-846b-73c9e0685991",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 234,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 938.3,
      "timestamp_end": 940.0799999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "106802ac-8f53-456c-b6da-176b2c622b50",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 235,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think it was Victor Arnold who said that quote.",
      "timestamp_start": 940.0799999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 942.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32000000000005
    },
    {
      "id": "3b68086c-8495-43de-9eb0-d05a8f8c3342",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 236,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I love that quote when he said that.",
      "timestamp_start": 942.4,
      "timestamp_end": 943.9399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "e72ce722-621c-4af2-9829-bbd9639a2c91",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 237,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like, recently, Andrish Karpatia, someone retweeted that.",
      "timestamp_start": 943.9399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 948.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82000000000005
    },
    {
      "id": "11c5f726-58c3-4f61-a202-989d39e5c894",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 238,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think the safety aspects came in when I realized that people were really buying into",
      "timestamp_start": 949.18,
      "timestamp_end": 959.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.840000000000032
    },
    {
      "id": "e63644a0-58bc-4485-98a5-313bbcdc0874",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 239,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "the myth of free will.",
      "timestamp_start": 959.02,
      "timestamp_end": 960.8199999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7999999999999545
    },
    {
      "id": "2f35c12b-3c0e-4f76-aa9d-babed916852e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 240,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So Indians especially I could see that they were happy to use products for free, free",
      "timestamp_start": 960.8199999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 965.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.980000000000018
    },
    {
      "id": "554e5919-e00a-4400-955b-a9973f047208",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 241,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Google search, free Facebook.",
      "timestamp_start": 965.8,
      "timestamp_end": 967.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8600000000000136
    },
    {
      "id": "664adcd5-463e-4a3f-af46-cc3b34c8a015",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 242,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Back in 2015, 2013, I was watching how no one wanted to pay for the products they used.",
      "timestamp_start": 967.66,
      "timestamp_end": 974.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.580000000000041
    },
    {
      "id": "16f9a3af-82f9-40df-bed2-631d40b14fb8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 243,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "They spent all their time on the mobile phones and using all these applications and the incentives",
      "timestamp_start": 974.24,
      "timestamp_end": 978.8199999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 4.579999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "f8cb6662-324b-4827-ab8c-d347c3715e9f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 244,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "were completely skewed where the developers were thinking not about their consumers, the",
      "timestamp_start": 978.82,
      "timestamp_end": 983.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8799999999999955
    },
    {
      "id": "68648777-91e2-41af-a549-67b2b66c5949",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 245,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "consumers were just users for them.",
      "timestamp_start": 983.7,
      "timestamp_end": 986.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1399999999999864
    },
    {
      "id": "8c3bf98e-8e50-4131-847f-cac6067d79d2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 246,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "They were thinking about advertisers.",
      "timestamp_start": 986.84,
      "timestamp_end": 988.7600000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9200000000000728
    },
    {
      "id": "edd6b24f-7dbb-449e-86ac-aaef62bb3611",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 247,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The monetizing was completely done where they were trying to get growth, get people to be",
      "timestamp_start": 988.7600000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 993.4200000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 4.659999999999968
    },
    {
      "id": "8444376f-8ccd-441c-baa0-9bcf3b3fb376",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 248,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "addicted to spend more time on their app.",
      "timestamp_start": 993.4200000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 995.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9399999999999409
    },
    {
      "id": "cdce23e4-0564-4854-a8b2-4c4f4b397d16",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 249,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Even dating apps like we discussed, like if the major revenue is not really coming from",
      "timestamp_start": 995.36,
      "timestamp_end": 1000.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "aa621bd7-1e7d-4824-8361-ee6d221a9065",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 250,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "getting people into happy relationships and if they get more money from getting people",
      "timestamp_start": 1000.1,
      "timestamp_end": 1004.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.980000000000018
    },
    {
      "id": "33d91276-1a96-499a-81fb-ec8bf72880ff",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 251,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "keeping on right swiping on each other and having hookups, that's going to happen.",
      "timestamp_start": 1004.08,
      "timestamp_end": 1007.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "409f0ad3-601e-4ea0-9a18-44078da9aef8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 252,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The system will actually end up creating the outcomes that are good for the people building this product.",
      "timestamp_start": 1007.82,
      "timestamp_end": 1012.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.919999999999959
    },
    {
      "id": "70a1dda0-9e9f-4add-92d6-e2fd004e61c5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 253,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right.",
      "timestamp_start": 1013.1600000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 1013.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.4199999999999591
    },
    {
      "id": "55fe2e15-eab8-4fc5-99bd-1a897f8e86f6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 254,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "timestamp_start": 1014.36,
      "timestamp_end": 1014.5200000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 0.16000000000008185
    },
    {
      "id": "4b881cec-497b-4ded-9920-0545441f47c1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 255,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The incentive is completely misaligned, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 1014.5200000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 1016.4000000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8799999999999955
    },
    {
      "id": "6d347013-1e5f-439b-b1f3-e60eaeab9f54",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 256,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "timestamp_start": 1016.44,
      "timestamp_end": 1016.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.2599999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "eb090482-e438-4ede-9f34-a500cee1bc62",
