      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "written online and you're trying to make it predict the next token or the next word.",
      "timestamp_start": 1720.72,
      "timestamp_end": 1725.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8599999999999
    },
    {
      "id": "7a52237f-c4af-47ac-9812-7bdeae424f74",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 427,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So it keeps going and it keeps trying to predict what could the next word be.",
      "timestamp_start": 1725.58,
      "timestamp_end": 1729.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.240000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "88055a1a-4572-44a7-b10c-5430c520eb15",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 428,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So this requires some awareness of context, because if you're reading an article about",
      "timestamp_start": 1729.82,
      "timestamp_end": 1734.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "492cad56-62bd-477d-bcda-ae19c47d58ae",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 429,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "us on Wikipedia, it will be written in a certain style.",
      "timestamp_start": 1734.56,
      "timestamp_end": 1738.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.980000000000018
    },
    {
      "id": "73de3722-efd8-426d-aa2b-03c7e6df6862",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 430,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It has to understand both the content, the style, the context in order to, with a high",
      "timestamp_start": 1738.54,
      "timestamp_end": 1744.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.420000000000073
    },
    {
      "id": "75d21e92-d7c5-48f2-968e-8256c2184bda",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
