      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So you're saying all, all, all they do is train these models, adjust these parameters.",
      "timestamp_start": 1760.6399999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 1768.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.660000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "e8878f20-1b87-492e-94e6-1e427c6a86fe",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
