      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 450,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, like people laughed at OpenAI.",
      "timestamp_start": 1805.9199999999998,
      "timestamp_end": 1807.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3800000000001091
    },
    {
      "id": "d9c6aa96-8d19-49a6-919c-f8da576848f0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 451,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So when OpenAI initially invested a lot of money trying to do this,",
      "timestamp_start": 1807.3999999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 1811.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6200000000001182
    },
    {
      "id": "9fe45331-ff75-4a05-a799-b46a55dd3ecc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 452,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "there are people who said that this is a fool's chase",
      "timestamp_start": 1811.48,
      "timestamp_end": 1814.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.599999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "eacca5e9-9953-467b-bee4-8f009b8d8734",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 453,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "because people have thought that in order to reverse engineer",
      "timestamp_start": 1814.08,
      "timestamp_end": 1816.8999999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8199999999999363
    },
    {
      "id": "fdd298b1-eb8c-4f49-9b14-9f85b914e21c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 454,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "whatever humans can do or to get close to general intelligence,",
      "timestamp_start": 1816.8999999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 1819.6399999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "70a02d80-f177-4835-814b-634ee5dbeaa0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 455,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "you need to make modular parts,",
      "timestamp_start": 1819.76,
      "timestamp_end": 1822.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3599999999999
    },
    {
      "id": "bdd2fe48-32d7-4b1e-a6ea-06e3a5bf6906",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 456,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "like how Google Brain was doing.",
      "timestamp_start": 1822.22,
      "timestamp_end": 1824,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "b18009ef-7be8-407b-9823-1729fbea7ab2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 457,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I don't know. There have been different efforts for this.",
      "timestamp_start": 1824,
      "timestamp_end": 1826.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "d38bb5bd-9490-466d-a4a3-522d6e0bb9b8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 458,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So what we've gotten with ChartGPT was a surprise.",
      "timestamp_start": 1826.96,
      "timestamp_end": 1831.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7000000000000455
    },
    {
      "id": "bcaa4ec7-be11-4aaf-860f-56faefcf3669",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 459,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's definitely something that I think a lot of people need to like take a step back to really examine their models.",
      "timestamp_start": 1831.66,
      "timestamp_end": 1836.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.679999999999836
    },
    {
      "id": "2c84f1c7-5ac7-411c-87d5-b9309a4c242f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 460,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because if your model didn't predict it will work, something's wrong with your model.",
      "timestamp_start": 1836.34,
      "timestamp_end": 1840,
      "duration_seconds": 3.660000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "a38e9e17-f2a3-4d59-813d-ac7b1be72ea0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 461,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like we have to now update our model to be less surprised in the future.",
      "timestamp_start": 1840,
      "timestamp_end": 1843.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6400000000001
    },
    {
      "id": "ef7e2ced-05bf-4359-9061-41c1f8a369b7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 462,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You can't like post ad hoc change the goalpost.",
      "timestamp_start": 1843.64,
      "timestamp_end": 1846.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "0af0595a-dfa2-43c2-91d2-645ffb21971b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 463,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because I think the Turing test was considered to be one of the barriers.",
      "timestamp_start": 1846.84,
      "timestamp_end": 1850.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.900000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "8a54b263-111f-4488-ada2-29da4303f6f5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 464,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So people are like, if an AI can talk like a human being and like convince someone that",
      "timestamp_start": 1850.74,
      "timestamp_end": 1855.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.740000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "b5022c4c-6ef2-4ffc-95c2-405dc930fa47",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 465,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "in a blind test that it is confusing to say who's the human, who's the AI, that's like",
      "timestamp_start": 1855.48,
      "timestamp_end": 1859.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.259999999999991
    },
    {
      "id": "46925d76-9a34-4977-a470-4b853ccbca53",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 466,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "a big breakthrough.",
      "timestamp_start": 1859.74,
      "timestamp_end": 1860.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "c99ea7cd-284c-4929-9654-e285b0fff6da",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 467,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I think that's definitely like a lot of confusions even now fundamentally don't understand",
      "timestamp_start": 1861.1,
      "timestamp_end": 1867.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.660000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "d2b6146f-6b82-4b51-95c2-257972247f50",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 468,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "why this works and why doesn't this overfit.",
      "timestamp_start": 1868.04,
      "timestamp_end": 1870.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.519999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "ab77626d-c4f2-4743-98c1-8c2239ec560f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 469,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like if you think of the example of the different parameters, if you have only like a few data",
      "timestamp_start": 1870.6200000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 1874.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.619999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "38c8789c-21ea-4c63-8b99-f16adb6a24b9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 470,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "points and use a hundred parameters, it'll usually end up overfitting the data that it",
      "timestamp_start": 1874.24,
      "timestamp_end": 1879.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.619999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "a06ab378-21dd-4d97-b4b3-5b5a43a99755",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 471,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It won't generalize very well.",
      "timestamp_start": 1879.86,
      "timestamp_end": 1881,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1400000000001
    },
    {
      "id": "6435bbf8-613d-414a-b503-bae219683df0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 472,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What will end up happening is it will memorize all the data points because the",
      "timestamp_start": 1881.3,
      "timestamp_end": 1885.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.759999999999991
    },
    {
      "id": "a0eef1e9-2795-41b0-aafa-f90aff1b6983",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 473,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "space of possible Wikipedia articles is so large that if you show them billions",
      "timestamp_start": 1885.06,
      "timestamp_end": 1889.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.519999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "ec8773c8-c4b0-45df-8dea-fe83373b7158",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 474,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "of millions of Wikipedia articles, it can't write a okay Wikipedia article.",
      "timestamp_start": 1889.58,
      "timestamp_end": 1894.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.680000000000064
    },
    {
      "id": "23927731-1f86-4064-abe9-086c205acd08",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 475,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It'll just, might as well just spit out the articles it already has seen.",
      "timestamp_start": 1894.5,
      "timestamp_end": 1897.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "e86393c4-4284-4101-a956-02308f91f6bd",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 476,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So this question of why does like brute force work?",
      "timestamp_start": 1898.28,
      "timestamp_end": 1902.4199999999998,
      "duration_seconds": 4.139999999999873
    },
    {
      "id": "77aefc0a-3f97-4fe1-b72c-c9a779086186",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 477,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "How does this sort of like extremely large models not memorize?",
      "timestamp_start": 1902.4799999999998,
      "timestamp_end": 1908.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.760000000000218
    },
    {
      "id": "c358d431-e1c6-4e2f-9652-65a2eab6b86b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 478,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and how does it generalize so well,",
      "timestamp_start": 1908.24,
      "timestamp_end": 1909.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "e629b87b-e165-4000-99f9-9c5bc3b04a59",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 479,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "is a question I think we still haven't adequately answered.",
      "timestamp_start": 1909.52,
      "timestamp_end": 1912.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "8d7e8305-6817-4bf5-8e72-c0e113af0ec7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 480,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Most of us are still doing a lot of empirical work",
      "timestamp_start": 1914.08,
      "timestamp_end": 1916.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.240000000000009
    },
    {
      "id": "84861a7a-dfab-48ff-b215-1ac80b5766fa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 481,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and on machine learning rather than theoretical work.",
      "timestamp_start": 1916.32,
      "timestamp_end": 1919.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "de35b887-9e2a-408f-8dd9-3d5d3c1e572e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 482,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right, right, right.",
      "timestamp_start": 1920.72,
      "timestamp_end": 1921.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8399999999999181
    },
    {
      "id": "39bc3933-436e-4ab4-9b49-e893372a2f90",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 483,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think-",
      "timestamp_start": 1923.38,
      "timestamp_end": 1924.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8799999999998818
    },
    {
      "id": "dabbb376-c684-4383-9365-1118a0a09352",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 484,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What AI is doing?",
      "timestamp_start": 1924.26,
      "timestamp_end": 1925.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3800000000001091
    },
    {
      "id": "20682a67-fbd0-4a42-b86d-530fba97682e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 485,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I know that as well, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 1925.64,
      "timestamp_end": 1926.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "9e7cf744-92f3-4290-b4f3-3e3cddea1004",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 486,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like we have these black boxes,",
      "timestamp_start": 1926.84,
      "timestamp_end": 1929,
      "duration_seconds": 2.160000000000082
    },
    {
      "id": "8a5ed814-49f1-4e70-ac5a-65f7e80e086c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 487,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "we don't know how these work in terms of",
      "timestamp_start": 1929,
      "timestamp_end": 1931.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6800000000000637
    },
    {
      "id": "aa845a06-1eeb-40c1-af6a-2bbfebfdc2e2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 488,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "why a certain thing was generated.",
      "timestamp_start": 1933.78,
      "timestamp_end": 1936.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.880000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "83f22fba-9111-4514-8ea1-25e03ef9e668",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 489,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Why did this word get generated after this context?",
