      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "at scale, try to figure out what are the different parts of this model and how to amplify it.",
      "timestamp_start": 2074.58,
      "timestamp_end": 2082.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.880000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "48c5e282-d1aa-4a5b-bea8-bbd5d7941a36",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 531,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So we have made some progress in interpretability.",
      "timestamp_start": 2082.46,
