      "sequence_number": 535,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's amazing that it kind of worked out that way.",
      "timestamp_start": 2101.42,
      "timestamp_end": 2103.7799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3599999999996726
    },
    {
      "id": "5fcc7cc6-b270-46f2-9326-6af1d0a65fef",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 536,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, because it's all bottom up, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 2104.58,
      "timestamp_end": 2107.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5
    },
    {
      "id": "5ab0eabc-690e-4d78-a846-5a05de474494",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 537,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We are not engineering this.",
      "timestamp_start": 2107.08,
      "timestamp_end": 2108.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "1fcd0601-3623-4022-a767-fc13f6b5c490",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 538,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's like this is emergent.",
      "timestamp_start": 2108.74,
      "timestamp_end": 2110.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8200000000001637
    },
    {
      "id": "8f40e294-414f-433c-8f86-89345abe6494",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 539,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's emergent phenomena where it turns out that this is how the black box ends up configurizing",
      "timestamp_start": 2110.56,
      "timestamp_end": 2116.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.079999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "c590a2ca-5aa3-48c9-9ae1-0ed935de7705",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
