    },
    {
      "id": "6062d5f3-367b-4d0b-97f6-7c117feafb29",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 568,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So let's bring it back to safety now.",
      "timestamp_start": 2222.98,
      "timestamp_end": 2225.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "8a07f556-336c-42e8-bf96-2999e386a29a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 569,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Now we've understood these black boxes.",
      "timestamp_start": 2225.5,
      "timestamp_end": 2227.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.099999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "4b33ef3e-b53c-4ee3-a50b-e2fd5d4c8ad1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 570,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What is AI alignment?",
      "timestamp_start": 2228.2,
      "timestamp_end": 2229.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "54697f7a-1a82-4d3b-b6ce-77556c74aadb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 571,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What is AI safety?",
      "timestamp_start": 2229.64,
      "timestamp_end": 2230.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 1.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "b28041e6-3003-4149-8ca6-31b6984d8bc9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 572,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What is the kind of work that you do?",
      "timestamp_start": 2230.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2232.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "e70c7d20-e0dc-4fe1-8f33-dc6bbb61c1e3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 573,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right.",
      "timestamp_start": 2234.3399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2234.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.3000000000001819
    },
    {
      "id": "a92f1917-d640-4ca9-9ff6-0d784bbfaa70",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 574,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right.",
      "timestamp_start": 2234.64,
      "timestamp_end": 2234.9399999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 0.29999999999972715
    },
    {
      "id": "f09fac19-d4f0-4f7a-9176-dac4cb71808a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 575,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I think the main area I'm interested in is, I think it's called agent",
      "timestamp_start": 2235.2999999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2241.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.680000000000291
    },
    {
      "id": "ba96ae99-46c1-4e13-905d-480d4347f169",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 576,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "foundations, which is setting up the foundation for what these words mean.",
      "timestamp_start": 2241.98,
      "timestamp_end": 2250.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2199999999998
    },
    {
      "id": "db2bdb21-cfea-4118-bb90-ea46d7d41dbc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 577,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because you might see people using these words like alignment and safety, ethics.",
      "timestamp_start": 2250.2,
      "timestamp_end": 2256.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.120000000000346
    },
    {
      "id": "ed963f51-5e2e-4262-9aab-2f467d6794f8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 578,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And we all assume that we are on the same page when you use a certain word.",
      "timestamp_start": 2256.32,
      "timestamp_end": 2260.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "154a2a98-a776-40ad-afa7-26580af01d23",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 579,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But I don't think that's true because we clearly see intelligent people disagreeing",
      "timestamp_start": 2260.52,
      "timestamp_end": 2263.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "eea33ce2-775c-4249-97e9-61f76ba75b99",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 580,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "on what to do about AI.",
      "timestamp_start": 2263.86,
      "timestamp_end": 2265.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6399999999998727
    },
    {
      "id": "1d409a6d-7ab1-4a0c-8f57-9a55018bfba0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 581,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And some of them might be in bad faith, and they have incentives to misrepresent",
      "timestamp_start": 2265.5,
      "timestamp_end": 2270.7400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2400000000002365
    },
    {
      "id": "002ba194-98d8-4811-bd74-8cbb3f9abda8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 582,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "their true beliefs.",
      "timestamp_start": 2270.74,
      "timestamp_end": 2272,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2600000000002183
    },
    {
      "id": "920830b8-8eb5-4003-ad89-7da7024604c7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 583,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But on the whole, I really feel like we haven't reached a clear idea of what these words mean.",
      "timestamp_start": 2272,
      "timestamp_end": 2279.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "3b718959-7078-4956-8b92-37bb8233127f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 584,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So a little bit more.",
      "timestamp_start": 2279.12,
      "timestamp_end": 2280.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "9ac87b12-51fc-48fa-b80d-364b755e6124",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 585,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, I'm sure I'll give you a few links to put on the bottom of the YouTube link because",
      "timestamp_start": 2282.74,
      "timestamp_end": 2286.9799999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 4.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "bbf2eceb-3cbb-49ba-bf17-43fc320a3f5c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 586,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I don't think I can do justice to any of these questions.",
      "timestamp_start": 2286.9799999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2290.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1400000000003274
    },
    {
      "id": "292aa3f9-bb51-498f-9033-d0f7bc070c7c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 587,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But I think alignment means something like when we are automating tasks, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 2290.12,
      "timestamp_end": 2297.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "93f292db-6224-4061-ba28-a683d848c40e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 588,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "like when you start using AI systems for tasks,",
      "timestamp_start": 2297.24,
      "timestamp_end": 2300.8999999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "96fd398a-6c9c-4c4b-bfd2-9e0fc599b9d9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 589,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "you are giving up your agency,",
      "timestamp_start": 2300.8999999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2302.4599999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "ac2ebfe6-9033-4147-9904-0179c2cf04bc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 590,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "your ability to control the future.",
      "timestamp_start": 2302.4599999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2305.3599999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.900000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "49757e74-bdd5-47c0-8719-fe2e031778fe",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 591,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So one possible way this might look like is",
      "timestamp_start": 2305.3599999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2308.8799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 3.519999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "4377939a-c24c-44c5-8a1d-36efb5b359e4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 592,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "you have automated systems that decide who gets loans,",
      "timestamp_start": 2308.8799999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2312.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.200000000000273
    },
    {
      "id": "9cbd7e21-988a-42d4-a864-18ed26ffa2d0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 593,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "how voting happens or how policy decisions are made,",
      "timestamp_start": 2312.08,
      "timestamp_end": 2315.3399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "d6b02d22-7618-470e-981f-abc5dcb8c56c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 594,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "how education made, how all the pictures and books",
      "timestamp_start": 2315.3399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2319.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "3d7b9b81-b9ce-4b7b-b24b-b2ed60963235",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 595,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and even the content in books written by AI systems.",
      "timestamp_start": 2319.14,
      "timestamp_end": 2321.3999999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "9f7979ca-cc9b-4a29-8edd-036bef8c1169",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 596,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So systems.",
      "timestamp_start": 2321.3999999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2322.4599999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "bf93544d-f7c8-4038-b649-08e5a527bfe4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 597,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So slowly, slowly, slowly, it'll be harder and harder",
      "timestamp_start": 2322.4599999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2324.7799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3200000000001637
    },
    {
      "id": "81a5dcde-8295-4db8-a314-2e91bc6025c1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 598,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "to affect each of us will lose control over what world we live in.",
      "timestamp_start": 2324.78,
      "timestamp_end": 2331.5600000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "956bc5e2-f30e-4a4b-a0cf-5603a1ffe8f3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 599,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And it's like we get so dependent on electricity",
      "timestamp_start": 2331.5600000000004,
      "timestamp_end": 2333.6600000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 2.099999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "60f3ec18-1a15-4db4-8240-f69ab174be80",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 600,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "that we can't switch it off.",
      "timestamp_start": 2333.6600000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 2334.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "150592d9-a54e-43a0-b3fd-3e70904bd6e1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 601,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So we can reach a point where the human values are things",
      "timestamp_start": 2334.92,
      "timestamp_end": 2338.5400000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6200000000003456
    },
    {
      "id": "c230639a-0e95-4ae2-a41c-9a1e3eca23be",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 602,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "that we care about.",
      "timestamp_start": 2338.5400000000004,
      "timestamp_end": 2339.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "dc3a35c7-9a7d-4277-a563-956bb181c125",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 603,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like we supposedly care about everyone having food",
      "timestamp_start": 2339.3,
      "timestamp_end": 2345.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.980000000000018
    },
    {
      "id": "8eb2ae98-8cb4-4e7f-b8e8-31cb768e8107",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 604,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and having health care and having education and things",
      "timestamp_start": 2345.28,
      "timestamp_end": 2347.7200000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4400000000000546
    },
    {
      "id": "29da4659-44e8-47fd-b955-4be4a1b3d311",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 605,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "like that.",
      "timestamp_start": 2347.7200000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 2348.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7399999999997817
    },
    {
      "id": "64f05174-c08a-48b3-990d-427868a825d5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 606,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But we're already seeing a misalignment",
      "timestamp_start": 2348.46,
      "timestamp_end": 2350.7000000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2400000000002365
    },
    {
      "id": "9175883d-3358-416b-a265-73a359b22fc3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 607,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "where capitalism is kind of optimizing for more consumption, more production.",
      "timestamp_start": 2350.7,
      "timestamp_end": 2356.9399999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 6.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "4d034a02-edfe-4e07-918f-d2e3bc9da146",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 608,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And so the government and capitalistic forces are looking for a different future where the",
      "timestamp_start": 2356.9399999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2364.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "1467239f-20d9-471c-8b73-a990e8ae0bc0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 609,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "egregore or the system's goals are being met. It is living in a world where GDP is growing.",
      "timestamp_start": 2364.7799999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 2372.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.440000000000055
    },
    {
      "id": "46883a52-3817-4e80-8aa7-bef7080e9bb1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 610,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "GDP is going up, growth is going up. But human values are not being optimized for.",
      "timestamp_start": 2372.22,
      "timestamp_end": 2376.3799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "b402c4ee-cf15-4387-b20d-37a023c9004d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 611,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "If you look from the point of view of our deepest values of having free time, having the bandwidth to enjoy with our family, to even have families, to have children, to spend time dating someone that we like, we are failing in so many ways.",
      "timestamp_start": 2376.38,
      "timestamp_end": 2391.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.659999999999854
    },
    {
      "id": "e0e78074-e0c6-465c-85bb-6fd47ade0532",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 612,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So we have already seen ways in which recommendation systems are not optimizing our human values.",
      "timestamp_start": 2391.04,
      "timestamp_end": 2397,
      "duration_seconds": 5.960000000000036
    },
    {
      "id": "b080a1c2-8d8c-44c8-9d93-f9e749614064",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 613,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We are spending time addicted to our reels and we are spending time increasing watch time.",
      "timestamp_start": 2397.1,
      "timestamp_end": 2401.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.820000000000164
    },
    {
      "id": "1226d29e-94ab-4b83-b55d-bebeb0e25cf9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 614,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So from the perspective of the economic system, you are increasing shareholder value, you are increasing the revenue, you are increasing watch time.",
      "timestamp_start": 2401.92,
      "timestamp_end": 2409.2200000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 7.300000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "6d43767d-595a-40c2-b151-a786b8f66a9e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 615,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Editors are happy, but human values are suffering.",
      "timestamp_start": 2409.7200000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 2412.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7199999999998
    },
    {
      "id": "786eb971-d7a1-424a-a921-f44e3514d202",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 616,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So the question is now, how do you align these systems?",
      "timestamp_start": 2412.84,
      "timestamp_end": 2416.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "7e61a49e-c0af-423c-9981-12ea34f80f1a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 617,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think it's like in MacBook, if I do this, it becomes like a big firework will happen.",
      "timestamp_start": 2417.66,
      "timestamp_end": 2423.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.200000000000273
    },
    {
      "id": "55b0ba1c-1668-4f57-bbd6-bb8b73a45b37",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 618,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But yeah, so the word alignment, I would say is about designing AI systems such that human",
      "timestamp_start": 2423.86,
      "timestamp_end": 2432.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.400000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "d63b9c66-6f53-465a-b5fe-d09bd640d182",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 619,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "values are embedded inside the algorithm.",
      "timestamp_start": 2432.26,
      "timestamp_end": 2435.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd7ceec-73aa-4c15-ab76-a6cee5414d04",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 620,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So this black box should no longer be optimizing for some weird alien values that we don't care",
      "timestamp_start": 2435.46,
      "timestamp_end": 2440.7000000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2400000000002365
    },
    {
      "id": "d95bbacd-2a34-4eab-9a19-44e9aaae8486",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 621,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "about.",
      "timestamp_start": 2440.7000000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 2441.7000000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3f023cb2-8341-40d5-97bf-d86bc6af498c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 622,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It could optimize for human values that we all can converge and agree about.",
      "timestamp_start": 2441.7000000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 2446.7400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 5.039999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "f148d382-65df-4835-8083-5d761aa5216c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 623,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "This makes sense.",
      "timestamp_start": 2446.7400000000002,
      "timestamp_end": 2447.7400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ad5c5777-f4e0-48cd-9fa4-514db7913d77",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 624,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "timestamp_start": 2447.7400000000002,
      "timestamp_end": 2448.7400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4d70a151-630f-45bd-a214-526d73221542",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 625,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And I think what the human values are, that's again a point of contention.",
      "timestamp_start": 2448.74,
      "timestamp_end": 2455.9199999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 7.179999999999836
    },
    {
      "id": "475301a1-ea92-43c0-a04b-fb0b5a3ba51d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 626,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right?",
      "timestamp_start": 2455.9199999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2456.9199999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "43efbf62-1e25-486e-9d33-60d709f7f806",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 627,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Who decides these values?",
      "timestamp_start": 2456.9199999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2458.9199999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "fd264f4d-5043-4a4b-bdce-a293b9af9d2d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 628,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, a lot of people.",
      "timestamp_start": 2458.9199999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2460.9199999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "1a8621e9-df35-477a-9250-0fc1dd8ec59f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 629,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think AI ethics, a lot of the people who are worried about that would say that right",
      "timestamp_start": 2460.9199999999996,
      "timestamp_end": 2464.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "c7f3e144-8cab-46b9-b398-f25bc2bf4265",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 630,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "now, it's a small bubble of Silicon Valley or STEM bros who are in control of designing",
      "timestamp_start": 2464.7,
      "timestamp_end": 2472.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.440000000000055
    },
    {
      "id": "8c6c851f-d0d0-4bee-bef1-6f3a38601a88",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 631,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "these and creating these systems.",
      "timestamp_start": 2472.14,
      "timestamp_end": 2474.2599999999998,
      "duration_seconds": 2.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "5a82d917-26e1-4ad6-9fe9-1c243073625a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 632,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So their values are the ones that are being embedded into these systems.",
      "timestamp_start": 2474.2599999999998,
      "timestamp_end": 2478.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.320000000000164
    },
    {
      "id": "12e6e1b3-e070-4e98-abfb-c464bad35ae1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 633,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And we don't even have like a type signature or a way to really condense and reify or explicitly",
      "timestamp_start": 2478.58,
      "timestamp_end": 2488.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.900000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "8e2723c5-d710-4657-9c93-5195f17943a7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 634,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "state what these values are.",
      "timestamp_start": 2488.48,
      "timestamp_end": 2491.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "b535b7b6-49ab-4b2b-bbd7-4c9b20ca903f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 635,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "At this point, at least, I'm like, even if we don't all agree on exactly what the values",
      "timestamp_start": 2491.04,
      "timestamp_end": 2495.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.039999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "3be236ad-cead-477e-8d34-67037b380934",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 636,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "are, we all agree that some things are not good.",
      "timestamp_start": 2495.08,
      "timestamp_end": 2497.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "85958ef7-c5f9-4a68-a0e3-4ca697afb197",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 637,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like we are failing so badly that I would be okay pushing it towards the space of our",
      "timestamp_start": 2497.42,
      "timestamp_end": 2502.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "id": "c2022451-4a9c-4023-8536-2cd61e97bf86",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 638,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "values, even if we don't exactly hit the right point.",
      "timestamp_start": 2502.92,
      "timestamp_end": 2505.7799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8599999999996726
    },
    {
      "id": "251d99cd-b8c8-4e08-ab4b-64097bf28d33",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 639,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We can disagree on the specifics, but we all agree on the broad details that we don't want",
      "timestamp_start": 2505.78,
      "timestamp_end": 2511.0600000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "187f2f13-0be6-449a-8eea-aa2c2da35245",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 640,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "everyone to not have health care.",
      "timestamp_start": 2511.0600000000004,
      "timestamp_end": 2513.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8399999999996908
    },
    {
      "id": "096a752f-453e-41b4-99cf-6dbc2299a075",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 641,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like the level to which we can fail, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 2513.9,
      "timestamp_end": 2516,
      "duration_seconds": 2.099999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "51640051-c260-4548-bbdb-adec234f0002",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 642,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Where people don't have the right to appeal or freedom of speech or right to the free",
      "timestamp_start": 2516,
      "timestamp_end": 2522.0400000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 6.040000000000418
    },
    {
      "id": "317bd7ca-6232-40f8-9245-7bf2ca40a9a9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 643,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and fair trial.",
      "timestamp_start": 2522.0400000000004,
      "timestamp_end": 2523.0400000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fe8b4b50-332c-4c24-ade2-044147c3b7e3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 644,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "There are some core fundamental values that I think almost 99% of us will agree that no",
      "timestamp_start": 2523.0400000000004,
      "timestamp_end": 2528.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.419999999999618
    },
    {
      "id": "b904d4d0-1711-4fa6-87bd-a482260c85f1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
