      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I think both extremes are kind of going into an extreme viewpoint.",
      "timestamp_start": 3103.06,
      "timestamp_end": 3107.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.679999999999836
    },
    {
      "id": "6d2c144d-6941-4cd7-855c-01a56c3a450f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 801,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And the reason I like life theory is because what Sahil from what I understand is trying to do is take the,",
      "timestamp_start": 3107.74,
      "timestamp_end": 3113.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.400000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "1c72d1af-5978-487f-984d-4f170f15880f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 802,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "take the middle ground here where let's consider that we end up actually.",
      "timestamp_start": 3113.14,
      "timestamp_end": 3118.8999999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "cd14db9d-133d-4b55-869f-2137b5db0bd7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 803,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, again, I feel like I'm at this point, I feel very unconfident about what I'm saying.",
      "timestamp_start": 3118.9,
      "timestamp_end": 3126.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.139999999999873
    },
    {
      "id": "77a65580-0398-404d-a08a-79d8247c2c50",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 804,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I feel like, I don't know what Sahil is talking about, but I think, okay, completely what I",
      "timestamp_start": 3126.04,
      "timestamp_end": 3129.6600000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6200000000003456
    },
    {
      "id": "5556a9a3-231f-4aaa-9177-9c0c7d1bb3e1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 805,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "think.",
      "timestamp_start": 3129.6600000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 3130.6600000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bf4b8ef8-8a76-41d8-aa2c-a27d38b0c85f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 806,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "My view is that, okay, there's a possible world in which all the tokens that we're trading",
      "timestamp_start": 3130.6600000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 3136.2400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 5.579999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "7b5e180c-bb55-4b04-98a3-8db4b5124adc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 807,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "on, like we talked about this black box learning on all the data, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 3136.2400000000002,
      "timestamp_end": 3139.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3399999999996908
    },
    {
      "id": "2df99141-6159-46ef-9cd1-7afd97a367f6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 808,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We have a lot of IQ 100, IQ 110, IQ 120.",
      "timestamp_start": 3139.58,
      "timestamp_end": 3143.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "b546c418-f009-4189-b148-0325e783970a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 809,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So most of the texts written on the internet is by average people or maybe some smart people,",
      "timestamp_start": 3143.38,
      "timestamp_end": 3147.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "8be0bb31-14ef-4de2-b0b2-ca6689085cd8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 810,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But the more and more you get the AI towards trying to solve original problems and everything,",
      "timestamp_start": 3147.58,
      "timestamp_end": 3151.7599999999998,
      "duration_seconds": 4.179999999999836
    },
    {
      "id": "68b9c12f-2733-4e3b-8997-40586d3eea4e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 811,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "there isn't a lot of content on the internet.",
      "timestamp_start": 3151.7599999999998,
      "timestamp_end": 3154.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "54428461-c7c9-4361-90ed-6f238994f2e4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 812,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So what we are feeding this machine is mostly getting scarcer and scarcer the more and more",
      "timestamp_start": 3154.22,
      "timestamp_end": 3159.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.860000000000127
    },
    {
      "id": "3f43796c-58e4-4d30-a745-8dd03274a40f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 813,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "you get into these edge cases.",
      "timestamp_start": 3159.08,
      "timestamp_end": 3162,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9200000000000728
    },
    {
      "id": "1cc1be76-c479-425c-b77f-168e75f5fb26",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 814,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I agree that AI will solve problems in domains where you can simulate the data.",
      "timestamp_start": 3162,
      "timestamp_end": 3167.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.400000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "a53fddda-59ef-4daa-9ba5-49d21191635b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 815,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You can simulate programming, you can simulate mathematics, you can do proof theorems, you",
      "timestamp_start": 3167.4,
      "timestamp_end": 3172.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.839999999999691
    },
    {
      "id": "2b025ef4-a2d0-4d31-9cc2-5c44f76b4129",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 816,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "can run the code in a virtual machine.",
      "timestamp_start": 3172.24,
      "timestamp_end": 3175.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4200000000000728
    },
    {
      "id": "c233c14b-bbcd-4d98-bc51-60f927d78547",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 817,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So in those domains, I think we are going to hit super intelligence pretty soon.",
      "timestamp_start": 3175.66,
      "timestamp_end": 3180.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.760000000000218
    },
    {
      "id": "b35b0807-c4d7-494e-880a-7ea505acdb9e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 818,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But to solve problems in domains, you cannot simulate, you cannot generate endless levels",
      "timestamp_start": 3180.42,
      "timestamp_end": 3186.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.739999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "d81669e6-698c-4588-beb9-a6b17d0dff46",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 819,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "of synthetic data.",
      "timestamp_start": 3186.16,
      "timestamp_end": 3187.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fccbcec2-2625-46f5-84e4-8a325925a7f6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 820,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We might hit a roadblock.",
      "timestamp_start": 3187.16,
      "timestamp_end": 3188.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3800000000001091
    },
    {
      "id": "b70df0d3-63d8-4ef2-a44a-64be34e24725",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 821,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We might end up hitting a point where you can't arbitrarily get like super intelligence.",
      "timestamp_start": 3188.54,
      "timestamp_end": 3196.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5
    },
    {
      "id": "be8b507e-e68d-47f6-80f8-09d0c1aa72fa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 822,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Now in that world, we won't have ASI.",
      "timestamp_start": 3196.04,
      "timestamp_end": 3198.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "7e5b018b-238b-41f2-a530-cca5e2b85ee3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 823,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We will have a general intelligence, but it will be available for cheap because what Sam",
      "timestamp_start": 3198.42,
      "timestamp_end": 3203.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "30797a56-182d-4a16-9fef-9096954249f0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 824,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Altman is doing with his investments in nuclear power and building more data centers and batteries",
      "timestamp_start": 3203.18,
      "timestamp_end": 3208.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "07323ec1-921d-47d9-9e04-9b4641f682e1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 825,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and things like the competition for making inference cheaper with more specialized grok",
      "timestamp_start": 3208.98,
      "timestamp_end": 3216.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.099999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "cb0f4c15-56de-4e1d-82ae-d7c48510b1cf",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 826,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "circuits and hardware and everything means that we're going to live in a world where",
      "timestamp_start": 3216.08,
      "timestamp_end": 3220.3399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "0459a860-499f-4c36-9f98-3a261d030e4c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 827,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "the marginal value of intelligence is really small.",
      "timestamp_start": 3220.3399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 3222.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6400000000003274
    },
    {
      "id": "1375004c-551b-4c17-b098-9178aa419cb0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 828,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The marginal value of energy is very small.",
      "timestamp_start": 3222.98,
      "timestamp_end": 3225.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.699999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "44517a3b-08bb-49cd-afee-c810e854b12d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 829,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So the question of life theory is kind of like trying to talk about that world.",
      "timestamp_start": 3225.68,
      "timestamp_end": 3232.9199999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 7.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "79dadd78-e12f-425e-849c-ed197e1ec13b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 830,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "How can you, how, how weird will this world be?",
      "timestamp_start": 3232.92,
      "timestamp_end": 3235.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6799999999998363
    },
    {
      "id": "5a59e594-51fe-4963-839e-e2562185eb2f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 831,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because the world will not be dystopian or utopian, or it won't look.",
      "timestamp_start": 3235.62,
      "timestamp_end": 3240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "d156d299-a34f-43af-9e8e-9dcdd6404c12",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 832,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's like trying to explain today's world to someone a hundred years ago, a thousand",
      "timestamp_start": 3240.64,
      "timestamp_end": 3243.6800000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0400000000004184
    },
    {
      "id": "f64986fc-87d2-4740-bd77-a7d6d9dee3bf",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 833,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "years ago, might be very hard to map things in our current world to concepts in their",
      "timestamp_start": 3243.6800000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 3248.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.419999999999618
    },
    {
      "id": "f4d92b3b-d10c-46e1-a7a4-ba8a4dacc8b1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 834,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "world. Does it make sense?",
      "timestamp_start": 3248.1,
      "timestamp_end": 3250.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "a34c5f4e-bca9-46b3-88ad-6089897902d2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 835,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So, so life theory is kind of like building tools and, uh, and the, the metaphysics",
      "timestamp_start": 3250.48,
      "timestamp_end": 3258.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "0aeaa59c-cecd-4a06-9930-7c67398f61fb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 836,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and theory for a world where moderate intelligence is available at scale.",
      "timestamp_start": 3258.28,
      "timestamp_end": 3262.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.319999999999709
    },
    {
      "id": "a263dd42-0d2f-407e-aece-a47274fcae12",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 837,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think that's the kind of like a basic idea of life theory.",
      "timestamp_start": 3262.92,
      "timestamp_end": 3266.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "9a2064a3-3d30-4cb4-b547-d8abc65174ff",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 838,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right.",
      "timestamp_start": 3266.76,
      "timestamp_end": 3267.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.5399999999999636
    },
    {
