      "duration_seconds": 1.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "d1c707d6-5fbb-48cd-a819-a021609e5f54",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 849,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And I don't think it'll be too far or too much of a stretch to say these intelligent",
      "timestamp_start": 3294.62,
      "timestamp_end": 3302.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.559999999999945
    },
    {
      "id": "3d8f078a-81d2-4346-8db2-e3bb6967df3d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 850,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "systems will be available for really cheap in the coming years, in the near future.",
      "timestamp_start": 3302.18,
      "timestamp_end": 3307.8999999999996,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7199999999998
    },
    {
      "id": "5667ad03-6618-41cb-b30b-655f1ee0e45f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 851,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "timestamp_start": 3308.14,
      "timestamp_end": 3308.3399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 0.1999999999998181
    },
    {
      "id": "bdcd3171-b757-4f90-97dc-98aac204d414",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 852,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because instead of like, you can have distilled models that are actually for your, if you",
      "timestamp_start": 3308.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 3313.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "72c3e639-bc2b-4bc0-bf46-56d4434fc1db",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 853,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "only want a bot for doing calendar management or for handling your voice transcription,",
      "timestamp_start": 3313.12,
      "timestamp_end": 3317.8799999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "53d039da-eadc-4bda-ac33-335abdf107fb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 854,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "you can have whisper or certain more more specialized models that can run on your laptop",
      "timestamp_start": 3317.88,
      "timestamp_end": 3323.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "9bea4b97-d9ec-412a-8a49-af93860fb851",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 855,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "locally or which can run on specialized hardware like people are already releasing pendants and",
      "timestamp_start": 3323.48,
      "timestamp_end": 3328.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.420000000000073
    },
    {
      "id": "5278b4e1-398a-41c8-95d9-3a5e1e4f6771",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 856,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "so we're going to be seeing a world where recording is cheap storage is cheap retrieval is cheap so",
      "timestamp_start": 3328.9,
      "timestamp_end": 3335.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2199999999998
    },
    {
      "id": "66333576-0dba-47f0-9091-1f716ea530c3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 857,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "we have like infinite information information is no longer the bottleneck so that's why we use the",
      "timestamp_start": 3335.12,
      "timestamp_end": 3340.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.180000000000291
    },
    {
      "id": "850892db-c6ed-43d6-8a94-8ecb946075b5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 858,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "word high actuation spaces because we have already seen this sort of a transition happening in the",
      "timestamp_start": 3340.3,
      "timestamp_end": 3346.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.019999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "f590164e-b115-4296-8944-62a96c816b26",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 859,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "from the past to the future, where in the past, for example, color was a low actuation space.",
      "timestamp_start": 3346.32,
      "timestamp_end": 3351.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.960000000000036
    },
    {
      "id": "9768a592-70ae-41f0-8c9d-82568453b66e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 860,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "When I say low actuation, I mean that to make the color purple, you need to actually take",
      "timestamp_start": 3351.28,
      "timestamp_end": 3355.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.579999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "0a97833c-0c60-45de-b8c2-e34a6273b3fc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 861,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "snails and crush them.",
      "timestamp_start": 3355.86,
      "timestamp_end": 3357.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "9fe0cc9b-36d8-4daa-a55b-7fcb5aee85ae",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 862,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And so only kings could afford to paint their cloaks with the color purple.",
      "timestamp_start": 3357.92,
      "timestamp_end": 3361.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4400000000000546
    },
    {
      "id": "bd274b7c-accc-4d8f-8fa6-3d03fa28e660",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 863,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So purple became associated with the royal aura.",
      "timestamp_start": 3361.36,
      "timestamp_end": 3366.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.920000000000073
    },
    {
      "id": "c8a2fcc2-d95b-4e19-9266-db92c5f8820d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 864,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But then now we can use color very cheaply.",
      "timestamp_start": 3366.28,
      "timestamp_end": 3368.6600000000003,
      "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "d35cc76b-dfdd-4c03-b4a2-30bcb41fdc7b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 865,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's a high actuation space.",
      "timestamp_start": 3368.6600000000003,
      "timestamp_end": 3370.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7599999999997635
    },
    {
      "id": "da195ebb-db7f-4ada-9383-4491a3716f0f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 866,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's easy and the bottleneck is no longer the causal constraint.",
      "timestamp_start": 3370.42,
      "timestamp_end": 3373.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.019999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "d82f9194-8191-4b47-b879-458826df86ec",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 867,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "When I say the causal constraints, I mean there is no law of physics that says you cannot",
      "timestamp_start": 3373.44,
      "timestamp_end": 3378.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.320000000000164
    },
    {
      "id": "1c4a6eaa-7bd5-47ee-b6a8-67d6d7d34f3d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 868,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "use multicolored thing in the current screen right now.",
      "timestamp_start": 3378.76,
      "timestamp_end": 3382.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "4bf5ad4f-dbe1-411a-9674-745ce9750cfa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 869,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So when you're on YouTube watching this video, you might see that we're using predictable",
      "timestamp_start": 3382.32,
      "timestamp_end": 3386.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7799999999997453
    },
    {
      "id": "7c5c9a50-188b-4df2-ba7b-a0df56a0e34f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 870,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "palettes.",
      "timestamp_start": 3386.1,
      "timestamp_end": 3387.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c66ed9a4-7053-437e-bb3c-f157b04df785",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 871,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We have a certain color palette the designers have picked.",
      "timestamp_start": 3387.1,
      "timestamp_end": 3389.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "400b0efc-bb06-4498-84f2-e22f6f8e1ae2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 872,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It is not like a limitation of color that is stopping them from using other colors.",
      "timestamp_start": 3389.48,
      "timestamp_end": 3394.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.880000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "e34f9bc0-09b6-4fab-baaa-b169b8c24120",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 873,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's a teelic constraint.",
      "timestamp_start": 3394.36,
      "timestamp_end": 3395.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "27f9df3e-556f-4ac6-97cf-8e96dcab06a2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 874,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "A teelic word is used here because it is a question of what outcome you want.",
      "timestamp_start": 3395.36,
      "timestamp_end": 3400.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "71b05caa-5d39-4b13-bd46-ad62e09a917e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 875,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You want to make the user feel comfortable here.",
      "timestamp_start": 3400.36,
      "timestamp_end": 3403.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c1eb0f-0f27-4dcb-8adb-9e510b73bb6c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 876,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You want to take the attention and bring them to certain parts of the webpage.",
      "timestamp_start": 3403.16,
      "timestamp_end": 3407.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9400000000000546
    },
    {
      "id": "90667bcb-a8a1-42cb-80c3-cc066aa79c83",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 877,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You want them to see that next button or the like button.",
