      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 993,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and we have studied the same terms.",
      "timestamp_start": 3911.08,
      "timestamp_end": 3912.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "b9649757-7bee-4e1e-98cb-53bd40c24f7a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 994,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "This allows for inter-operation or communication between you and me.",
      "timestamp_start": 3912.88,
      "timestamp_end": 3916.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.059999999999945
    },
    {
      "id": "85195baa-bdf7-4567-a7e6-5cdfda2dbec9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 995,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "In the world where it's very cheap to change things, I can study maths my own way.",
      "timestamp_start": 3916.94,
      "timestamp_end": 3922.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999909
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd4a8cd-aa9b-4c11-a3bc-7efa7ff804b8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 996,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I can name things, whatever I like, and I can talk to you and have an AI in the middle",
      "timestamp_start": 3922.78,
      "timestamp_end": 3929.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.519999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "c5939d61-79e7-4d77-821a-53d79b694a9c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 997,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "that translates between my worldview and your worldview seamlessly.",
      "timestamp_start": 3929.3,
      "timestamp_end": 3934.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.039999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "bfd6118f-57d0-4d4d-8072-5e06af606cff",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 998,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I will be able to, yeah, like think of how, how much we feel frustration, right?",
      "timestamp_start": 3936.06,
      "timestamp_end": 3941.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.539999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "5d68dad6-e620-41f4-8810-ccde7e9fbebc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 999,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We can study all these definitions of sets and convex sets.",
      "timestamp_start": 3941.6,
      "timestamp_end": 3945.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.019999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "08e48abf-0b82-4a14-93ff-bb2f319179a4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And, uh, but we can actually make it more fun.",
      "timestamp_start": 3945.92,
      "timestamp_end": 3948.7999999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8799999999996544
    },
    {
      "id": "4fef32cb-83ae-4dc2-9ac1-98afcc7280d9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1001,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We can actually learn things by drawing a triangle and calling",
      "timestamp_start": 3949.04,
      "timestamp_end": 3952.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "78bdcf14-3779-45fd-bddf-128eb27548f0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1002,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "hypotenuse, whatever you like, whatever feels natural to you, whatever feels right.",
      "timestamp_start": 3952.04,
      "timestamp_end": 3955.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 3.799999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "8f931e49-797f-4db8-8302-a760df0e43b4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1003,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And then we have a lot more freedom in how we learn.",
      "timestamp_start": 3956.16,
      "timestamp_end": 3959.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.880000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "a427d585-8acf-42d1-86e9-4477e40764cf",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1004,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And imagine you want to watch Harry Potter or read Harry Potter fan fiction.",
      "timestamp_start": 3959.2799999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 3962.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4400000000000546
    },
    {
      "id": "7c154408-1979-49e2-9fdd-14ce957935f3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1005,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The version of Harry Potter that you watch will be completely fine.",
      "timestamp_start": 3963.18,
      "timestamp_end": 3966.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.200000000000273
    },
    {
      "id": "2b24ff52-dd73-4930-812a-f37d8976a917",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1006,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It will be like fine tuned for your tastes and whatever you're looking for that",
      "timestamp_start": 3967.08,
      "timestamp_end": 3970.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "62c41c25-0c3b-4161-bf1f-9d4a0766e4c9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1007,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "moment.",
      "timestamp_start": 3970.46,
      "timestamp_end": 3970.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.25999999999976353
    },
    {
      "id": "8b8c9058-edd4-4eca-9e3a-64b0e96c6683",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1008,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Maybe you're a child and you are trying, or maybe you're an adult and you're looking for motivation to follow your dreams.",
      "timestamp_start": 3970.72,
      "timestamp_end": 3976.2999999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 5.579999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "17175427-ef2d-40c9-a5f8-c8e0280024bd",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1009,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So the AI can sneak in all these insights into the media you consume.",
      "timestamp_start": 3976.66,
      "timestamp_end": 3981.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "277059e9-f775-46a3-a25e-1e67baf133b5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1010,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So the problem with living in our bubbles, which people are very worried about, we want to live in our own bubbles.",
      "timestamp_start": 3981.64,
      "timestamp_end": 3986.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.519999999999982
    },
    {
      "id": "6a413942-3e59-4010-bb4c-072c32a01683",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1011,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Each of us will have a bubble where the content we are consuming will be made, tailor made for us, but it won't be like isolated bubbles because we are able to provide inter-operation.",
      "timestamp_start": 3986.5,
      "timestamp_end": 3996.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.659999999999854
    },
    {
      "id": "825fcf34-6c6f-43d5-b555-6dab2f19bd38",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1012,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So instead of having a centralized.",
      "timestamp_start": 3996.48,
      "timestamp_end": 3998.7999999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.319999999999709
    },
    {
      "id": "e29a403d-4158-472a-a371-1022b4c5a639",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1013,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah, we can still communicate with each other and talk in our own language.",
      "timestamp_start": 3998.8,
      "timestamp_end": 4003.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "cfc2d78f-064d-4b88-95af-ea93dc20f8c5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1014,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But you're saying something like, there'll be a system in between that can translate",
      "timestamp_start": 4003.96,
      "timestamp_end": 4009.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.400000000000091
    },
    {
      "id": "e8313f86-af90-41e9-9f84-5a9e64c2119d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1015,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "between those two.",
      "timestamp_start": 4009.36,
      "timestamp_end": 4010.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "23674053-da8f-4060-93c9-93bd024b3513",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1016,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think definitely it's possible because whatever concept I'm trying to point at with",
      "timestamp_start": 4010.36,
      "timestamp_end": 4015.7400000000002,
      "duration_seconds": 5.380000000000109
    },
    {
      "id": "637e098d-3057-4f48-b045-958701e4f339",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1017,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "words or ideas, there will be something similar in your language also.",
      "timestamp_start": 4015.7400000000002,
      "timestamp_end": 4020.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.299999999999727
    },
    {
      "id": "fac4f87b-c7e9-4eea-909c-bdb14c21322f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1018,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And the language can be English or I'm talking about meaning making narrative structure also.",
      "timestamp_start": 4020.04,
      "timestamp_end": 4023.6000000000004,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5600000000004
    },
    {
      "id": "cfa8a6c1-2e4c-41b2-92d8-f59a78962d55",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1019,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Right now we both are able to become friends or become close because we have shared identity.",
      "timestamp_start": 4023.6,
      "timestamp_end": 4029.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 6.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "ee3ee3a7-c23b-45bf-b96d-1fd7d16cf3ee",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1020,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We're Indians.",
      "timestamp_start": 4029.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 4030.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7ed4ec3e-3b1b-4d95-9a10-7282162b114e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1021,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We're men.",
      "timestamp_start": 4030.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 4031.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "02227d90-664c-490f-af97-61a6002a7bfc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1022,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We have grown up as a nerd.",
      "timestamp_start": 4031.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 4034.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2800000000002
    },
    {
      "id": "cdfb8e33-1d08-4745-aa3b-8bf2c3474f91",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1023,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We have similar...",
      "timestamp_start": 4034.12,
      "timestamp_end": 4035.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d15dbef1-c98b-4b20-8340-2354aa34d23b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1024,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So we have a lot of shared values, a lot of shared experiences that allows us to relate",
      "timestamp_start": 4035.12,
      "timestamp_end": 4040.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "14babbb0-38ca-45f2-91cf-fb7e0c45155d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1025,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "to each other.",
      "timestamp_start": 4040.24,
      "timestamp_end": 4042.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.300000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "723cd84c-320d-46b6-9986-7e3b9b33a2c4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1026,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But maybe you won't be able to relate so deeply.",
      "timestamp_start": 4042.54,
      "timestamp_end": 4049.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.820000000000164
    },
    {
      "id": "6cfae7aa-fe04-4cfc-ac24-6d30dee1fcbf",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1027,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But now imagine what if we could do this for more people.",
      "timestamp_start": 4049.36,
      "timestamp_end": 4052.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.819999999999709
    },
    {
      "id": "878d39a2-98bc-444f-a09c-0f746d6e0ee1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1028,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "What if you could actually, like someone who lived a very different life compared to us,",
      "timestamp_start": 4052.18,
      "timestamp_end": 4056.8399999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "7b3b7c63-a117-459c-872f-3685c8ed0658",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1029,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "might have something in their life which maps to our life but we don't know it.",
      "timestamp_start": 4056.8399999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 4059.7999999999997,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9600000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "936c0c84-5e56-415a-a772-70a9e4ca77d7",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1030,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We don't know how to use those words.",
      "timestamp_start": 4059.7999999999997,
      "timestamp_end": 4061.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9400000000000546
    },
    {
      "id": "b05fcba8-0a2b-4fbc-960b-f7bdea3c1fb4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1031,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
