      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1130,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "running on your computer.",
      "timestamp_start": 4433.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4434.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8000000000001819
    },
    {
      "id": "bc1d6378-c454-44be-9ffc-68a60afc0085",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1131,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So a lot of the stuff that EAC people say, which I disagree with on some levels, but",
      "timestamp_start": 4434.64,
      "timestamp_end": 4439.660000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 5.020000000000437
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c0c820-fb9e-4677-9bcb-e296eb727a66",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1132,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I also agree with other levels is that you have some offense defense trade off here where",
      "timestamp_start": 4439.660000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 4445.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4399999999996
    },
    {
      "id": "328c96a9-0ff4-4e17-9473-8b8870ff2c89",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1133,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "like the reason we have WhatsApp implementing export or end-to-end encryption is because",
      "timestamp_start": 4445.1,
      "timestamp_end": 4452.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9399999999996
    },
    {
      "id": "4b53b3d3-3bdf-4d73-a13d-36a05cdcca4b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1134,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Telegram and Signal push them to offer us better alternatives. So we need a healthy competition",
      "timestamp_start": 4452.04,
      "timestamp_end": 4458.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.300000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "57c02533-0ea5-4c4f-8aa4-328536a7a4d8",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1135,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "landscape where monopolies are not able to get away with offering shoddy services.",
      "timestamp_start": 4458.34,
      "timestamp_end": 4463.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.539999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "49e2f9b6-18d9-4f96-8f5d-ead3b9e4bfdb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1136,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Correct, correct. And so what do you think about the open source AI models? Like I'm guessing you",
      "timestamp_start": 4465.1,
      "timestamp_end": 4473.860000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 8.760000000000218
    },
    {
      "id": "9ed269b9-77ee-4c71-9430-49027e3ef84b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1137,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Do you think it's a good idea?",
      "timestamp_start": 4473.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4474.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "188ff9b7-2192-4581-aae2-6eb3c7f4b01c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1138,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I don't know, but please let us know what you think about open source AI.",
      "timestamp_start": 4474.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4479.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "c7118c45-64f3-4624-9200-c6ecd63e3759",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1139,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Is it too powerful?",
      "timestamp_start": 4479.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4480.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ee2dccdf-a542-487b-925d-074f0d088045",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1140,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "timestamp_start": 4480.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4481.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f4b661f2-ded7-47e9-9a26-a14ac3c28b19",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1141,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think we haven't really talked about the, I don't know how much of the audience knows",
      "timestamp_start": 4481.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4485.179999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 3.319999999999709
    },
    {
      "id": "c6609947-f665-43e0-9a40-b0fa467b28df",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1142,
