      "duration_seconds": 2.0399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c3ddeb-5bb5-41c1-9bc2-a44e37e64659",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1157,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You also invest in real estate and stocks and some liquid cash or whatever.",
      "timestamp_start": 4535.54,
      "timestamp_end": 4540.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5600000000004
    },
    {
      "id": "c7de8d64-080f-44da-b5b0-f8321df93d0e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1158,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "This is how people with some sense will distribute their assets",
      "timestamp_start": 4540.56,
      "timestamp_end": 4544.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.519999999999527
    },
    {
      "id": "c9d918e8-4829-4bf7-857f-3c582ea63a96",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1159,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "across their investment plan.",
      "timestamp_start": 4544.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4545.820000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7400000000006912
    },
    {
      "id": "2acce4d5-b251-4754-8e00-72b40f67f45a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1160,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The same way when people ask me about open source or about the future, I often",
      "timestamp_start": 4546.68,
      "timestamp_end": 4551.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "2f4817e8-1bce-44c6-a9b1-2a76aca81556",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1161,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "try to tell them that my world model looks not like a single world, but more",
      "timestamp_start": 4551.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4556.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.100000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "a507a48a-8af7-42bd-8c2c-331f4793967b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1162,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "like a probable distribution, but I have a certain probability of the world, a",
      "timestamp_start": 4556.18,
      "timestamp_end": 4561.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "e65634d2-bed3-4902-a0c4-2c3a558467e1",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1163,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "certain way.",
      "timestamp_start": 4561.3,
      "timestamp_end": 4561.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.5399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "0130d711-1824-49c1-a16c-d9178974954e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1164,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And there are worlds in which open source is very important and there are worlds in which open source is very bad.",
      "timestamp_start": 4561.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4567.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "17ae5cd5-61fb-4423-8566-13a98124757c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1165,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And there is no easy 90% answer here.",
      "timestamp_start": 4567.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4570.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "d32a4c34-899b-426e-8291-ed3ed72c4eda",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1166,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Everything looks like 20-30% and there's a lot of confusion.",
      "timestamp_start": 4570.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4574.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "b7afbae5-30d2-40c7-9aae-8e0f7d920ade",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1167,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So if I had to paint the picture, it looks something like...",
      "timestamp_start": 4574.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4578.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "700d4d20-cde4-4ca0-a8c9-bc18a1852813",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1168,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "If scaling is the answer, if GPT...",
      "timestamp_start": 4582.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4588.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "6bbe8d7b-296d-4574-a295-a562e4110a38",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1169,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think your notetaker has left the meeting.",
      "timestamp_start": 4588.84,
      "timestamp_end": 4591.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "369757e2-b0b2-4454-b830-e712d51f7113",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1170,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's like given up on it.",
      "timestamp_start": 4591.88,
      "timestamp_end": 4593.360000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.480000000000473
    },
    {
      "id": "d40d916d-57e0-4873-82ac-a5b9c390e4fe",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1171,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's like, what are you guys talking about?",
      "timestamp_start": 4596,
      "timestamp_end": 4597.360000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.360000000000582
    },
    {
      "id": "67155d25-2d3f-4ed6-8d34-f440d2d5fe4f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1172,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So yeah, I was trying to explain my model of open source.",
      "timestamp_start": 4601.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4603.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6400000000003274
    },
    {
      "id": "93cd5d49-3062-47c3-b3b7-5b26f2f1c420",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
