      "sequence_number": 1177,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Like we're going to see marginal improvements in capabilities.",
      "timestamp_start": 4616.3,
      "timestamp_end": 4619.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4200000000000728
    },
    {
      "id": "dd62217c-454a-4ccc-a438-b38c94941b7e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1178,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "In which case that plus the fact that scaffolding or we're not going to hit",
      "timestamp_start": 4620.68,
      "timestamp_end": 4626.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "05139ece-d778-488b-9399-c94eb4d3c7bc",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1179,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "a really agentic systems that are able to have its own intrinsic motivations",
      "timestamp_start": 4627.400000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 4633,
      "duration_seconds": 5.599999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "d94f4800-29ad-43f4-9ebc-ac7077e35803",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1180,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and do long horizon planning.",
      "timestamp_start": 4633,
      "timestamp_end": 4634.320000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3200000000006185
    },
    {
      "id": "11aab3cd-f926-4fb8-9ba7-2ebeb05fe3aa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1181,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Because right now we are seeing that if you talk to any model for more than like",
      "timestamp_start": 4634.74,
      "timestamp_end": 4638.820000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 4.080000000000837
    },
    {
      "id": "056c9615-5f10-4801-885d-965c3a8a3309",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1182,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "10 or 20 conversation turns, there's some degradation of performance where your",
      "timestamp_start": 4638.820000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 4642.9400000000005,
      "duration_seconds": 4.119999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "68ab58ea-c46e-4b89-b40a-cdb61a63cf9a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1183,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "previous answers will pollute its context and it'll start contracting itself.",
      "timestamp_start": 4642.94,
      "timestamp_end": 4648.5199999999995,
      "duration_seconds": 5.579999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "f99ba6f3-bdae-4d30-8acf-e75a08220566",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1184,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "There's like a lack of integrity, but these models are confused about what it",
      "timestamp_start": 4648.5199999999995,
      "timestamp_end": 4652.0599999999995,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "6f9e6b45-1e40-4a08-9579-c699e2a096cd",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1185,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "can do, what it can't do.",
      "timestamp_start": 4652.0599999999995,
      "timestamp_end": 4653.379999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.319999999999709
    },
    {
      "id": "cf550eef-0040-44b2-8c13-31daa350195f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1186,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So there are a lot of deep problems with these models that I don't think are",
      "timestamp_start": 4653.799999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 4656.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.280000000000655
    },
    {
      "id": "00e42c2e-b3d2-40c3-b0b8-7b2f644032aa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1187,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "going to be fixed.",
      "timestamp_start": 4656.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4656.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.6599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "d327b7d6-509e-4139-9cc9-c9bb415e4ae6",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1188,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So in that world where I'm right about these things, I don't think open source",
      "timestamp_start": 4657.219999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 4660.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6400000000003274
    },
    {
      "id": "8cb29f56-af1e-486c-97cb-56bfd99778bb",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1189,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "is a big problem because open source is good because we need safety research",
      "timestamp_start": 4660.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4665.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "9859ed75-28e8-427d-ac34-8da0c6a5074d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1190,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "to be done on these models.",
      "timestamp_start": 4665.2,
      "timestamp_end": 4666.419999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2199999999993452
    },
    {
      "id": "ca099c70-9839-4612-9b13-181dcc9e930b",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1191,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We need access to these model weights to do our own research.",
      "timestamp_start": 4666.44,
      "timestamp_end": 4669.719999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2799999999997453
    },
    {
      "id": "b68d630d-b0bd-4ba8-83f0-f9ec55ce063a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1192,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And there's a big risk of centralization, ruining this entire thing where you have all the big players, trying to control the direction this is going.",
      "timestamp_start": 4669.72,
      "timestamp_end": 4681.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "216c7309-5a26-4693-8676-6238f276974f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1193,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So that's like some significant thing, but it's also a possibility that I'm wrong about this.",
      "timestamp_start": 4681.72,
      "timestamp_end": 4686.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "baddf3c1-739d-4b54-8486-d1a671fa5008",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1194,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And we are very close to the fast takeoff world, a fast takeoff meaning that they're going to be starting to see the models start improving its own training methods, its own architecture.",
      "timestamp_start": 4686.72,
      "timestamp_end": 4696.72,
      "duration_seconds": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "cce4f909-1498-4094-b809-95da8bd885a9",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1195,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "its own architecture and it's going to start writing code for itself and it'll quickly",
      "timestamp_start": 4696.72,
      "timestamp_end": 4701.4400000000005,
      "duration_seconds": 4.720000000000255
    },
    {
      "id": "9d603137-eab2-462f-83cd-9f82a3f75d44",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1196,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "become super intelligent and then it'll lose control over it'll become like an autonomous",
      "timestamp_start": 4701.4400000000005,
      "timestamp_end": 4707.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.719999999999345
    },
    {
      "id": "288e58b0-a584-48e5-b603-1939f126b3ba",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1197,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "system that we can no longer debug or control in any sense.",
      "timestamp_start": 4707.16,
      "timestamp_end": 4711.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.800000000000182
    },
    {
      "id": "c5ebfc63-113f-4767-b15e-1979154c6a91",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1198,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "In which case open source might be the reason that these companies are racing towards building",
      "timestamp_start": 4711.96,
      "timestamp_end": 4718.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "5856ab34-3569-431b-9f56-7e4326da7866",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1199,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "larger and larger models and even if the top players agree to test thoroughly before deploying",
      "timestamp_start": 4718.96,
      "timestamp_end": 4727.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.220000000000255
    },
    {
      "id": "316d59cf-7dbb-47cb-b7e1-f79e346d2d03",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1200,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "it, the open-source models will not even use it for anything they want.",
      "timestamp_start": 4727.18,
      "timestamp_end": 4731.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "c04236b1-ba4e-4e43-b391-638cc686b688",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1201,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So we're going to be seeing a lot more of bad use cases.",
      "timestamp_start": 4731.18,
      "timestamp_end": 4735.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.099999999999454
    },
    {
      "id": "2a3c334f-32a1-4449-af76-6f4c58c38b9f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1202,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So I don't know how familiar with the offense-defense asymmetry argument.",
      "timestamp_start": 4735.28,
      "timestamp_end": 4739.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "c2338984-61ec-4706-a941-f4ca3cc5b494",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1203,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Have you heard of this offense-defense asymmetry?",
      "timestamp_start": 4739.62,
      "timestamp_end": 4742.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.180000000000291
    },
    {
      "id": "5333dca6-1a90-4352-b2c1-15e857c248c4",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1204,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's harder to make a vaccine for viruses.",
      "timestamp_start": 4742.8,
      "timestamp_end": 4745.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "d76ce570-9661-46a8-93a5-841b90fce1b3",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1205,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's easier to make viruses.",
      "timestamp_start": 4745.14,
      "timestamp_end": 4747.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "83323714-98e4-423d-9637-543e35b76b35",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1206,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's harder to build buildings, easier to destroy buildings.",
      "timestamp_start": 4747.34,
      "timestamp_end": 4751.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7799999999997453
    },
    {
      "id": "90c1ec25-d335-4ff8-a385-85b816bb127c",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1207,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "It's harder to stop cyber attacks, easier to cyber attack.",
      "timestamp_start": 4751.12,
      "timestamp_end": 4753.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.619999999999891
    },
    {
      "id": "e336132c-232f-495f-8761-4bb014fa8d1d",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1208,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "You can do DDoS attacks on a lot of servers.",
      "timestamp_start": 4753.74,
      "timestamp_end": 4757.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.480000000000473
    },
    {
      "id": "77cf3b24-c3c8-4802-8052-4bebc8f3c1ff",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1209,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So once you give everyone a gun, that means everyone is unsafe because guns are easy to",
      "timestamp_start": 4757.22,
      "timestamp_end": 4762.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "e93aec42-d469-4376-9387-e44f5da42c08",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1210,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "shoot, harder to defend.",
      "timestamp_start": 4762.88,
      "timestamp_end": 4764.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8400000000001455
    },
    {
      "id": "d5a9b80a-3801-4f26-b868-99c247a7f447",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1211,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So giving everyone open source is kind of expecting that human beings are fundamentally",
      "timestamp_start": 4764.72,
      "timestamp_end": 4769.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.359999999999673
    },
    {
      "id": "f975fda9-c0eb-49ac-ab3b-23f7c22f5973",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1212,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "good.",
      "timestamp_start": 4769.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4770.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f668e1c0-445b-4c04-a888-921883ab1fbd",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1213,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And the fact is a lot of us are addicted.",
      "timestamp_start": 4770.08,
      "timestamp_end": 4772.900000000001,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8200000000006185
    },
    {
      "id": "4393bd5a-5b97-4754-9395-516e79fa124f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1214,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "A lot of us are frustrated.",
      "timestamp_start": 4772.900000000001,
      "timestamp_end": 4774.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7799999999997453
    },
    {
      "id": "93ad902e-c6e1-4468-bf9d-feb8d911919f",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1215,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "A lot of us are angry.",
      "timestamp_start": 4774.68,
      "timestamp_end": 4776.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0599999999994907
    },
    {
      "id": "ae20144e-fb26-4036-820c-aa70e47b5e41",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1216,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "The world is not a very stable place where people are good people who all want the best of humanity.",
      "timestamp_start": 4776.74,
      "timestamp_end": 4781.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "94d9ae55-72d0-428e-a2f7-083945846381",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1217,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "So empowering each individual means more chaos and more uncertainty and more risks in some sense.",
      "timestamp_start": 4782.26,
      "timestamp_end": 4788.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.239999999999782
    },
    {
      "id": "cd5613c6-c13d-4841-b7c4-23be9eb6a753",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1218,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And so it's a hard decision and I'm not in the position to decide any of these things.",
      "timestamp_start": 4788.98,
      "timestamp_end": 4796.0599999999995,
      "duration_seconds": 7.079999999999927
    },
    {
      "id": "9f9dcdf5-6462-44ed-8619-16ad994732f5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1219,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "All I can do is maybe lobby or talk about it.",
      "timestamp_start": 4796.0599999999995,
      "timestamp_end": 4798.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.100000000000364
    },
    {
      "id": "38be43bb-a2b2-4dd6-9bcc-d1eb06a7de39",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1220,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "If I had to make a decision, I would maybe release open those models only to select people like researchers.",
      "timestamp_start": 4798.7,
      "timestamp_end": 4804.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.920000000000073
    },
    {
      "id": "54296798-1b0f-4e8e-a2eb-ccf7ccf42803",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1221,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "That's my current take.",
      "timestamp_start": 4805.219999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 4806.0199999999995,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8000000000001819
    },
    {
      "id": "f230e9a1-ae5e-4a69-98a6-f0a7d55f2d29",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1222,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "At least because there is no clear fire alarm.",
      "timestamp_start": 4806.74,
      "timestamp_end": 4809.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.199999999999818
    },
    {
      "id": "274e177e-50ea-4b6c-bcd7-7a27668073a0",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1223,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "If we had a clear boundary where if we all agreed that once models can do X,",
      "timestamp_start": 4809.94,
      "timestamp_end": 4814.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.480000000000473
    },
    {
      "id": "0fb11b12-b545-4178-8b73-b33d077af850",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1224,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "then we all will agree to not distribute OpenSource models,",
      "timestamp_start": 4814.42,
      "timestamp_end": 4817.139999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.719999999999345
    },
    {
      "id": "abb10e86-57ff-46e2-88d9-50595bd24694",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1225,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "then I would be more okay with distributing LAMA 3.1.",
      "timestamp_start": 4817.139999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 4820.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1200000000008004
    },
    {
      "id": "ae806d4b-d476-4944-9566-b32ab89be0a2",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1226,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But I don't think we have all agreed on anything.",
      "timestamp_start": 4820.26,
      "timestamp_end": 4822.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "224a8f7d-780a-4424-a7e0-4e22d7815c60",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1227,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "We're going to keep pushing the goalpost further and further",
      "timestamp_start": 4822.42,
      "timestamp_end": 4825.219999999999,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7999999999992724
    },
    {
      "id": "2e918dbb-dabf-41b7-848d-2a1ee9da725a",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1228,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and at some point we'll end up fucking everyone up",
      "timestamp_start": 4825.219999999999,
      "timestamp_end": 4827.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.240000000000691
    },
    {
      "id": "75d225b4-cdfc-4efd-8f94-f144b0f6ecaa",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1229,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "and it'll be too late to undo the Ponderous box.",
      "timestamp_start": 4827.46,
      "timestamp_end": 4829.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.399999999999636
    },
    {
      "id": "35714169-811c-4ee3-bd10-55f68a114fb5",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1230,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "Once you open the box, you can't close it.",
      "timestamp_start": 4829.86,
      "timestamp_end": 4831.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.680000000000291
    },
    {
      "id": "6b92aa4f-e59d-465a-8be8-b41cb8d7c975",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1231,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "I think we should probably end it there.",
      "timestamp_start": 4831.54,
      "timestamp_end": 4838.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.039999999999964
    },
    {
      "id": "14656b54-06f1-4054-97cb-3b508a7db855",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1232,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And then continue this conversation and come back to safety and philosophical implications and things like that.",
      "timestamp_start": 4839.58,
      "timestamp_end": 4846.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1599999999998545
    },
    {
      "id": "f42c9f0e-506e-4fe7-9c39-50111b475365",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1233,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "But this was, hopefully this will intrigue people to watch our next discussion as well.",
      "timestamp_start": 4847.12,
      "timestamp_end": 4852.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "id": "31136d51-f46e-4ce7-904f-e6ce985d4282",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1234,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
      "text": "And maybe contact me because you can have this conversation on a one-on-one if you can find time on my schedule.",
      "timestamp_start": 4853.64,
      "timestamp_end": 4859.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.799999999999272
    },
    {
      "id": "65d704f5-e416-41ea-81cb-3dd8fa43a52e",
      "conversation_id": "3fc4885e-a1b3-484e-9c9f-05e51557b9ba",
      "sequence_number": 1235,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": null,
      "speaker_source": "model",
      "speaker_confidence": null,
      "speaker_revision": 0,
